	image.00F41802F3A25945.title: "Click me!"
	image.507DD939A9C764A3.title: "Click me!"
	image.5D855C931B30C076.title: "Click me!"
	image.67B836567D9E9033.title: "Click me!"
	image.6D2FB472DD615E7F.title: "Click me!"
	quest.002817692D822A05.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Relying on pure luck to find Lost Souls is slow and unreliable.&r A better approach is to empower your weapon so it can summon them on demand with the &d&lSoul Looting&r enchantment&r.&r"
		""
		"Set up an enchanting area or use an anvil to apply &d&lSoul Looting&r to your sword.&r Each level of this enchant gives a 5 percent chance to summon a Lost Soul whenever you kill an enemy, ensuring a steady flow of this valuable arcane resource&r.&r"
	]
	quest.002817692D822A05.quest_subtitle: "&l&fAcquire a sword enchanted with &d&lSoul Looting&r&l&f&r"
	quest.002817692D822A05.title: "&5&lQuest: Enchantment of the Lost"
	quest.002991E191CFEEDA.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &8&lFerrous Wroughtnaut&r is initially completely invulnerable to normal attacks.&r Its only real weakness appears when it slams its massive axe into the ground, briefly exposing its unarmored back&r.&r"
		""
		"To defeat it, stay mobile and wait for that ground‑strike animation, then quickly move behind the Wroughtnaut and hit the exposed spot before it recovers.&r Mastering this pattern lets you bring down the iron colossus and earn its valuable drops&r.&r"
	]
	quest.002991E191CFEEDA.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSlay the &8&lFerrous Wroughtnaut&r&l&f and claim its spoils&r"
	quest.002991E191CFEEDA.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Ferrous Wroughtnaut"
	quest.00E6582B6AE1D591.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lFrostmaw&r is a huge, rare boss that spawns in cold and icy biomes such as Snowy Plains.&r It is usually found asleep while clutching a valuable Ice Crystal in its hand&r.&r"
		""
		"If you get too close or strike it, the Frostmaw wakes up, swallows the Crystal, and begins a brutal assault with 250 health and multiple attacks: a claw swipe, a massive shield‑breaking slam, chilling Ice Breath, and a long‑range Ice Ball.&r Stealing the Ice Crystal before the fight stops it from using Ice Breath and Ice Ball, making the encounter much safer&r.&r"
		""
		"Slay the Frostmaw to seize its unique power and claim the Ice Crystal for yourself&r.&r"
	]
	quest.00E6582B6AE1D591.quest_subtitle: "&l&fDefeat the powerful &b&lFrostmaw&r&l&f boss in a cold biome&r"
	quest.00E6582B6AE1D591.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Frostmaw"
	quest.0133BEED6CB4E921.quest_desc: [
		""
		"To truly master the Undergarden, you need to command its metals as well as its monsters. Gather enough raw ore to craft a full storage block of each of the four key resources: &6&lCloggrum&r&f, &b&lFroststeel&r&f, &d&lUtherium&r&f, and the incredibly rare &5&lRegalium&r&f."
		""
		"Only when you hold a solid block of every ore will your collection be complete. Consider it a shining monument to just how deep you have dug into this strange realm."
	]
	quest.0133BEED6CB4E921.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCollect one block of every &6&lUndergarden ore&r&f&l"
	quest.0133BEED6CB4E921.title: "&7&lQuest: Collector's Edition"
	quest.0138509D401BD2C6.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Souls are a key, high‑power resource in the occult arts.&r There are two main ways to obtain them: the safer extraction route or the riskier hunt for Lost Souls&r.&r"
		""
		"For extraction, craft a &d&lSoul Extractor&r to pull Souls out of Soul Sand, turning it into Soulless Sand in the process.&r For the hunt, track wandering &d&lLost Souls&r; killing one drops a Soul item in White, Blue Corrupt, or Pink Enchanted variants&r.&r"
		""
		"To make hunting easier, enchant your sword with &d&lSoul Looting&r, which gives a chance per level to summon a Lost Soul whenever you kill any mob.&r Pick your preferred method and start gathering the raw essence of life itself&r.&r"
	]
	quest.0138509D401BD2C6.quest_subtitle: "&l&fAcquire a &d&lSoul item&r&l&f by extracting it or slaying a Lost Soul&r"
	quest.0138509D401BD2C6.title: "&5&lQuest: Acquiring Souls"
	quest.018FEDABB41C2FB3.quest_desc: [
		"Hidden deep within the lush &2jungles&f, you may discover the &aAbandoned Village&f — a forgotten place overtaken by roots and moss."
		"Its old huts, built with &6Straw&f and wood, now stand silent beneath the canopy of trees."
		""
		"Look closely among the ruins; piles of &dSuspicious Gravel&f lie scattered around, concealing &eancient artifacts&f and &2mysterious eggs&f waiting to be found."
		"Nature has reclaimed this village, but its secrets still whisper beneath the leaves."
	]
	quest.018FEDABB41C2FB3.quest_subtitle: "&7&oFind Structure — Abandoned Village."
	quest.018FEDABB41C2FB3.title: "&2&lQuest: The Abandoned Village"
	quest.019F5EBAA78EB59B.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fPhygs are the Aether’s adorable flying pigs, gentle yet brave enough to soar among the clouds."
		""
		"&fSaddle one up and experience the freedom of gliding across the endless skies."
	]
	quest.019F5EBAA78EB59B.quest_subtitle: "&f&lMount a &6&lPhyg&r&f"
	quest.019F5EBAA78EB59B.title: "&7&lQuest: Ride the Clouds"
	quest.01A5A7FC15864829.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&b&lCertus Quartz&r is one of the most important materials in &b&lApplied Energistics&r, it is used in nearly every crafting recipe for the mod. &b&lCertus Quartz Buds&r will grow from &b&lBudding Certus Blocks&r, much like amethyst clusters."
		""
		"- Breaking unfinished buds drops &b&lCertus Quartz Dust&r (Fortune has no effect)."
		""
		"- Breaking a &e&lfully grown cluster&r yields &e&l4 Certus Quartz Crystals&r, with Fortune increasing the amount."
		""
		"There are 4 tiers of budding certus blocks: &a&lFlawless&r, &b&lFlawed&r, &e&lChipped&r, and &c&lDamaged&r. Each time a bud grows, the budding block can degrade, except for &a&lFlawless Budding Certus&r, which lasts forever but cannot be moved or crafted."
		""
		"If a budding block degrades, you can repair it (or create new ones) by throwing it into water along with one or more &b&lCharged Certus Quartz Crystals&r."
		""
		"To speed up growth, craft and place &b&lCrystal Growth Accelerators&r around your budding block. They will greatly boost growth speed. If you lack early power, attach a &e&lWooden Crank&r to a Growth Accelerator to manually power it."
	]
	quest.01A5A7FC15864829.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain &b&lCertus Quartz Crystals&r"
	quest.01A5A7FC15864829.title: "&9&lQuest: Certus Quartz Crystals"
	quest.01BE9C003F65591A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &6&lAncient Remnant&r&f is the final and most powerful boss of the &6&lPyramid Outpost&r&f.&r This guardian can only be awakened after you have found the &6&lDesert Collar&r&f and interacted with its &8&ltomb&r&f deep within the pyramid.&r"
		""
		"This boss relies on several highly dangerous abilities to crush intruders.&r It can &d&lconfuse you&r&f by inverting your movement, slam you with its &2&ltail&r&f to create small &c&learthquakes&r&f, and use a &c&lFury mechanic&r&f that makes it stronger and more aggressive the more you hit it.&r"
		""
		"The key to victory is baiting its powerful &c&lcharge attack&r&f.&r If it misses you and crashes into a wall, that wall will crumble for a moment, leaving the Remnant exposed and vulnerable.&r When you finally defeat it, the boss drops its &d&lmusic disc&r&f, a block of &6&lAncient Metal&r&f, and the &e&lSandstorm in a Jar&r&f, an artifact that grants you the power to summon &6&ltornadoes&r&f.&r"
	]
	quest.01BE9C003F65591A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the powerful &6&lAncient Remnant&r&f&l boss of the &6&lCursed Pyramid&r&f&l"
	quest.01BE9C003F65591A.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Ancient Remnant"
	quest.0223FFD350F4CE22.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lLV Accumulator&r is a fundamental &b&lImmersive Engineering&r block used to store and manage &e&lenergy&r within your energy network. It can be connected to &b&lWire Connectors&r and &b&lWire Coils&r, allowing it to receive and send &b&lImmersive Flux (IF)&r to machines and other accumulators."
		""
		"Each face of the Accumulator can be configured using an &b&lEngineer's Hammer&r."
		""
		"- &b&lBlue&f - receive power"
		""
		"- &b&lOrange&f - send power"
		""
		"- &b&lNo plug&f - inactive"
		""
		"Sneak while using the hammer to configure the opposite face simultaneously. The &e&lLV Accumulator&r can handle up to &e&l1,536 IF/t&r per face, and connecting multiple connectors in parallel increases the total transfer rate. It is an essential component for efficient and scalable power distribution in your industrial setup."
	]
	quest.0223FFD350F4CE22.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft an &e&lLV Accumulator&r"
	quest.0223FFD350F4CE22.title: "&9&lQuest: LV Accumulator"
	quest.0258A27D9EE688BA.quest_desc: [
		"In the heart of the &aAbandoned Village&f, you’ll find roofs and walls made of a curious material — the &eStraw Block&f."
		"Crafted from &fWheat&f and &6Sticks&f, this ancient building block was once used by jungle settlers for warmth and decoration."
		""
		"Beyond its beauty, the &eStraw Block&f also serves an important role in the creation of &aNests&f, where ancient eggs can grow and hatch faster."
		"Collect some and see how the past was woven together, strand by strand."
	]
	quest.0258A27D9EE688BA.quest_subtitle: "&7&oObtain a Straw Block."
	quest.0258A27D9EE688BA.title: "&2&lQuest: The Straw Block"
	quest.02AF8AA507737889.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lRevolver&r is a versatile weapon added by &b&lImmersive Engineering&r, capable of shooting various types of cartridges with different effects. Shift right clicking with the Revolver in hand lets you load &e&lCartridges&r into its chamber for quick firing."
		""
		"Start with the basic &e&lCasull Cartridge&r, or experiment with advanced ammunition like:"
		""
		"- &f&lHigh Explosive Cartridge&f: causes explosions&r"
		""
		"- &f&lDragon's Breath Cartridge&f: fires multiple bullets and ignites targets&r"
		""
		"To craft any cartridges, you will first need an &e&lEngineer's Workbench&r. The Revolver excels at defense, combat automation, or just a bit of controlled chaos in your industrial empire."
	]
	quest.02AF8AA507737889.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &e&lRevolver&r"
	quest.02AF8AA507737889.title: "&9&lQuest: Revolver"
	quest.02D9A337FC4CDDD0.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &d&lGrimoire of Evokation&r is a rare, high‑tier spellbook said to have been crafted by ancient Evokers themselves.&r It can appear as a &c&lrare drop&r from &c&lEvokers&r or &c&lArchevokers&r, so only skilled mages willing to face these foes will ever hold one&r.&r"
		""
		"When equipped as your primary spellbook, it grants &d&l+10% Evokation Spell Power&r and &b&l+200 Max Mana&r, clearly marking you as a master of conjured fury&r.&r This unique tome comes pre‑inscribed with the following spells: Fang Strike 6, Fang Ward 4, and Summon Vex 4, giving you a complete evoker‑style toolkit from the moment you equip it&r.&r"
		""
		"Once obtained, press &b&l[V]&r to unleash its power and command the very forces once bound to the Evokers themselves&r.&r"
	]
	quest.02D9A337FC4CDDD0.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain the &d&lGrimoire of Evocation&r&l&f&r"
	quest.02D9A337FC4CDDD0.title: "&5&lQuest: Grimoire of Evocation"
	quest.03927B1AA782D02A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lCoke Oven&r is one of the first &b&lImmersive Engineering&r machines you will build. Made from &e&l27 Coke Bricks&r arranged in a 3x3x3 solid cube, it is completed by using the &b&lEngineer's Hammer&r on the center block of any face."
		""
		"Once operational, place &e&lCoal&r or a block of Coal into the left slot of its GUI. After some time, you will obtain &e&lCoal Coke&r and &e&lCreosote Oil&r, both essential resources for more advanced crafting and machines."
		""
		"You can also use &e&lWood Logs&r to produce &e&lCharcoal&r and Creosote Oil. For full automation, use &b&lHoppers&r for item input and &b&lImmersive Engineering Pumps&r to extract Creosote Oil automatically."
		""
		"It is a simple but crucial step on your journey toward &e&lSteel production&r and industrial mastery."
	]
	quest.03927B1AA782D02A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lConstruct and use a &b&lCoke Oven&r &l&fmultiblock"
	quest.03927B1AA782D02A.title: "&9&lQuest: Coke Oven"
	quest.0399F81249A0C2DA.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &f&lPriest&r is a key neutral mob tied to the Holy school of magic.&r You can find this spellcasting protector in a special Priest House structure that spawns in Plains and Taiga villages&r.&r"
		""
		"The Priest sells valuable Holy equipment and is your way to obtain the Villager Bible spell book.&r Be careful, though: the Priest defends the village, so attacking villagers or looting chests will turn them hostile and they will retaliate with powerful spells&r.&r"
	]
	quest.0399F81249A0C2DA.quest_subtitle: "&l&fLocate a &f&lPriest&r&l&f in a village and engage in trade&r"
	quest.0399F81249A0C2DA.title: "&5&lQuest: Meeting the Holy Priest"
	quest.03B2348E68799E52.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fTo tame your own &a&lMoa&r&f companion, you must first incubate a &b&lMoa Egg&r&f obtained from dungeons or adult moas."
		""
		"&fOnce hatched, the baby moa will occasionally get hungry, you will notice it when angry particles appear."
		""
		"&fFeed it &d&lAechor Petals&r&f three times to help it grow into an adult. When fully grown, you can saddle it and soar across the Aether skies."
	]
	quest.03B2348E68799E52.quest_subtitle: "&f&lIncubate a &b&lMoa Egg&r&f &luntil it hatches"
	quest.03B2348E68799E52.title: "&7&lQuest: Incubate a Moa"
	quest.04C27EE2B2DC99C9.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your path of vengeance and resurrection takes you to the ominous &8&lWitherstein Ruins&r, a special structure that appears only in Jungle biomes.&r This place is deeply tied to the dark history of Witherstein, the being who betrayed the monsters and twisted the original Wither&r.&r"
		""
		"Exploring these ruins is mandatory if you want to continue the quest to avenge Dr. Mobstein and pave the way for his eventual return.&r Tread carefully, as the forgotten structure hides many dangers alongside the secrets you seek&r.&r"
	]
	quest.04C27EE2B2DC99C9.quest_subtitle: "&l&fVisit the &8&lWitherstein Ruins&r&l&f structure located in the Jungle biome&r"
	quest.04C27EE2B2DC99C9.title: "&5&lQuest: Exploring the Witherstein Ruins"
	quest.05070D1E8086E619.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lMechanical Drill&r is a powerful &b&lCreate&r component built to &e&lbreak blocks automatically&r when supplied with &e&lrotational energy&r. It is ideal for automating &e&lore mining&r, quarry setups, and &b&lresource collection systems&r in your factory."
		""
		"When placed facing a block, the drill continuously mines it as long as it keeps spinning. Combine it with &b&lDeployers&r, &b&lBelts&r, or &b&lMechanical Pistons&r to build advanced mining contraptions and fully &b&lautomated drilling rigs&r."
		""
		"Use &a&lJEI&r to check the crafting recipe and gather all materials needed to assemble your first drill."
	]
	quest.05070D1E8086E619.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lMechanical Drill&r"
	quest.05070D1E8086E619.title: "&9&lQuest: Mechanical Drill"
	quest.050BCFA09A01B6DE.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&f&d&lAechor Petals&r&f are dropped by the dangerous &d&lAechor Plants&r&f that dwell across the &b&lAether&r&f."
		""
		"&fThese petals are soft, fragrant, and incredibly useful, they serve as the main food source for &a&lMoas&r&f, helping you raise and tame your flying companions.."
	]
	quest.050BCFA09A01B6DE.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain an &d&lAechor Petal&r&f"
	quest.050BCFA09A01B6DE.title: "&7&lQuest: Aechor Petal Discovery"
	quest.05208A7B1024326C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Reviving enhanced mobs demands materials that sit between life and decay.&r &2&lDescomposed Leather&r is one of those key ingredients and acts as a core crafting component for many early‑game Mobstein items and resurrection steps&r.&r"
		""
		"You will need to discover how to produce this strange leather, whether by mob drops, special crafting recipes, or a particular interaction using vanilla items.&r Once you secure a supply, you can properly begin your necromantic experiments and start dragging ancient beasts back into the world of the living&r.&r"
	]
	quest.05208A7B1024326C.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain &2&lDescomposed Leather&r&l&f, an essential material for resurrection&r"
	quest.05208A7B1024326C.title: "&5&lQuest: Acquiring Descomposed Leather"
	quest.05BF48E3C97F106F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Not all magic is clean; some artifacts are steeped in necrotic energy.&r The &8&lRotten Spell Book&r is a rare loot item usually hidden in chests inside the world’s most abandoned and forgotten structures&r.&r"
		""
		"When equipped as your main spellbook it offers a risky bargain: you gain a big increase to your maximum mana but lose some spell resistance in return.&r Decide whether the extra power is worth the curse, then track down this forbidden tome if you are willing to pay the price&r.&r"
	]
	quest.05BF48E3C97F106F.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain a &8&lRotten Spell Book&r&l&f from rare world loot&r"
	quest.05BF48E3C97F106F.title: "&5&lQuest: The Cursed Spellbook"
	quest.05D03AC1ECACD419.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&b&lIndustrial Hemp&r is a unique &e&lcrop&r added by &b&lImmersive Engineering&r. It is a &e&ltwo block tall plant&r that grows similarly to wheat and can be harvested for &e&lIndustrial Hemp Fiber&r and bonus seeds."
		""
		"To get started, break grass to find &b&lIndustrial Hemp Seeds&r, then plant them on farmland with a light level of at least 12. Make sure your farm stays well lit or the hemp will not grow."
		""
		"While not the most essential crop early on, &b&lIndustrial Hemp&r becomes important later for crafting materials like &e&lTough Fabric&r and &e&lBalloon Components&r, as well as other engineering tools. Start your hemp farm now so your future machines will thank you."
	]
	quest.05D03AC1ECACD419.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain and grow &b&lIndustrial Hemp&r"
	quest.05D03AC1ECACD419.title: "&9&lQuest: Industrial Hemp"
	quest.066C469D29482E09.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &c&lMankh&r&f is a powerful fiery companion born from divine energy. &a&lUse Relic Gold on the Respawn Totem&r&f to summon it. Once awakened, it scorches the ground with rings of fire and unleashes blazing energy beams at its enemies."
	]
	quest.066C469D29482E09.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSummon &c&lMankh&r&f&l using the &c&lRespawn Totem&r&f&l and &c&lRelic Gold"
	quest.066C469D29482E09.title: "&6&lQuest: Summon Mankh"
	quest.06D9407CDF4FF533.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Not all starlight is friendly. Some corners of this realm are soaked in gloom and strange &5&ldark magic&r&f. The &c&lCursed Garden&r&f is one of those places, a sinister structure where the dimension’s magic has twisted into something dangerous and unsettling."
		""
		"Search the darker, quieter edges of the &e&lEternal Starlight&r&f to find this grim landmark. Discovering the &c&lCursed Garden&r&f is a necessary, if slightly spooky, step toward digging up the dimension’s deepest and most guarded secrets, so watch your step."
	]
	quest.06D9407CDF4FF533.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate the &c&lCursed Garden&r&f&l structure hidden within the dimension"
	quest.06D9407CDF4FF533.title: "&7&lQuest: Locating the Cursed Garden"
	quest.076425BFDB063A5B.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Long ago, the wisest bees discovered a rather unconventional way to enter the &e&lBumblezone&r&f. By lining up a &7&lPiston&r&f just right and triggering its push, one could be launched through the sticky, golden walls of a &e&lBeehive&r&f and into their hidden realm."
		""
		"This strange method became a rite of passage for new explorers. Craft a &7&lPiston&r&f, find a beehive, and with one satisfying thump, let the piston’s force send you straight into the heart of the hive and the wonders waiting inside."
	]
	quest.076425BFDB063A5B.quest_subtitle: "&f&lGet pushed into a &e&lBeehive&r&f&l by a &7&lPiston&r&f&l"
	quest.076425BFDB063A5B.title: "&7&lQuest: The Piston’s Push"
	quest.077EFB6DD8B2A46B.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lEnchantment Mover&r allows you to transfer enchantments from tools, like a &b&lDiamond Pickaxe&r, directly to your machines. Enchanted machines gain enhanced capabilities, working &e&lfaster&r, &e&lmore efficiently&r, and sometimes with &b&ladditional bonuses&r depending on the enchantments applied."
		""
		"Use it to maximize the potential of your &b&lQuarryPlus&r, &b&lPumpPlus&r, and other industrial machines, turning ordinary automation into &e&lpowerful enchanted engineering&r."
	]
	quest.077EFB6DD8B2A46B.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft an &b&lEnchantment Mover&r"
	quest.077EFB6DD8B2A46B.title: "&9&lQuest: Enchantment Mover"
	quest.07FECE1E9B00EA4A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your journey through the cosmos calls for a reliable companion. The &6&lGolem Forge&r&f is a massive ancient structure, a legendary crafting site where powerful elemental servants were once created."
		""
		"Travel across glittering landscapes and dangerous terrain to track down this unique building. Discovering the Forge is a major milestone, since it holds the key to assembling your own steadfast &7&lGolem&r&f and pushing your power even further in the &e&lEternal Starlight&r&f."
	]
	quest.07FECE1E9B00EA4A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind the &6&lGolem Forge&r&f&l structure hidden within the &e&lStarlight Dimension&r&f&l"
	quest.07FECE1E9B00EA4A.title: "&7&lQuest: Locating the Golem Forge"
	quest.0829663CADA3292C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&b&lRefined Storage&r&f is a powerful &a&lstorage mod&r&f that lets you build an advanced digital network for items. By connecting various devices, you can &a&lstore, organize, and automate&r&f your entire inventory system with precision and ease."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lGetting Started"
		""
		"To begin your journey, you'll need a few essential components:"
		""
		"- A &b&lController&r&f to power the system."
		""
		"- A &b&lDisk Drive&r&f to hold your storage disks."
		""
		"- One or more &b&lStorage Disks&r&f (1K, 4K, 16K, or 64K)."
		""
		"- A &b&lGrid&r&f or &b&lCrafting Grid&r&f to view and access stored items."
		""
		"Once these are connected, your Refined Storage network will come to life instantly, allowing you access to everything stored digitally!"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lMod Overview"
		""
		"Unlike traditional chests or barrels, &b&lRefined Storage&r&f works as a single unified system. Every connected device communicates through a digital link, meaning you can &a&lsearch, sort, and extract&r&f items from any terminal. No more running between storage rooms!"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lFluid Storage"
		""
		"The mod also supports &a&lfluid management&r&f using &b&lFluid Storage Disks&r&f and &b&lFluid Interfaces&r&f. You can integrate them into your crafting setups for automation or storage of modded liquids like lava, honey, or liquid essence."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lIntegration and Automation"
		""
		"Refined Storage can connect with many other mods. Use &b&lImporters, Exporters, and External Storages&r&f to move items in and out of your system, and combine them with &b&lCrafters&r&f to automate production just like an &b&lME System&r&f."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip:"
		""
		"If you're familiar with Applied Energistics 2, think of Refined Storage as its &a&lsimpler and faster&r&f cousin. Less complexity, but just as powerful in the right hands!"
	]
	quest.0829663CADA3292C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the Refined Storage mod"
	quest.0829663CADA3292C.title: "&9&lWelcome to Refined Storage!"
	quest.087133704CE58902.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your first big challenge is to track down the lair of the great serpent boss. The &c&lNaga Courtyard&r&f is the structure where the fearsome &c&lNaga&r&f lives."
		""
		"To locate it, explore the dimension and look for large, open clearings with ruined walls. Once you find the courtyard, get ready for a serious fight—you will want solid &7&larmor&r&f, a good &6&lsword&r&f, a reliable &6&lranged weapon&r&f, and a sturdy &7&lshield&r&f to survive the battle against the giant serpent."
	]
	quest.087133704CE58902.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind the &c&lNaga Courtyard&r&f&l structure in the &2&lTwilight Forest&r&f&l"
	quest.087133704CE58902.title: "&7&lQuest: Locating the Naga Courtyard"
	quest.089ABC169A7FFC16.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your pursuit of magic now requires a source of raw, condensed power.&r &b&lArcane Crystal Ore&r is the next key material, glowing faintly so it stands out against the deepest stone.&r"
		""
		"Explore the ancient layers from Y‑40 up to Y‑14, with the highest concentration of ore around &b&lY‑13&r.&r Follow its soft glow in the darkness, mine it, and secure this &a&lmagical resource&r for your arcane work&r.&r"
	]
	quest.089ABC169A7FFC16.quest_subtitle: "&l&fFind &b&lArcane Crystal Ore&r&l&f between Y‑layers −40 and 14&r"
	quest.089ABC169A7FFC16.title: "&5&lQuest: The Luminescent Vein"
	quest.08A45931B3717EA5.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The Ancient City stretches far through the deep dark, but at its core lies the most sacred and deadly site of all: the &l&fSculk Temple&r. This fortress of sculkstone is a focus of strange power, guarded by brutal Sculk monsters and watched by the Warden’s senses."
		""
		"Search the ruined halls with care, slipping through reinforced deepslate corridors and avoiding sound based traps. When you finally uncover the entrance to the temple, you will have proven true mastery over exploration in the deepest dark?"
	]
	quest.08A45931B3717EA5.quest_subtitle: "&f&lExplore the depths to &e&lfind a Sculk Temple structure&r&f&l"
	quest.08A45931B3717EA5.title: "&7&lQuest: Exploring the Shadowed Temple"
	quest.08E0766D57F71C48.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The mighty Starlight Golem is shielded by a powerful, pulsing &b&lEnergy Block&r&f that protects it from normal damage. To bring down this celestial defender, you first need to shut down that magical protection."
		""
		"Track down the source of its power, the &b&lEnergy Block&r&f itself, and figure out how to disable it. Only once the Golem’s core defenses are offline will your attacks really count, so a bit of strategy here is the real key to winning this fight."
	]
	quest.08E0766D57F71C48.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDeactivate the &b&lEnergy Block&r&f&l to make the Starlight Golem vulnerable to attacks"
	quest.08E0766D57F71C48.title: "&7&lQuest: Deactivating the Golem's Core"
	quest.09108BC4558F39C7.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your next step is to push into the soggier parts of the &2&lTwilight Forest&r&f. The &2&lTwilight Swamp&r&f is a special biome added by the mod that feels similar to an Overworld swamp but with its own twist."
		""
		"This version has more tangled &2&ltrees&r&f than open water, and the ground can be tricky to cross. Track down this distinct biome—you will need to move through it to eventually reach the massive, dangerous dungeon known as the &6&lLabyrinth&r&f."
	]
	quest.09108BC4558F39C7.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind the &2&lTwilight Swamp&r&f&l biome in the dimension"
	quest.09108BC4558F39C7.title: "&7&lQuest: Locating the Twilight Swamp"
	quest.0926F35FF31A657F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &d&lBroken Dinamo&r&f still holds life within its shattered frame. &a&lApproach it and provide the specific items&r&f it requests to restore its energy core. &b&lOnce repaired&r&f, it will transform into the true &c&lDinamo&r&f, a loyal mechanical companion."
		""
		"&fThe &c&lDinamo&r&f attacks hostile entities, powers nearby Tesla Network components when sitting, and will be controlled with the \"Wrench\". Be careful: its entry rays will electrocute anything that stands in their path."
	]
	quest.0926F35FF31A657F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lGive the required items to the &d&lBroken Dinamo&r&f&l to repair it"
	quest.0926F35FF31A657F.title: "&6&lQuest: Repair the Broken Dinamo"
	quest.09387DF5E6AFE60E.quest_desc: ["&rThe magic of Malum relies on the collected essence of all living and unliving things. To master the mod, you must successfully slay mobs with your Crude Scythe to gather every single Spirit type: Sacred (from passive mobs), Wicked (from hostile mobs), Arcane (from magic creatures), Aerial (from flying mobs), Aquatic (from marine mobs), Earthen (from terrestrial mobs), Infernal (from Nether mobs), and Eldrich (from End mobs). Collect them all to command the full spectrum of Soul Arcana! 🩸"]
	quest.09387DF5E6AFE60E.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Gather every type of Spirit&r found in the world."
	quest.09387DF5E6AFE60E.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4The Spirit Collector 👻🌈"
	quest.09A6E9AE21265A1F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &5&lVoid Blossom&r&f is the newest boss added to the mod, lurking in rare caves near the &8&llowest depths&r&f of the world.&r You can track down the right cave by following the direction shown by nearby &a&lVoid Lilies&r&f, which quietly point the way to its lair.&r"
		""
		"This boss is protected by a permanent &a&lThorns&r&f effect and has several dangerous abilities.&r It can summon &a&lthorn bushes&r&f that damage you on contact, regenerate health from nearby &5&lVoid Blossoms&r&f that you must destroy, and fill the arena with &2&lpoisonous green clouds&r&f.&r Once you finally bring it down, you will be rewarded with &d&lCrystal Fruit&r&f and a deadly &5&lVoid Thorn&r&f for your efforts.&r"
	]
	quest.09A6E9AE21265A1F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the &5&lVoid Blossom&r&f&l boss found in caves at the bottom of the world"
	quest.09A6E9AE21265A1F.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Void Blossom"
	quest.09BF4C2D0CF87923.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &c&lPyromancer&r is a destructive fire mage aligned with the Fire school of magic.&r This foe usually appears in structures within desert or volcanic biomes, or in special towers packed with fire‑themed loot&r.&r"
		""
		"Expect a very aggressive battle: the Pyromancer hurls fireballs, flame waves, and explosive bursts that can quickly set you ablaze.&r Taking them down is crucial for advancing in Fire magic, since they can drop Fire Spell Scrolls, Fire Foci, and materials needed to craft the Pyromancer Armor Set, which boosts Fire Spell Power&r.&r"
	]
	quest.09BF4C2D0CF87923.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSlay the &c&lPyromancer&r&l&f, the hostile mage of the Fire school&r"
	quest.09BF4C2D0CF87923.title: "&5&lQuest: Slaying the Pyromancer"
	quest.0A1648FEDFAE3AF0.quest_desc: [
		""
		"A terrible, corrupted being, the &d&lLunar Monstrosity&r&f, has taken hold in the &e&lEternal Starlight&r&f. This powerful boss is a mix of celestial and monstrous energy and stands as one of the biggest threats you will face here."
		""
		"Get your gear ready, make use of the strange &b&lmagic&r&f you have learned, and head into the fight. Bringing down this fearsome creature will earn you a worthy trophy and a bit of peace for these troubled cosmic lands, while also proving that you are a real adventurer in the stars."
	]
	quest.0A1648FEDFAE3AF0.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the &d&lLunar Monstrosity&r&f&l that haunts the dimension"
	quest.0A1648FEDFAE3AF0.title: "&7&lQuest: Conquering the Lunar Monstrocity"
	quest.0A57FFAD90A800A1.quest_desc: [
		""
		"To harness potent life‑essence magic, you need a proper vessel.&r The &b&lTest Tube&r is a simple but essential tool, created by combining a regular Glass Bottle with a &9&lmagical Rune&r.&r"
		""
		"Once crafted, this tube stores blood from entities you slay with a &4&lMystical Dagger&r.&r A blood‑filled &b&lTest Tube&r can then channel this vital &c&lBlood resource&r straight into your &5&lHephaestus Forge&r, powering your strongest rituals.&r"
	]
	quest.0A57FFAD90A800A1.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft a &b&lTest Tube&r&l&f by combining a Glass Bottle with a &9&lRune&r"
	quest.0A57FFAD90A800A1.title: "&5&lQuest: Crafting the Test Tube"
	quest.0A9768F71CCEA1B2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fDeep beneath the waters of &b&lWarm Oceans&r&f, &a&lSwamps&r&f, and &d&lFlooded Leaves&r&f swims a creature once thought to be extinct, the &a&lToxlacanth&r&f."
		""
		"&fThis rare ancient fish releases a &d&ltoxic cloud&r&f when attacked, inflicting &d&lWeakness&r&f, &c&lNausea&r&f, and &6&lPoison&r&f upon those who disturb it. It can be caught in a bucket or hunted carefully to obtain its essence."
		""
		"&fThough dangerous, the &a&lToxlacanth&r&f is key to taming the mighty &b&lSoarer&r&f. Approach with caution and respect."
	]
	quest.0A9768F71CCEA1B2.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind a &a&lToxlacanth&r"
	quest.0A9768F71CCEA1B2.title: "&6&lQuest: The Toxlacanth"
	quest.0AE0113278D101EF.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lBlaze Burner&r is a vital &b&lCreate&r component that &e&lprovides heat&r for many machines and processes. It is required for &e&lHeated Mixing&r recipes and powers components like the &b&lSteam Engine&r, Bulk Smoker, and Bulk Smelter."
		""
		"Placed beneath devices such as the &b&lMechanical Mixer&r or &b&lBasin&r, it unlocks advanced crafting and processing recipes that need constant heat. The burner’s &e&lheat level&r depends on the fuel you use, from simple coal to &e&lBlaze Rods&r or &e&lBlaze Cakes&r for maximum efficiency."
		""
		"Beyond its utility, the Blaze Burner can also act as a &e&ldecorative light source&r, adding both warmth and atmosphere to your factory builds. Use &a&lJEI&r to see the crafting recipe and gather all the materials needed to assemble this fiery machine."
	]
	quest.0AE0113278D101EF.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &e&lBlaze Burner&r"
	quest.0AE0113278D101EF.title: "&9&lQuest: Blaze Burner"
	quest.0B6EE07B21876694.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Ignitium Ingots are the essential crafting material for the most powerful fire-themed &d&lendgame equipment&r in the mod. This rare resource is obtained primarily by defeating &c&lIgnis&r, the final boss of the &c&lBurning Arena&r structure."
		""
		"Each successful encounter with Ignis rewards players with exactly &a&lthree ingots&r. You will need to farm this challenging boss multiple times to acquire enough to craft the full set of gear, including:"
		""
		"The &e&lIncinerator Sword&r."
		""
		"The &b&lBulwark of the Flame&r shield."
		""
		"The complete &6&lIgnitium Armor&r set (requires a specialized &a&lsmithing template&r)."
		""
		"Acquire these ingots to unlock the highest tier of fire-based power!"
	]
	quest.0B6EE07B21876694.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain &6&lIgnitium Ingots&r&l &fby slaying the &c&lIgnis&r&l &fboss"
	quest.0B6EE07B21876694.title: "&4&lQuest: Forging the Ignitium Ingot"
	quest.0B9E633BF1A426E9.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &c&lSoul Forge&r is the massive, ancient blacksmith structure that currently houses the powerful &c&lNetherite Monstrosity&r boss. You can find this rare structure randomly spawning in various &c&lNether&r biomes."
		""
		"To make your search easier, you should craft the &6&lEye of Monstrosity&r, which acts as a fireproof compass that guides you directly to the nearest &c&lSoul Forge&r. Locating this structure is necessary to challenge the Monstrosity and begin acquiring its valuable loot."
	]
	quest.0B9E633BF1A426E9.quest_subtitle: "&l&fFind the &c&lSoul Forge&r&l&f structure in the &c&lNether&r&l&f"
	quest.0B9E633BF1A426E9.title: "&4&lQuest: Locating the Soul Forge"
	quest.0BC90204697C4F6C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fBefore uncovering the mysteries buried beneath the &6&lBadlands Temple&r&f, you'll need the proper tool, the &6&lBrush&r&f."
		""
		"&fThis delicate instrument allows you to gently clean away layers of &d&lSuspicious Red Sand&r&f, revealing hidden artifacts and ancient eggs without breaking them."
		""
		"&fCraft your &6&lBrush&r&f using &f&lSticks&r&f, &f&lFeathers&r&f, and a &a&lCopper Ingot&r&f. Once made, take it to the deserts and begin your archaeological journey."
		""
		"&fEvery stroke brings the past closer to life."
	]
	quest.0BC90204697C4F6C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &6&lBrush&r"
	quest.0BC90204697C4F6C.title: "&6&lQuest: Crafting the Brush"
	quest.0C94C68B1E1BED1F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fIn peaceful villages and on your own farm, you may come across the protector of agriculture, the &6&lHay Golem&r&f. A quiet, passive protector of crops. With &c&l40 HP&r&f and a body of wheat, this golem can be repaired using &6&lWheat&r&f and drops &a&l1-4 Wheat&r&f when defeated."
		""
		"&fIts gentle nature hides a powerful purpose: the Hay Golem automatically &a&lprotects tilled soil from being trampled&r&f within a &b&l10×10 block radius&r&f, ensuring your crops stay safe and fertile."
		""
		"&fWhether naturally spawned in a village or hand-built by the player, this straw guardian is a farmer's best friend, silent, steady, and always watching over the harvest."
	]
	quest.0C94C68B1E1BED1F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate or build a &6&lHay Golem&r&f&l to protect your crops from damage&r"
	quest.0C94C68B1E1BED1F.title: "&6&lQuest: The Gentle Guardian - Hay Golem"
	quest.0CE8A74621C852A3.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fLeashes have been reworked in &6&lVanilla Backport&r&f, featuring improved physics and new mechanics. &a&lYou can now leash two entities together&r&f and even snip leashes with Shears or use dispensers to manage them automatically."
		""
		"&fExperiment with the new leash system to master your mob management skills. &b&lConnect two creatures&r&f and discover how the new leash mechanics work."
	]
	quest.0CE8A74621C852A3.quest_subtitle: "&f&lUse a &c&lleash&r&f&l to connect two mobs together"
	quest.0CE8A74621C852A3.title: "&6&lQuest: Master of Leashes"
	quest.0D21039362B49D8D.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have mastered the secrets of the Forge and shut down the Golem’s protective field. Now the final showdown begins. The &e&lStarlight Golem&r&f is a powerful elemental force and a tough boss that stands between you and the next step of your cosmic journey."
		""
		"Face the weakened guardian with every tool and bit of magic you have. Beating this towering foe is a real test of strength and patience, and proves that you are ready to dig deeper into the mysteries of the &e&lEternal Starlight&r&f."
	]
	quest.0D21039362B49D8D.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the mighty &e&lStarlight Golem&r&f&l in combat"
	quest.0D21039362B49D8D.title: "&7&lQuest: Defeating the Celestial Guardian"
	quest.0D7F852ECFEFBBF0.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &3&lLeviathan&r&f is the ultimate aquatic boss, a massive sea serpent that rules the &3&lSunken City&r&f structure.&r This boss has &c&l400 HP&r&f, more than ten powerful attacks, and demands careful preparation for a long underwater battle.&r"
		""
		"You summon the &3&lLeviathan&r&f by offering the &5&lAbyssal Sacrifice&r&f at the &5&lAltar of Abyss&r&f.&r The fight is complex, with the creature fighting through four &5&ltentacles&r&f that can split apart and eventually reveal its true head.&r"
		""
		"&f&lKey Mechanics and Strategy&r&f&r"
		""
		"&f&lProtection is mandatory&r&f: You should eat &d&lBlessed Amethyst Crab Meat&r&f to gain immunity to its worst debuffs: &8&lDarkness&r&f, &5&lAbyssal Fear&r&f, and &c&lAbyssal Burn&r&f.&r"
		""
		"&f&lMobility is key&r&f: Equip &b&lDepth Strider III Boots&r&f and &b&lRiptide Tridents&r&f to counter the heavy movement penalties of the underwater arena.&r"
		""
		"&f&lAttacks&r&f: The boss uses abilities like &c&lMasticate&r&f (a 32‑HP bite that stuns), &c&lAbyssal Mines&r&f (explosives that inflict &5&lAbyssal Fear&r&f), &c&lTail Torrent&r&f (causing &6&lBone Fracture&r&f), and devastating &d&lInterdimensional Beams&r&f.&r"
		""
		"&f&lPhase Two&r&f: When its health first hits zero, it instantly regenerates to &c&l50% HP&r&f and unlocks new, more aggressive attacks, including &d&lHoming Warps&r&f that make escape difficult.&r"
		""
		"Upon victory, you receive &b&lTidal Claws&r&f (a grappling‑hook‑style weapon), an &3&lAbyssal Egg&r&f that hatches into a tame &3&lBaby Leviathan&r&f pet, and a chance at its rare &d&lmusic disc&r&f.&r"
	]
	quest.0D7F852ECFEFBBF0.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the &3&lLeviathan&r&f&l, the ultimate aquatic boss of the &3&lSunken City&r&f&l&r"
	quest.0D7F852ECFEFBBF0.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Leviathan"
	quest.0DA2802760B14236.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lArcane Anvil&r is a core workstation for any mage, used to strengthen both your gear and your spells.&r Crafting this structure unlocks three powerful functions you will use constantly&r.&r"
		""
		"Upgrade Scrolls: raise your spell scrolls to higher tiers of power.&r Upgrade Equipment: boost the stats and special properties of your armor and weapons.&r Imbue Weapons: bind spells directly into weapons so they trigger magical effects on hit&r.&r"
		""
		"Gather the needed materials and build the &b&lArcane Anvil&r to start forging truly legendary magical equipment for your adventures&r.&r"
	]
	quest.0DA2802760B14236.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft the &b&lArcane Anvil&r&l&f and master its three magical functions&r"
	quest.0DA2802760B14236.title: "&5&lQuest: Forging at the Arcane Anvil"
	quest.0DB980E701223265.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fKnowledge is power, especially in a world as mysterious as the &b&lAether&r&f."
		""
		"&fThe &b&lBook of Lore&r&f is your personal guide to understanding every block, item, and creature you encounter among the clouds."
		""
		"&fIt provides &a&lin-game information&r&f about Aether content, helping you identify materials, mobs, and special mechanics as you discover them."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lHow to Craft It"
		""
		"&fYou will need:"
		""
		"&6&lBook ×1"
		""
		"&f&7&lFlint&r&f ×1 or &e&lGlowstone Dust&r&f ×1 or &b&lAmbrosium Shard&r&f ×1"
		""
		"&fCrafting any of these combinations with a book will grant you a &b&lBook of Lore&r&f."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lHow It Works"
		""
		"&fRight-click while holding the &b&lBook of Lore&r&f to open it."
		""
		"&fInside, you will find detailed entries for Aether blocks, items, and entities, automatically added as you encounter them in the world."
		""
		"&fIt is the perfect companion for explorers and scholars alike."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip"
		""
		"&fKeep your &b&lBook of Lore&r&f handy while adventuring."
		""
		"&fWhen you find a strange new block or item, check its entry before experimenting, the &b&lAether&r&f hides plenty of surprises."
	]
	quest.0DB980E701223265.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lBook of Lore&r&f to learn about the items and secrets of the &b&lAether&r&f"
	quest.0DB980E701223265.title: "&7&lQuest: Craft the Book of Lore"
	quest.0E19CEF1AB529018.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to &b&lCreate&r, a mod that brings creativity and motion together through &e&ltools&r, &e&lblocks&r, and &b&lmechanical contraptions&r for building, decoration, and aesthetic automation."
		""
		""
		"Unlike other tech mods, &b&lCreate&r lets you design your own machines with moving components and visual systems instead of menus or UIs. Every contraption you build is powered by your &6&limagination&r and &6&lmechanical energy&r."
		""
		""
		"Use the in game guide &6&lPonder&r to learn every mechanism step by step. And remember: to view all crafting recipes, install &a&lJEI&r, because the vanilla recipe book will not be enough for this level of engineering."
	]
	quest.0E19CEF1AB529018.quest_subtitle: "&f&lWelcome to the &bCreate&f mod"
	quest.0E19CEF1AB529018.title: "&9&lWelcome to Create"
	quest.0E312B12D6E7FFD3.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lAbayuthana&r (Umvuthana in singular) are bird‑like neutral mobs that scour the savanna, scorching the ground and hunting local wildlife.&r They naturally spawn in hunting packs of four in Savanna biomes and also populate the Umvuthana Grove structure&r.&r"
		""
		"These warriors are hostile toward almost everything, including players who are not wearing one of their masks.&r They circle their prey and occasionally dive in with claw attacks, making them dangerous in open terrain&r.&r"
		""
		"When slain, an Abayuthana can drop its mask as wearable loot, with each mask providing a small unique buff such as increased jump height.&r Defeating one of these fierce bird‑fighters proves your dominance over the savanna and starts your own collection of tribal masks&r.&r"
	]
	quest.0E312B12D6E7FFD3.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSlay an &e&lUmvuthana&r&l&f, the bird‑like savanna warrior&r"
	quest.0E312B12D6E7FFD3.title: "&4&lQuest: Culling the Abavuthana Scourge"
	quest.0E3C1DA0513FD5E1.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lEternal Starlight&r&f waits just beyond the edge of the normal world. You have discovered the ruins and worked out how to activate the gateway, so now it is time to take a breath, steady yourself, and step through the newly opened portal."
		""
		"Cross the threshold and enter this magical, star-swept realm. Simply seeing this new, beautiful environment is enough to complete your first big leap into the cosmos, so take a moment to look around and enjoy the &b&lstarlight&r&f."
	]
	quest.0E3C1DA0513FD5E1.quest_subtitle: "&f&lVisit the &e&lStarlight Dimension&r&f&l for the very first time"
	quest.0E3C1DA0513FD5E1.title: "&7&lQuest: Passage into the Cosmos"
	quest.0ECD72C251137BC9.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&f&d&lGravitite Armor&r&f is one of the strongest armors in the &b&lAether&r&f, crafted from enchanted Gravitite."
		""
		"&fWhen equipped, it grants incredible protection and the ability to float gracefully through the air."
		""
		"&fGather enough enchanted Gravitite to forge the full set and harness its powerful, weightless energy."
	]
	quest.0ECD72C251137BC9.quest_subtitle: "&f&lHave a full set of &d&lGravitite Armor&r&f &lin your inventory"
	quest.0ECD72C251137BC9.title: "&7&lQuest: Full Gravitite Power!"
	quest.0EF24EFD630CC2CF.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lImproved Blast Furnace&r is an upgraded version of the &b&lCrude Blast Furnace&r from &b&lImmersive Engineering&r. It alloys &e&lIron Ingots&r with &e&lCoal Coke&r to produce &b&lSteel&r, but unlike its predecessor, it supports &e&lautomation&r and runs at &e&lhigher speeds&r when enhanced with &b&lBlast Furnace Preheaters&r."
		""
		"This structure features hatches for &e&lAutomatic export&r of Steel and Slag, with inputs accepted from the top. &b&lSteel&r exits through the front, while &e&lSlug&r leaves from the back."
		""
		"To build it, assemble &e&l27 Reinforced Blast Bricks&r in a 3x3x3 cube, place a &b&lHopper&r on top, and use your &b&lEngineer's Hammer&r on the front face to complete it. Upgrade your old &b&lBlast Bricks&r with &b&lSteel Plates&r to transform your &b&lCrude Blast Furnace&r into this improved version."
	]
	quest.0EF24EFD630CC2CF.quest_subtitle: "&f&lBuild the &b&lImproved Blast Furnace&f multiblock&r"
	quest.0EF24EFD630CC2CF.title: "&9&lQuest: Improved Blast Furnace"
	quest.10089BAD7789FDD2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fOnce you've chosen the perfect location for your colony, it's time to begin! Place down a &a&lSupply Camp&r&f or a &a&lSupply Ship&r&f to officially start your journey."
		""
		"&fEnter the structure and obtain your &6&lBuild Tool&r&f, this tool is essential for planning and all future buildings in your colony."
		""
		"&fThe remaining camp or ship is purely decorative. You may leave it standing or tear it down to make space. If you don't receive a &6&lBuild Tool&r&f from the structure, you can &a&lcraft one&r&f manually to continue your progress."
	]
	quest.10089BAD7789FDD2.quest_subtitle: "&f&lPlace a &a&lSupply Camp&r&f&l or &a&lSupply Ship&r"
	quest.10089BAD7789FDD2.title: "&6&lStep 1: Supply Camp or Ship"
	quest.10231EEA073F890E.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &a&lArtisan Relic&r is a valuable trinket that boosts the efficiency of your arcane work when placed in the Enhancer Slot of the &5&lHephaestus Forge&r, reducing Experience essence costs by 25 percent&r.&r"
		""
		"You cannot craft this item, but you have a small chance to find it in the chests of Armorer, Toolsmith, or Weaponsmith village buildings&r.&r Explore and raid these structures—the relic is worth the effort&r.&r"
	]
	quest.10231EEA073F890E.quest_subtitle: "&l&fAcquire an &a&lArtisan Relic&r&l&f to enhance your forge rituals&r"
	quest.10231EEA073F890E.title: "&5&lQuest: Acquiring the Artisan Relic"
	quest.1084BE5F7D1F10A2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe mighty &e&lEaster&r&f guards the secrets of the desert fiercely. Defeating one of these ancient beasts may reward you with a rare and powerful item, the &8&lEaster's Tooth&r&f."
		""
		"&fThis relic once belonged to the jaws of a guardian from Minecraft's prehistoric age. Legends say it can be used to forge ancient weapons lost to time."
	]
	quest.1084BE5F7D1F10A2.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain an &8&lEater's Tooth&r"
	quest.1084BE5F7D1F10A2.title: "&6&lQuest: The Eater's Tooth"
	quest.11091E11ECCB625F.quest_desc: [
		"Deep beneath the sands and ruins of ancient civilizations, powerful relics still endure — one of the rarest being the &6Ancient Smithing Upgrade&f."
		""
		"This legendary artifact can be found hidden within &dSuspicious Sand&f or other archaeological sites across the world."
		"It holds the knowledge of forgotten blacksmiths, allowing you to craft enhanced tools and weapons from a bygone age."
		""
		"Only true explorers who master the art of excavation will uncover its secrets."
	]
	quest.11091E11ECCB625F.quest_subtitle: "&7&oObtain an Ancient Smithing Upgrade."
	quest.11091E11ECCB625F.title: "&6&lQuest: Ancient Smithing Upgrade"
	quest.11313E9F561105EB.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&b&lMineColonies&r&f is an interactive building mod that transforms your Minecraft world into a thriving kingdom! As the leader, you'll design, build, and manage your own colony, bringing life and purpose to your world."
		""
		"&fFrom hardworking &a&lBuilders&r&f and &a&lFarmers&r&f to brave &c&lGuards&r&f and curious &b&lResearchers&r&f, every citizen plays a role in your growing settlement. Expand your colony with structures like the &6&lTown Hall&r&f, &6&lWarehouse&r&f, &6&lFarms&r&f, and many more!"
		""
		"&fNo two colonies are ever the same. Each one reflects your creativity, shaping everything built in the desert, on a mountain, or under the moonlight's glow."
		""
		"&fThe only limit is your imagination!"
	]
	quest.11313E9F561105EB.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &b&lMineColonies&r&f&l mod&r"
	quest.11313E9F561105EB.title: "&a&lWelcome to MineColonies!"
	quest.115309BF08C8C6DC.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &6&lBadlands Temple&r&f holds more than just treasure, beneath its vibrant terrain lies the mysterious &d&lSuspicious Red Sand&r&f. These strange blocks contain traces of ancient artifacts buried by time and wind."
		""
		"&fUse your &a&lPaintbrush&r&f carefully to brush away the layers of sand. You might uncover relics such as the &a&lJaw Pottery Fragment&r&f or the &e&lEater Egg&r&f, each revealing a piece of the world's prehistoric history."
		""
		"&fHandle each discovery with care, for within the red sands, ancient life still whispers."
	]
	quest.115309BF08C8C6DC.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObserve or find &d&lSuspicious Red Sand&r"
	quest.115309BF08C8C6DC.title: "&6&lQuest: Secrets in the Red Sand"
	quest.1173F84D12E79742.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fIn peaceful villages, you may encounter the curious &6&lBarrel Golem&r&f, a sturdy guardian and nimble trader. With &c&l40 HP&r&f and the ability to &a&lheal using Wooden Planks&r&f, it's both durable and loyal."
		""
		"&fWhen attacked, it cleverly hides by sealing its lid, reducing damage by &b&l60%&r&f while it rests or sleeps through the night."
		""
		"&fDrop &a&lEmeralds&r&f near it to start &a&ltradeing&r&f! You can receive anything from seeds, saplings, leather or &6&lgold ingots&r&f, to rare treasures like &d&lTotems of Undying&r&f and &d&lEnchanted Books&r&f."
		""
		"&fWhen defeated, the Barrel Golem drops a variety of useful items, from Cod and Wheat to &a&lEmeralds&r&f and &6&lIron Ingots&r&f. A true friend to any villager and a clever trader to any adventurer!"
	]
	quest.1173F84D12E79742.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate and interact with a &6&lBarrel Golem&r&f&l in a village to discover its unique trading behavior&r"
	quest.1173F84D12E79742.title: "&6&lQuest: The Merchant of the Village - Barrel Golem"
	quest.11D6EA90F6AC1BE3.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &6&lArchevoker&r is a powerful hostile mage who commands the Evocation school of magic.&r This boss resides in its fortress, the &6&lEvoker Fort&r, a structure that can generate in plains, desert, forest, and savanna biomes&r.&r"
		""
		"Expect a difficult, tactical battle: the Archevoker has high health, uses the Gust spell, and is often supported by other hostile guardians.&r Defeating it grants major rewards for Evocation progression, including a chance to obtain the &d&lGrimoire of Evokation&r and components for the Archevoker Armor set&r.&r"
	]
	quest.11D6EA90F6AC1BE3.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSlay the &6&lArchevoker&r&l&f, the master of Evocation magic&r"
	quest.11D6EA90F6AC1BE3.title: "&5&lQuest: Conquering the Archevoker"
	quest.125503034FF69720.quest_desc: [
		""
		"A &b&lDepth Ingot&r is the core material for forging Depth Armor and Depth Tools, which greatly improve your movement and effectiveness while underwater.&r Crafting this ingot is therefore a major step toward mastering exploration in the ocean biomes&r.&r"
		""
		"To make one, first mine &b&lAquamarine Ore&r, a new ore that generates beneath the sea floor.&r Then combine the Aquamarine with a &b&lDepth Nugget&r, an item earned from Caskets that you receive by trading with different Meromorph villagers&r.&r"
		""
		"Once you have the ingredients, smelt or craft them into Depth Ingots according to the mod’s recipe, and use those ingots to build your full set of Depth gear.&r With enough ingots, you will be able to traverse the deep ocean quickly and safely while using all the new tools&r.&r"
	]
	quest.125503034FF69720.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft a &b&lDepth Ingot&r&l&f by combining Aquamarine and a Depth Nugget&r"
	quest.125503034FF69720.title: "&4&lQuest: Forging the Depth Ingot"
	quest.129797AB5A35BB91.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&f&b&lIcestone&r&f is a rare, chilling material found within the frozen regions of the &b&lAether&r&f."
		""
		"&fIt radiates an icy aura capable of cooling lava and even freezing water nearby, making it a valuable resource for crafting and exploration in the coldest heights of the skylands."
	]
	quest.129797AB5A35BB91.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain &b&lIcestone&r&f"
	quest.129797AB5A35BB91.title: "&7&lQuest: Frozen Treasure"
	quest.12B9116A0A6DDDBE.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The Sculk does not just spread, it breeds terror. To cleanse the &9&lAncient City&r&f and claim real control, you must hunt down every kind of creature that the Sculk calls forth, from the sneaky Sculk Snare and explosive Sculk Terror to the blinding Sculk Lurker and any other warped horror."
		""
		"Study each monster, learn how it fights, and put them all down for good. Only when every variety of Sculk Monster has fallen by your hand will the deep dark finally feel quiet."
	]
	quest.12B9116A0A6DDDBE.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSlay &6&lone of every Sculk Monster&r&f&l that lurks in the deep dark"
	quest.12B9116A0A6DDDBE.title: "&7&lQuest: Silence the Sculk Menace"
	quest.12B930BA0112D677.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &d&lOtherside&r is a strange world twisted by the corruption of the deep dark. Every area feels a bit off, with &a&lunusual terrain&r and unsettling views wherever you go."
		""
		"Now that you have crossed into this dimension, your job is to map every &a&lunique biome&r it hides. Walk into each one, take a good look around, and make sure it is marked in your mental map before you move on."
		""
		"&fYou will need to leave the safe routes behind and push into every weird corner of this realm. If you want to truly master the &d&lDeeper and Darker&r mod, do not leave a single &8&lshadow&r or glowing crack unexplored."
	]
	quest.12B930BA0112D677.quest_subtitle: "&f&lExplore every &a&lbiome&f in the &d&lOtherside&f dimension"
	quest.12B930BA0112D677.title: "&7&lQuest: Otherside Cartographer"
	quest.12F56B5A986623F4.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &b&lBlueprint&r&f is an essential tool for every village leader in &6&lMinecraft Comes Alive: Reborn&r&f. It allows you to view, organize, and control various aspects of your village, from buildings and villagers to &a&ltaxes and rules&r&f."
		""
		"&fTo craft it, place &f&l8 Paper&r&f around the edges of the crafting grid and &b&l1 Blue Dye&r&f in the center."
		""
		"&fOnce crafted, right-click to open its management interface and begin shaping your settlement."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lBlueprint Interface Overview:"
		""
		"&fLeft Menu Options:"
		""
		"&f&l■ &b&lMap&r&f: Displays a visual map of all village buildings."
		""
		"&f&l■ &b&lRank&r&f: Shows your current player rank."
		""
		"&f&l■ &b&lCatalog&r&f: Lists all building types recognized by villagers."
		""
		"&f&l■ &b&lVillagers&r&f: Displays all village inhabitants."
		""
		"&f&l■ &b&lRules&r&f: Manage tax rates, birth limits, and age restrictions."
		""
		"&f&l■ &b&lRefresh&r&f: Updates all displayed village data."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&fRight Menu Options:"
		""
		"&f&l■ &b&lAdd Room:&r&f Register a new room as a building."
		""
		"&f&l■ &b&lRemove Building:&r&f Delete a registered building."
		""
		"&f&l■ &b&lAdvanced:&r&f Access additional configuration tools."
		""
		"&f&l■ &b&lAuto Scan:&r&f Automatically register buildings entered by villagers."
		""
		"&f&l■ &b&lRestrict Access:&r&f Prevent certain villagers from entering specific buildings."
		""
		"&f&l■ &b&lRename Village:&r&f Rename your village once you own at least four buildings."
		""
		"&fUse the Blueprint to grow your community, manage its rules, and ensure a thriving and organized village."
	]
	quest.12F56B5A986623F4.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lBlueprint&r&f to manage and monitor your village's growth and structure&r"
	quest.12F56B5A986623F4.title: "&6&lQuest: Craft the Blueprint"
	quest.1317A902F88A7A9F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &a&lGiant Miner&r&f is a hostile mob that appears in the &a&lHighlands&r&f biome, specifically inside the &6&lCloud Cottage&r&f structure. It looks similar to the &7&lArmored Giant&r&f, but this version is weaker and easier to bring down."
		""
		"The Giant Miner has 80 health and deals 9 damage with its &6&lweapon&r&f. It amusingly uses the same skin as the player who meets it. Unlike most bosses, the Giant Miner can keep respawning as long as the &6&lCloud Cottage&r&f remains untouched. Defeating one rewards you with the powerful &6&lGiant Pickaxe&r&f."
	]
	quest.1317A902F88A7A9F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat a &a&lGiant Miner&r&f&l in the &a&lHighlands&r&f&l biome"
	quest.1317A902F88A7A9F.title: "&7&lQuest: Slaying the Giant Miner"
	quest.1344DE73E81340B2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fA &c&lHarness&r&f allows you to ride and control a Happy Ghast. &a&lCustomize its color&r&f by using different wool colors during crafting. &b&lYou can re-dye it&r&f anytime in the crafting grid or remove it with Shears."
		""
		"&fCraft your first &c&lHarness&r&f and prepare to take flight."
	]
	quest.1344DE73E81340B2.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &c&lHarness&r&f&l using 8 &6&lLeather&r&f&l and 2 &f&lGlass Blocks&r&f&l, and 1 &6&lWool Block"
	quest.1344DE73E81340B2.title: "&6&lQuest: Craft a Harness"
	quest.13ED59C7AE844488.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &d&lMagic Map Focus&r&f is not strictly required, but it is a very useful item that lets you create a map showing the locations of important structures and secrets across the &2&lTwilight Forest&r&f. Having one makes exploring the dimension a lot smoother."
		""
		"To make this focus, you will need three magical components: a &7&lRaven Feather&r&f (dropped by Ravens), some &a&lTorch Berries&r&f, and a piece of &e&lGlowstone&r&f. Combine these ingredients to craft the focus and gain a much clearer picture of the dimension’s geography."
	]
	quest.13ED59C7AE844488.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &d&lMagic Map Focus&r&f&l to reveal structures in the dimension"
	quest.13ED59C7AE844488.title: "&7&lQuest: Crafting the Magic Map Focus"
	quest.145B4FBA1F57322E.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &a&lAltar&r&f is a sacred block used to &d&lenchant items&r&f and &b&lrepair armor&r&f within the "
		""
		"&fIt draws its mystical power from &e&lAmbrosium Shards&r&f, so make sure to keep a steady supply nearby."
		""
		"&fWith this block, you can strengthen your gear and harness the magic of the skies."
	]
	quest.145B4FBA1F57322E.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft an &a&lAltar&r&f"
	quest.145B4FBA1F57322E.title: "&7&lQuest: Crafting the Altar"
	quest.15DDE72629D21613.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lScroll Forge&r is a key workstation for any serious mage, since it is the only reliable way to craft new spell scrolls.&r It consumes different types of Ink, using their rarity to decide how rare the resulting spells will be&r.&r"
		""
		"Keep this rule in mind: you cannot use Ink that is lower rarity than the minimum rarity of the scroll you want to craft.&r Build the &b&lScroll Forge&r, feed it the right Ink, and start churning out powerful spells for your Spell Books&r.&r"
	]
	quest.15DDE72629D21613.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft the &b&lScroll Forge&r&l&f to begin mass‑producing spells&r"
	quest.15DDE72629D21613.title: "&5&lQuest: The Scroll Forge"
	quest.16035C2E358A2DD8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &c&lSacred Pontiff&r&f awaits in silence, his prayer echoing through his sacred hall. &a&lInterrupt his ritual&r&f to begin a brutal two-phase battle of fire and faith."
		""
		"&fIn his first form, he wields devastating fire attacks. Upon defeat, he &b&lascends into his Holiness&r&f, armed with golden naginatas that strike from range. Defeat him completely to claim &d&lOld Cloth and Relic Gold&r&f, the keys to summoning powerful companions."
	]
	quest.16035C2E358A2DD8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the &c&lSacred Pontiff"
	quest.16035C2E358A2DD8.title: "&6&lQuest: Defeat the Sacred Pontiff"
	quest.16691B84EA42F5FE.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fYour next big step is to find the &c&lBurning Arena&r, a massive ancient coliseum deep in the Nether where the powerful &c&lIgnis&r &fboss resides&r. &fTo reach this fiery place, you must craft the &c&lEye of Fire&r &f(also known as the Eye of the Machine)&r."
		""
		"&fThis specialized item works like a &b&lmagical compass&r, &fguiding you straight to the arena so you can face Ignis and its &c&lIgnited Revenant&r &fguardians&r. &fGet ready for a tough fight against &c&lfire&r &fand &c&lheat&r."
	]
	quest.16691B84EA42F5FE.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft the &c&lEye of Fire &fto locate the Burning Arena&r"
	quest.16691B84EA42F5FE.title: "&4&lQuest: Forging the Eye of Fire"
	quest.167945320A7F60F8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lController&r&f is the &a&lpower source&r&f and &a&lheart&r&f of your Refined Storage network. Without it, no connected devices will function. It's the first and most important step in bringing your digital storage system to life."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPowering the Network"
		""
		"After crafting your &b&lController&r&f, &a&lplace it down&r&f in your base and connect it to an &a&lenergy source&r&f. You can use common energy systems like &a&lFE, RF, or EU&r&f."
		""
		"Refined Storage is compatible with most major power networks."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lNetwork Activation"
		""
		"Once powered, the Controller's &a&llight will turn on&r&f, indicating your storage network is active. Now, any connected blocks such as &b&lDisk Drives, Grids, and Crafters&r&f will begin to communicate and operate as part of your system."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lNext Steps"
		""
		"With your &b&lController&r&f online, you can begin &a&lexpanding your network&r&f. Start by crafting a &b&lDisk Drive&r&f and &b&lStorage Disks&r&f to hold your items, and then a &b&lGrid&r&f to access them."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip:"
		""
		"If your &b&lController&r&f ever loses power, your entire network will shut down. Make sure to keep it connected to a &a&lreliable power source&r&f at all times!"
	]
	quest.167945320A7F60F8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft and place a &b&lRefined Storage Controller,&r&f &f&lthen connect it to an energy source"
	quest.167945320A7F60F8.title: "&9&lQuest: Crafting the Controller"
	quest.1689241C598869C0.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Now that you have gathered all the basic materials and machines for &b&lApplied Energistics&r, it is time to build your very first &b&lME (Matter Energy)&r system. This setup will give you &e&lsearchable, digital storage&r, no more endless chests."
		""
		"This first system will be simple, no autocrafting or advanced logistics yet, but it will let you store, access, and manage your items efficiently."
		""
		"You will need:"
		""
		"- &b&l1x ME Drive&r"
		""
		"- &b&l1x ME Terminal&r or &b&lME Crafting Terminal&r"
		""
		"- &b&l1x Energy Acceptor&r"
		""
		"- &e&lSome ME Cables&r (Glass, Covered, or Smart, just pick one sense)"
		""
		"- &b&lEH Storage Cells&r for a good balance between capacity and type variety"
		""
		"Once everything is connected, power your &b&lEnergy Acceptor&r with any FE or AE source. Your &b&lME system&r will come online, ready to store your world in data form."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/firstme.png width:100 height:150 align:center}"
	]
	quest.1689241C598869C0.quest_subtitle: "&f&lAssemble your first basic &b&lME Storage System&r"
	quest.1689241C598869C0.title: "&9&lQuest: Your Very First ME System"
	quest.16A31102B410CCE9.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have descended far below the Overworld’s surface, guided by the distant echoes of the &1&lWarden&r&f and the eerie blue glow of the &9&lSculk&r&f. This is the Deeper and Darker realm, a place that pushes the limits of both courage and skill."
		""
		"Your journey into this abyss starts now. Respect the silence, move carefully through the dark, and be ready to face the ancient horrors that wait in the deep."
	]
	quest.16A31102B410CCE9.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &9&lDeeper and Darker Mod&r&f&l"
	quest.16A31102B410CCE9.title: "&7&lWelcome to Deeper and Darker!"
	quest.16D1C15080CAD09C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &5&lLich Tower&r&f is a rare structure that appears in the Overworld’s &b&lcold biomes&r&f.&r This tower is the key to confronting the powerful &5&lNight Lich&r&f, as the boss can be summoned here once you are ready.&r"
		""
		"Before you can summon the boss, you must first gather &e&lSoul Stars&r&f from &c&lundead mobs&r&f.&r Inside the tower you will face hostile enemies, including &c&lSkeletons&r&f wearing enchanted armor, so keep your guard up.&r Search each floor carefully, because the tower also hides &6&lChests&r&f filled with loot waiting to be claimed.&r"
	]
	quest.16D1C15080CAD09C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind the &5&lLich Tower&r&f&l structure in the Overworld’s colder biomes"
	quest.16D1C15080CAD09C.title: "&4&lQuest: Locating the Lich Tower"
	quest.1711C31AE2F6F7ED.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&b&lApplied Energistics 2&r adds powerful &e&llogistics&r and &e&lstorage solutions&r to your Minecraft world. Replace that massive room full of chests with a &b&lcompact ME Network&r, capable of storing, sorting, and automating items from multiple mods."
		""
		"With an &b&lME Network&r, you can:"
		""
		"- &e&lAutomatically craft&r complex items with a single click"
		""
		"- &e&lKeep specified quantities&r of items in stock and craft more as needed"
		""
		"- &e&lSeamlessly transfer items&r around your base"
		""
		"Explore the mod to understand how it can transform the way you manage resources and automate crafting in your world."
	]
	quest.1711C31AE2F6F7ED.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &b&lApplied Energistics 2&f mod&r"
	quest.1711C31AE2F6F7ED.title: "&9&lWelcome to AE2&r"
	quest.17145AF8EC3AE7CB.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Autocrafting is one of the &b&lprimary functions&r of Applied Energistics 2. Instead of manually crafting every ingredient, your &b&lME System&r can handle it automatically, crafting sub-items, maintaining stock, and even working with fluids or gases (with compatible addons)."
		""
		"It's a complex feature, but also one of the most powerful. Let's learn the basics."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"An autocrafting setup consists of 3 core parts:"
		""
		"- The thing sending the &b&lcrafting request&r"
		""
		"- The &b&lcrafting CPU&r"
		""
		"- The &b&lME Pattern Provider&r"
		""
		"Here's how it works step by step:"
		""
		"A crafting request is created either manually in a terminal or automatically by an &b&lExport Bus&r or Interface with a crafting card."
		""
		"The &b&lME System&r calculates all the ingredients and required steps, storing the task in the selected Crafting CPU."
		""
		"The &b&lME Pattern Provider&r sends the required ingredients to the correct machine."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"If the recipe is a &b&lcrafting pattern&r (made in a Crafting Table), the ingredients go to a &b&lMolecular Assembler&r. If it's a &b&lprocessing pattern&r, they go to another machine, such as a furnace, crusher, or modded processor."
		""
		"The result must then return to the network via an &b&lImport Bus&r, Interface, or directly into a &b&lPattern Provider&r. An item must &b&lenter the network&r through one of these components for AE2 to recognize it as completed. If the craft was part of a larger request, the intermediate items are stored in the CPU and used for the next step."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"To get started, craft the following components:"
		""
		"- &b&lMolecular Assembler&r"
		"- &b&lME Pattern Provider&r"
		"- &b&lCrafting Storage&r and &b&lCrafting Unit&r (for your CPU)"
		"- &b&lBlank Patterns&r"
		"- &b&lME Pattern Terminal&r"
		""
		"Once you have these, you can start creating automated recipes and let your ME System handle the work for you!"
	]
	quest.17145AF8EC3AE7CB.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft all the components needed to begin &b&lautocrafting&r &f&lwith Applied Energistics 2&r"
	quest.175C9A07B7C65F86.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to &2&lMowzie’s Mobs&r, one of the community’s most iconic creature mods.&r It adds a roster of new bosses and mobs to the world, each with distinctive attack patterns and powerful unique drops&r.&r"
		""
		"Your journey with this mod starts here, so gear up for the challenges ahead.&r From the jungle‑dwelling Foliaath to the freezing Frostmaw, every encounter offers a fresh combat experience and valuable rewards—prepare your equipment and step into the fray&r.&r"
	]
	quest.175C9A07B7C65F86.quest_subtitle: "&l&fDiscover the &2&lMowzie’s Mobs&r&l&f mod and face your first new foe&r"
	quest.175C9A07B7C65F86.title: "&4&lWelcome to Mowzie's Mobs"
	quest.175D6311A5011D9F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"In the arcane world, raw Experience needs to be stored as items before it can be truly controlled.&r The easiest method is the powerful &8&lBlack Hole&r, which automatically absorbs nearby XP orbs and later spits out valuable &a&lXpetrified Orbs&r.&r"
		""
		"Alternatively, you can sacrifice enchanted gear at your &5&lHephaestus Forge&r.&r Place an enchanted item in the experience slot and the Forge will strip its enchantments, turning them into stored experience to fill its internal bar; mastering both methods gives you full control over your progression&r.&r"
	]
	quest.175D6311A5011D9F.quest_subtitle: "&l&fAcquire &a&lXP in item form&r&l&f by using a Black Hole or the Hephaestus Forge&r"
	quest.175D6311A5011D9F.title: "&5&lQuest: Harnessing the Arcane XP"
	quest.177D20C7DB4C6F1A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lPetiole Music Disc&r is a rare, secret collectible track composed by Ludo Crap.&r To earn this disc you must satisfy a very specific condition tied to weather and the Frostmaw fight&r.&r"
		""
		"Defeat a Frostmaw while it is actively snowing or raining in its biome; only then can the Petiole disc drop as a hidden reward.&r Time the battle with the storm, bring down the beast, and you will be able to enjoy this special tune born from the depths of the deep freeze&r.&r"
	]
	quest.177D20C7DB4C6F1A.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain the &b&lMusic Disc Petiole&r&l&f by slaying a Frostmaw while it is snowing&r"
	quest.177D20C7DB4C6F1A.title: "&4&lQuest: The Petiole Disc"
	quest.17906E39EE1377FE.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&e&lConveyor Belts&r are simple but essential components in &b&lImmersive Engineering&r automation. They &e&lmove items&r in the direction they face, allowing you to transport materials efficiently between machines and storage."
		""
		"&e&lConveyor Belts&r can automatically pull items from inventories and insert items into connected inventories, making them perfect for building &e&lfully automated production lines&r. Affordable and easy to craft, they are one of the first steps toward creating a seamless industrial workflow."
	]
	quest.17906E39EE1377FE.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &e&lConveyor Belt&r"
	quest.17906E39EE1377FE.title: "&9&lQuest: Conveyor Belt"
	quest.1796DF4E8FEA0E7A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to &9&lForbidden and Arcanus&f&r, a mod that dives deep into &9&lmagic&r and the occult, blending elements from fantasy, the supernatural, and mythology into a world that still feels close to vanilla Minecraft.&f"
		""
		"Your adventure starts now: explore the &a&lnew world&r content, track down mysterious &a&lresources&r and hidden relics, and uncover secrets inspired by classic RPGs and legends. As your gear improves, your &9&lmagical power&r will grow too, all balanced so it feels rewarding instead of overwhelming."
		""
		"Dive into the &5&larcane arts&r, experiment with strange materials, and stay alert for anything unexpected along the way. Who knows, maybe even a wandering UFO will cross your path at some point. Above all, &a&lenjoy the journey&r and have fun."
	]
	quest.1796DF4E8FEA0E7A.quest_subtitle: "&l&fDiscover the &9Forbidden &fand &9Arcanus &fmod and begin your magical journey"
	quest.1796DF4E8FEA0E7A.title: "&5&lUnlocking the Forbidden Arcanum"
	quest.180D431BA5FFCFB0.quest_desc: [
		"mierda mierda mierda"
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/teddy.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.180D431BA5FFCFB0.quest_subtitle: "buscar tierra"
	quest.180D431BA5FFCFB0.title: "mierda"
	quest.1833ACAA90D86AA0.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Advanced AE focuses on &b&lconvenience&r and &b&luser experience improvements&r for your &b&lME System&r. This mod introduces powerful tools and upgrades that take automation and storage to a whole new level."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lAdvanced Pattern Providers&r"
		""
		"By using the &b&lAdvanced Pattern Encoder&r, you can modify &b&lProcessing Patterns&r to select which face each input is sent to. This removes the need for complex piping setups and allows better integration with machines that require specific input sides."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/advancedpattern.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lQuantum Computer&r"
		""
		"The &b&lQuantum Computer&r is a special kind of &b&lCrafting Unit&r capable of running unlimited crafting tasks. As long as sufficient crafting storage is available, all concurrent tasks can share &b&lco-processors&r inside the &b&lQuantum Computer&r multiblock."
		""
		"The &b&lQuantum Core&r alone provides 256M storage and 8 co-processors, but by expanding it into a multiblock with:"
		""
		"- &b&lQuantum Data Entanglers&r (x4 storage)"
		"- &b&lQuantum Multi-Threaders&r (x4 co-processors)"
		""
		"You can scale it up to a 5x5x5 multiblock that only uses 1 channel for all its computing power!"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/quantumcomputer.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lQuantum Crafter&r"
		""
		"A very powerful autocrafter capable of executing &b&lmultiple recipes per tick&r while accessing your ME inventory directly. It supports:"
		""
		"- &b&lRecursive crafting&r (e.g., smithing templates)"
		"- &b&lPartial-consumption recipes&r (like Mystical Agriculture essences)"
		"- &b&lStock management&r to limit ingredient or product quantities"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/quantumcrafter.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lQuantum Armor Set&r"
		""
		"The &b&lQuantum Armor&r connects to your &b&lME System&r to harness its resources for quality-of-life upgrades. It provides:"
		""
		"- &b&lFlight with no inertia&r"
		"- &b&lNight Vision&r"
		"- &b&lMagnet functionality&r"
		"- &b&lAuto-feeding from ME Storage&r"
		"- &b&lDamage immunities and powerful defense&r"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/quantumarmorset.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lReaction Chamber&r"
		""
		"A power-hungry machine that provides efficient material processing for Advanced AE items and other mods. It's crucial for crafting late-game components and optimizing production efficiency."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/reactionchamber.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lStock Export Bus&r"
		""
		"This upgraded &b&lExport Bus&r can &b&lregulate exact quantities&r of items in a target inventory. It automatically maintains the defined stock levels and supports a &b&lCrafting Card&r to craft missing items when needed."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/stockexport.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lME Throughput Monitor&r"
		""
		"A monitoring device for tracking items, fluids, and energy in your system. You can configure it to display throughput per tick per second or bar, mining using the &b&lThroughput Monitor Configuration&r. Perfect for keeping an eye on performance and bottlenecks in large-scale ME networks."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/aemonitor.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lPro Tip:&r Combine the &b&lQuantum Computer&r and &b&lQuantum Crafter&r for the ultimate autocrafting setup, near-instant crafting across massive tasks!"
	]
	quest.1833ACAA90D86AA0.quest_subtitle: "&f&lExplore the advanced AE mod and understand its features that expand Applied Energistics 2&r"
	quest.1833ACAA90D86AA0.title: " &9&lQuest: Discover Advanced AE&r"
	quest.184CCBE19F9DB7C1.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &8&lClibano&r is a powerful Blast Furnace upgrade that speeds up smelting and enables new alloys.&r To start, gather 18 Polished Darkstone Bricks, 8 Polished Darkstone, and 1 &8&lClibano Core&r.&r"
		""
		"Build the structure from Darkstone blocks and place the Core in the correct spot.&r Use &d&lMundabitur Dust&r on the Core to transform it; the Clibano will then handle smelting and, with an &a&lArtisan Relic&r in the Enhancer Slot, alloy creation such as &8&lObsidiansteel Ingot&r.&r Try Soul Fire or Enchanted Fire to boost speed and farm Residues for extra ore output&r.&r"
	]
	quest.184CCBE19F9DB7C1.quest_subtitle: "&l&fBuild the &8&lClibano multiblock&r&l&f and transform it with Mundabitur Dust&r"
	quest.184CCBE19F9DB7C1.title: "&5&lQuest: Constructing the Clibano"
	quest.18AD9420F0E716C2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"When &6&lPhoenix Armor&r&f meets the cool depths of water, it hardens into &8&lObsidian Armor&r&f. This resilient set represents balance between fire and flow, strength and calm. Take the plunge, quench the flames, and claim armor forged from both extremes."
	]
	quest.18AD9420F0E716C2.quest_subtitle: "&f&lHave a full set of &8&lObsidian Armor&r&f&l in your inventory"
	quest.18AD9420F0E716C2.title: "&7&lQuest: Forged in Fire, Tempered by Water"
	quest.18F187431534F8F1.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The formidable &7&lForgotten&r&f who patrol the catacombs sometimes wield a prized weapon: the &6&lCloggrum Battleaxe&r&f. This axe is not easily crafted, making it a rare war trophy worthy of a true explorer."
		""
		"Track down the specific Forgotten holding this brutal weapon, cut it down in battle, and claim the axe as your own. Expect a tough fight, they will not hand over their favorite toy without a struggle."
	]
	quest.18F187431534F8F1.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain a &6&lCloggrum Battleaxe&r&f&l by defeating a &7&lForgotten&r&f&l carrying the weapon"
	quest.18F187431534F8F1.title: "&7&lQuest: The Cloggrum War-Trophy"
	quest.196344D8E992B589.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fWith the &c&lCrystallized Blood&r&f in hand, approach the &e&lWild Antlion&r&f from behind, unseen."
		""
		"&fInteract with the &a&lglowing blood&r&f on its back to calm it and complete the taming ritual."
		""
		"&fIf it notices you, it will &c&lburrow&r&f and &c&lattack&r&f, so patience and timing are essential."
		""
		"&fOnce tamed, the &d&lAntlion becomes a loyal companion&r&f, fierce and powerful beneath the desert sun."
	]
	quest.196344D8E992B589.quest_subtitle: "&f&lUse &b&lCrystallized Blood&r&f&l to tame a &c&lWild Antlion&r"
	quest.196344D8E992B589.title: "&6&lQuest: Tame the Antlion"
	quest.19F263369B7710F1.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Silence and shadow stop being a problem once you wear this powerful trinket.&r The &b&lSpectral Eye Amulet&r is a coveted magical item that, while in your inventory, passively gives the Glowing effect to all entities near you&r.&r"
		""
		"With this amulet, no monster will ever sneak up on you again.&r Track down the recipe or loot location to keep full vision and tactical awareness in the darkest caves and during the blackest nights, becoming a true master of light and sight&r.&r"
	]
	quest.19F263369B7710F1.quest_subtitle: "&l&fAcquire the &b&lSpectral Eye Amulet&r&l&f to illuminate nearby entities&r"
	quest.19F263369B7710F1.title: "&5&lQuest: The Spectral Eye Amulet"
	quest.1A41D9FC4040F904.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The magic and mystery of the &e&lEternal Starlight&r&f are vast, and guessing your way through them will not get you very far. The &e&lStarlight Story&r&f is a key book that holds the lore, important &a&lrecipes&r&f, and the basic guidance you need to survive and advance in this cosmic realm."
		""
		"Figure out how to get your hands on this book, whether through early crafting, careful exploration, or dealing with the right &b&lentity&r&f. With the &e&lStarlight Story&r&f in your inventory, the deeper layers of the dimension will finally start to make sense."
	]
	quest.1A41D9FC4040F904.quest_subtitle: "&f&lAcquire the &e&lStarlight Story&r&f&l, the essential guide to the dimension"
	quest.1A41D9FC4040F904.title: "&7&lQuest: The Starlight Story"
	quest.1A4B8D9E254D3EC8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &8&lDried Ghast Block&r&f is a mysterious relic found in Nether Fossils or crafted by skilled alchemists. &a&lWaterlog it&r&f and wait about 30 minutes to witness a Ghastling come to life."
		""
		"&fEach hydration stage emits sounds and particles, signaling your progress. &d&lBring the block to life&r&f and witness the first step in the Ghast's rebirth."
	]
	quest.1A4B8D9E254D3EC8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &e&lDried Ghast Block&r&f&l using 1 &e&lSoul Sand&r&f&l and 8 &e&lGhast Tears"
	quest.1A4B8D9E254D3EC8.title: "&6&lQuest: Create a Dried Ghast Block"
	quest.1ACF9EA31B247BCE.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lThermoelectric Generator&r is an advanced &b&lImmersive Engineering&r power generation block that converts &e&ltemperature differences&r into &b&lImmersive Flux (IF)&r or &e&lRedstone Flux (RF)&r. To generate power, place high temperature and low temperature blocks directly across from each other on the generator's sides."
		""
		"The generator itself does not store energy internally, so measurement tools like &a&lThe One Probe&r or &a&lWAILA&r will show 0 Flux at all times. It has enough faces for two block sets plus a connector, allowing practical energy extraction. While three block sets are theoretically possible, extracting power without blocking a face is challenging."
		""
		"The maximum practical output is &e&l93 IF/t&r, making it a compact yet clever source of renewable energy for your factory setups."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/generatorimmersive.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.1ACF9EA31B247BCE.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &e&lThermoelectric Generator&r"
	quest.1ACF9EA31B247BCE.title: "&9&lQuest: Thermoelectric Generator"
	quest.1C6519274D7477E1.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lQuarryPlus&r is an advanced automated miner capable of digging down to a specified depth over an area of up to 256 x 256 blocks. Its enchantments enhance efficiency and allow for specialized mining effects such as &e&lFortune&r and &b&lSilk Touch&r, improving resource yield and conserving energy."
		""
		"Set it up with proper power management, then watch as it systematically clears terrain, collects resources, and delivers them for processing. This is the ultimate tool for large scale mining projects, combining automation, efficiency, and enchantment bonuses for maximum output."
	]
	quest.1C6519274D7477E1.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lQuarryPlus&r"
	quest.1C6519274D7477E1.title: "&9&lQuest: QuarryPlus"
	quest.1C805748C286A05A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to &6&lPaladins and Priests&r&f, which brings divine combat and healing archetypes into your adventure. Your path lies somewhere between the righteous &6&lPaladin&r&f and the protective &b&lPriest&r&f."
		""
		"To begin, track down a &d&lSpell Binding Table&r&f in a village gazebo, or craft one yourself with &f&lbookshelves&r&f around it. Use this table to create your first holy manual."
		""
		"The &6&lPaladin Libram&r&f grants spells that shield allies and smite enemies, working best with heavy arms like &6&lHammers&r&f or &6&lClaymores&r&f (plus a shield if you like staying upright). The &b&lHoly Book&r&f focuses on healing and protecting allies, along with holy attacks to punish foes, and pairs well with &b&lHoly Staves&r&f and &b&lWands&r&f."
		""
		"Paladins mainly use &6&lHammers&r&f or &6&lMaces&r&f, while Priests fight with &b&lHoly Wands&r&f and &b&lStaves&r&f, which you receive with your first spell. Remember that &d&lRunes&r&f serve as ammunition for your magic. Master your chosen role and try the new craftable armor sets built to boost both your damage and your healing."
	]
	quest.1C805748C286A05A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &6&lPaladins and Priests&r&f&l mod and choose your sacred calling"
	quest.1C805748C286A05A.title: "&a&lThe Path of the Devout"
	quest.1CAEEC60D413E5A8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fBefore any construction can begin, your colony needs a &a&lBuilder&r&f!"
		""
		"&fCraft and place a &a&lBuilder's Hut&r&f block just like you did with the Town Hall. Once placed, assign a citizen as your Builder to begin the construction process."
		""
		"&fRemember: your Builder must first construct their own hut before they can work on any other buildings. They also cannot build or upgrade structures to a higher level than their own hut's level, so make sure to upgrade their hut as your colony grows!"
	]
	quest.1CAEEC60D413E5A8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lPlace and build a &a&lBuilder's Hut&r"
	quest.1CAEEC60D413E5A8.title: "&6&lStep 3: Builder"
	quest.1CE98A36C5F1302E.quest_desc: [
		""
		"To advance further into Mobstein’s resurrection magic, you need a reliable way to harvest specific organs from assembled bodies.&r The &f&lOrgan Extractor&r is the specialized machine required for this stage of the process&r.&r"
		""
		"To operate it, place any Full Body together with Tweezers on the Extractor and activate the device; it will randomly produce one organ from that mob’s organ tree.&r This machine is essential for securing the rare organs needed for advanced crafting and more complex Mobstein assemblies&r.&r"
	]
	quest.1CE98A36C5F1302E.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft the &f&lOrgan Extractor&r&l&f to obtain mob organ parts&r"
	quest.1CE98A36C5F1302E.title: "&5&lQuest: Crafting the Organ Extractor"
	quest.1CEA882FCF0D2EDF.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &4&lDestructor&r&f is the &lopposite&r of the Constructor."
		""
		"&fInstead of placing items, it &4&ldestroys blocks&r&f or &c&lremoves items&r&f from the world in front of it, automatically sending any drops directly into your &b&lstorage network&r&f."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lHow It Works"
		""
		"&fPlace the &4&lDestructor&r&f facing the block or area you want it to monitor."
		""
		"&fOnce powered and connected to the &b&lController&r&f, it will automatically break any block that appears in front of it."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lConfiguration"
		""
		"&fOpen its interface to specify which kinds of blocks or items it should break."
		""
		"&fCombine it with &2&lSpeed&r&f and &a&lSilk Touch Upgrades&r&f to make it faster or preserve block drops."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lAutomation Example"
		""
		"&fPair a &4&lDestructor&r&f with a &b&lConstructor&r&f to build &a&lautomatic crop farms&r&f or &a&lresource collectors&r&f."
		""
		"&fFor example, the &b&lConstructor&r&f places crops, and the &4&lDestructor&r&f harvests them when grown for &a&lfully automated farming&r&f."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip"
		""
		"&fUse &b&lFilters&r&f to prevent unwanted blocks from being destroyed, and use &c&lRedstone mode&r&f for precise control over when it operates."
	]
	quest.1CEA882FCF0D2EDF.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &4&lDestructor&r&f&l and connect it to your &b&lRefined Storage&r&f&l network to automatically &4&ldestroy blocks&r&f&l and &2&lcollect drops&r&f&l"
	quest.1CEA882FCF0D2EDF.title: "&9&lQuest: Crafting the Destructor"
	quest.1CF0103A8C2BE9A7.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to &d&lRelics&r&f, a mod that adds over 40 unique pieces of powerful combat trinkets. These artifacts are built to enhance your spells and fighting skills with special perks and stylish designs."
		""
		"Your job is to track down these key pieces of gear. A few relics can be crafted using gems from the &6&lJewelry&r&f mod, but most are hidden in dangerous places: search &6&ldungeon chests&r&f and defeat strong foes like demi-bosses (for example the &c&lEvoker&r&f) and major bosses such as the &c&lWither&r&f and &c&lEnder Dragon&r&f. Start the hunt and fill your loadout with these game-changing items."
	]
	quest.1CF0103A8C2BE9A7.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &d&lRelics&r&f&l mod and obtain your first combat trinket"
	quest.1CF0103A8C2BE9A7.title: "&a&lUncovering the Ancient Relics"
	quest.1CF289F843EAE76D.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &a&lGarden Awakens&r&f update for Vanilla Backport brings a hauntingly beautiful new biome: the &a&lPale Garden&r&f. Venture into a quiet, eerie forest&r&f of Pale Oaks, Pale Moss, and whispering Eyeblossoms."
		""
		"&fBut beware, hidden within the trees lies the &c&lSculking Heart&r&f and its terrifying guardian, the &c&lSculking Mob&r&f. A new world of mystery, beauty, and danger awaits you beneath the pale canopy."
	]
	quest.1CF289F843EAE76D.quest_subtitle: "&f&lBegin your exploration of the mysterious &a&lPale Garden&r&f&l biome"
	quest.1D0FAB4B51D80E21.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &8&lObsidilith&r&f is a powerful boss that appears in rare structures scattered across the &5&lEnd Islands&r&f.&r This creature fights with &d&lelemental attacks&r&f that inflict different &c&ldebuffs&r&f on you, turning the battlefield into a very hostile place very quickly.&r"
		""
		"To win this tough fight, you must learn the &8&lObsidilith&r&f’s attack patterns and react at the right moment.&r Once the boss falls, a small &8&lObsidian Tower&r&f will appear, containing a &d&lShulker Box&r&f full of loot as your well‑earned prize.&r"
	]
	quest.1D0FAB4B51D80E21.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the &8&lObsidilith&r&f&l boss found in rare structures in the &5&lEnd"
	quest.1D0FAB4B51D80E21.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Obsidilith"
	quest.1D30DBEF017EADF0.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lInscription Table&r is an essential workstation for any spellcaster who wants full control over their magic.&r It lets you slot spells from scrolls directly into your Spell Books so you can cast them repeatedly without consuming the original scroll&r.&r"
		""
		"Craft one using magical components or track it down inside mystical structures added by the mod.&r Once you have it, start inscribing your power onto the pages and slowly build your personal grimoire of spells&r.&r"
	]
	quest.1D30DBEF017EADF0.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain an &b&lInscription Table&r&l&f&r"
	quest.1D30DBEF017EADF0.title: "&5&lQuest: The Inscription Table"
	quest.1D5645F3BF21B0F2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Ignis is the &c&lfinal boss&r of the mod, a towering embodiment of fire waiting at the peak of the &c&lBurning Arena&r. This fight uses a &c&lmulti-phase system&r starting with Ignis at &a&l450 Health&r and a special damage mechanic that scales with your own max health."
		""
		"Key mechanics and phases:"
		""
		"Summoning: Use &c&lBurning Ashes&r on the &c&lAltar of Fire&r after slaying the Ignited Revenant guards."
		""
		"Blazing Brand: His sword hits apply a debuff that strips armor points and powers his &c&llife-steal&r ability."
		""
		"Deflecting: You can knock his &d&lpink fireballs&r back at him; three clean deflects will break his shield."
		""
		"Phase Two (66% HP): &b&lBlue flames&r appear, boosting his attack speed and making him far more aggressive."
		""
		"Phase Three (33% HP): Ignis discards his shield, gains extra attack power, uses &c&lShield Discombobulation&r with his arm, and slams down overhead strikes that create &c&lfire pillars&r."
		""
		"Rewards: Drops &a&lIgnitium Ingots&r used to craft the armor set, the &6&lIncinerator sword&r, and the &b&lBulwark of the Flame shield&r upon victory."
	]
	quest.1D5645F3BF21B0F2.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat &c&lIgnis &fthe ultimate fire knight boss of the Burning Arena&r"
	quest.1D5645F3BF21B0F2.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Ignis, the Fire Knight"
	quest.1D8852115C39A465.quest_desc: [
		""
		"This dimension swarms with fast, flying and generally unpleasant mobs. Basic melee tools will not always save you in a ranged fight."
		""
		"Put together a simple &6&lSlingshot&r&f so you have a reliable ranged weapon at your side. With it, you finally have a fair shot at anything that prefers to stay just out of reach."
	]
	quest.1D8852115C39A465.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &6&lSlingshot&r&f&l"
	quest.1D8852115C39A465.title: "&7&lQuest: Your New Best Friend"
	quest.1D94B1B9FD40AB83.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lIce Crystal&r is a rare, powerful ranged weapon that channels concentrated winter energy.&r You can acquire it in two different ways: by theft from a sleeping Frostmaw or as loot after killing the beast&r.&r"
		""
		"Stealing: Sneak up to a sleeping Frostmaw and snatch the Crystal from its hand before it wakes and swallows it, making the fight much easier.&r Looting: If the Frostmaw manages to swallow the Crystal, defeat it in battle to recover the treasure from its corpse&r.&r"
		""
		"When held and charged by holding right‑click, the Ice Crystal releases an icy whirlwind that damages and eventually freezes enemies in place.&r Master this artifact to wield the chilling power of the cold against your foes&r.&r"
	]
	quest.1D94B1B9FD40AB83.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain the &b&lIce Crystal&r&l&f either by stealing it from a sleeping Frostmaw or by slaying it&r"
	quest.1D94B1B9FD40AB83.title: "&4&lQuest: Securing the Ice Crystal"
	quest.1E0AA4BDAF5614FA.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &8&lDark Forest Tower&r&f, also called the &8&lTwilight Knight Stronghold&r&f, is a huge, difficult structure hidden deep inside the &8&lDark Forest&r&f biome. Its entrance is hard to spot and often buried in the shadows."
		""
		"To open this dungeon properly, you must first defeat the &6&lTwilight Lich&r&f. Then find the portal room inside the Stronghold and place one of your &6&lboss trophies&r&f on the nearby pedestal to unlock the sealed gate. If you prefer the noisy route, you can always mine the blocks around the entrance and make your own way in—just be ready for tough mobs and a demanding dungeon."
	]
	quest.1E0AA4BDAF5614FA.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind and enter the &8&lDark Forest Tower&r&f&l &8&l(Twilight Knight Stronghold)&r&f&l"
	quest.1E0AA4BDAF5614FA.title: "&7&lQuest: Infiltrating the Dark Forest Tower"
	quest.1E155735E074FE72.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to a set of &b&luseful hints&r to improve your &e&lApplied Energistics 2&r experience. These will help you keep your network &e&lefficient&r, &e&lstable&r, and &e&lclean&r."
		""
		"- Keep your network &e&ltreelike&r and avoid loops to prevent network errors."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Here are some essential tips for building with &b&lAE2&r:"
		""
		"- &e&lGroup full-block devices&r in sets of 8 or fewer unless you understand &b&lAE2 channel routing&r deeply."
		""
		"- &e&lPick one type of wood&r for all your patterns, preventing recipe mismatch issues."
		""
		"- &e&lArrange your patterns vertically&r in the Pattern Access Terminal."
		""
		"- &e&lDistribute patterns&r between providers to allow parallel crafting."
		""
		"These recommendations will help you build efficient and organized &b&lAE2&r systems that work smoothly and scale effectively."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Here are more essential tips for optimizing your &b&lAE2&r system:"
		""
		"- &e&lAdd an Energy Cell&r to your network to handle power spikes."
		""
		"- You can use &e&lwater&r in the &b&lFlatter Condenser&r for faster conversion."
		""
		"- &e&lKeep your storage clean&r, avoiding storing random mob loot like swords or armor; each unique durability or enchantment counts as a new item type."
		""
		"These practices will help maintain an efficient and organized &b&lAE2&r network that runs smoothly and reliably."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Here are more essential tips for optimizing your &b&lAE2&r network:"
		""
		"- &e&lAlways ensure that items&r enter your network through a valid &b&lAE2 component&r such as an &b&lME Import Bus&r, &b&lInterface&r, or &b&lPattern Provider&r."
		""
		"- The &b&lME Pattern Provider&r pushes complete recipe batches only through one side, great for automation control."
		""
		"- Use &b&lME Interfaces&r as buffer chests or tanks. They can hold multiple items or fluids at once."
		""
		"- Remember you can zoom and rotate guidebook scenes that have the annotation buttons."
		""
		"Following these practices will help you build more robust and efficient &b&lAE2&r systems."
	]
	quest.1E155735E074FE72.quest_subtitle: "&f&lRead and apply essential &b&lAE2&f building recommendations&r"
	quest.1E912E3BEA075260.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lStarlight Dimension&r&f is filled with magical and mysterious ecosystems. From glowing &7&ldust fields&r&f to dark, cursed &2&lwoodlands&r&f, you will need to head out and visit every distinct natural region this cosmos can offer."
		""
		"Travel through both the familiar and the strange corners of this realm. Finish your grand survey of all the dimension’s unique &e&lbiomes&r&f to truly earn the title of master of the geography of the &e&lEternal Starlight&r&f."
	]
	quest.1E912E3BEA075260.quest_subtitle: "&f&lExplore &e&lall biomes&r&f&l found within the &e&lEternal Starlight&r&f&l dimension"
	quest.1E912E3BEA075260.title: "&7&lQuest: Master of the Starlight Atlas"
	quest.1F0F5B3693BB684B.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Traveling through the &2&lTwilight Forest&r&f demands good navigation. Your quest starts with tracking down a &7&lRaven Feather&r&f, an important ingredient for higher-tier magical items."
		""
		"To get this feather, hunt a &7&lRaven&r&f, a mob that roams the dimension’s thick forests. Once you have the feather, combine it with &a&lTorch Berries&r&f and a piece of &e&lGlowstone&r&f to craft a &d&lMagic Map Focus&r&f, which is the key to revealing the hidden structures scattered across the dimension."
	]
	quest.1F0F5B3693BB684B.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind a &7&lRaven Feather&r&f&l to craft magical navigation tools"
	quest.1F0F5B3693BB684B.title: "&7&lQuest: The Raven's Feather"
	quest.1F59E42019A068B3.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &d&lCloak&r&f is a mysterious companion born from the &c&lRespawn Totem&r&f. &a&lUse the sacred Old Cloth&r&f to awaken it and gain its protection."
		""
		"&fThe &d&lCloak&r&f can unleash holy stars upon foes and even shroud you in invisibility, shielding you from danger."
	]
	quest.1F59E42019A068B3.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSummon the &d&lCloak&r&f&l companion using the &c&lRespawn Totem&r&f&l and &a&lOld Cloth"
	quest.1F59E42019A068B3.title: "&6&lQuest: Summon the Cloak"
	quest.1F8E6C21E60535CA.quest_desc: [
		""
		"From the ashes of the &6&lSun Spirit&r&f’s defeat, the &6&lPhoenix Armor&r&f rises, glowing with eternal flame. "
		""
		"Each piece radiates warmth and power, a reward worthy of those who have conquered the skies. Wear it proudly, hero, you have earned the fire of the heavens."
	]
	quest.1F8E6C21E60535CA.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain a piece of &6&lPhoenix Armor&r&f&l from the &6&lGold Dungeon&r&f&l"
	quest.1F8E6C21E60535CA.title: "&7&lQuest: Wings of the Phoenix"
	quest.1FAE34D9786AC631.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fAmong the treasures hidden in the &b&lIce Spike Castle&r&f, you may uncover a mysterious relic of the past, the &c&lFrozen Ancient Meat&r&f. This meat has been sealed in ice for countless ages, and cannot be eaten in its frozen state."
		""
		"&fTo restore its warmth and flavor, place it above a &6&lCampfire&r&f to defrost it. Once thawed, it becomes &a&lAncient Meat&r&f, ready to cook and enjoy, providing excellent nourishment and saturation."
		""
		"&fHandle it carefully, it's a taste from another era."
	]
	quest.1FAE34D9786AC631.quest_subtitle: "&f&lUse &c&lFrozen Ancient Meat&r&f&l on a &6&lCampfire&r"
	quest.1FAE34D9786AC631.title: "&6&lQuest: Thawing the Ancient Meat"
	quest.204E0BEBF74B8F8D.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Spirit Altar is the central component for all your initial arcane progression, allowing you to infuse Spirits into objects and create new materials."
		""
		"To craft this vital structure, you need a combination of basic and processed resources: Gold, Runewood Planks, and Processed Soulstone. Once placed, the Altar enables you to perform the crucial Spirit Infusions, unlocking the power of the Soul Arcana."
	]
	quest.204E0BEBF74B8F8D.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Spirit Altar&r, the main ritual site for Infusions."
	quest.204E0BEBF74B8F8D.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Building the Spirit Altar 🔮🔥"
	quest.2068470C226B779F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Realm RPG: Sea Dwellers plunges your adventure into the deep ocean, adding a new species called &b&lMeromorphs&r.&r These ocean folk live in their own villages, follow unique professions, and trade using items introduced by the mod&r.&r"
		""
		"To get started, head to an Ocean biome and search for a &b&lSea Village&r.&r These settlements generate procedurally in different layouts and building styles, so each one feels a bit different—find a village and begin interacting with the Meromorphs to access all the new content&r.&r"
	]
	quest.2068470C226B779F.quest_subtitle: "&l&fDiscover the &b&lSea Dwellers&r&l&f mod and meet the ocean’s new inhabitants&r"
	quest.2068470C226B779F.title: "&4&lWelcome to Realm RPG: Sea Dwellers"
	quest.210086271607A193.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &8&lWrought Helm&r is a trophy that proves your victory over the ancient armored boss, the Ferrous Wroughtnaut.&r Visually matching the knight’s own headgear, this helm is guaranteed to drop when the Wroughtnaut is finally defeated&r.&r"
		""
		"Stat‑wise, the Wrought Helm is similar to an Iron Helmet, giving two armor points and one point of knockback resistance.&r Its standout trait is that it is completely unbreakable, so it will never shatter no matter how much damage you take while wearing it&r.&r"
	]
	quest.210086271607A193.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain the &8&lWrought Helm&r&l&f dropped by the Ferrous Wroughtnaut&r"
	quest.210086271607A193.title: "&4&lQuest: Claiming the Wrought Helm"
	quest.2127D4DA7D1714CE.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to &5&lL_Ender’s Cataclysm&r&f, a massive mod that adds seven different &c&lbosses&r&f and a whole range of new &8&lstructures&r&f and &8&lblocks&r&f to test your skills.&r Each encounter is designed to push you harder than the last, so get ready for some serious fights.&r"
		""
		"Every boss comes with its own theme and attack style, giving you some of the most memorable battles you will face in this world.&r Your adventure starts now: learn the basics, find out how each &e&lEye&r&f works, and use their unique recipes to locate the seven different &8&lstrongholds&r&f tied to each boss.&r Prepare to rediscover the &5&lEnd&r&f all over again.&r"
	]
	quest.2127D4DA7D1714CE.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &5&lL_Ender’s Cataclysm&r&f&l mod and begin your journey"
	quest.2127D4DA7D1714CE.title: "&4&lWelcome to L_Ender's Cataclysm"
	quest.2189B97FB43346BD.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &a&lExternal Storage&r lets your &d&lRefined Storage&r network use existing inventories, like &e&lChests&r, &e&lDrawers&r, or other modded containers, as part of your digital system. It's perfect for combining traditional storage with your new refined network."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&l&fHow It Works"
		""
		"Place the &a&lExternal Storage&r facing the inventory you want to connect. Once connected, you will be able to see the inventory contents in your &b&lGrid&r. You can connect the External Storage to your network using &b&lCables&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&l&fStoring Items&r"
		""
		"Any item inserted into your network that matches a valid slot in the connected inventory will be &2&lstored externally&r&f. This means you can expand storage capacity without relying solely on &1&lStorage Disks&r&f."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&l&fFiltering Options"
		""
		"The &2&lExternal Storage&r&f also features &2&lfilter slots&r&f that let you &2&lcontrol&r&f which resources can enter or leave the attached inventory. This makes it easy to dedicate specific chests for certain materials, like ores, food, or crafting components."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lIntegration Tip"
		""
		"&fExternal Storage works beautifully with mods like &5&lStorage Drawers&r&f or &5&lFunctional Storage&r&f, allowing massive, organized physical storage systems to function as digital extensions of your network."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip"
		""
		"&fUse &b&lpriority settings&r&f to make your &2&lExternal Storage&r&f take precedence over your disks, great for automatically filling &6&ldrawers&r&f before using digital storage!"
	]
	quest.2189B97FB43346BD.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft an &a&lExternal Storage&r&f&l and connect it to an external inventory such as a &e&lChest"
	quest.2189B97FB43346BD.title: "&9&lQuest: Crafting the External Storage"
	quest.225174409AC422DD.quest_desc: [
		"&rHex Hash is one of the most vital reagents in Malum, as it unlocks sixteen key recipes and is required to forge better tools. You must create this powerful substance at your Spirit Altar by performing a specific ritual."
		""
		"Combine Gunpowder with Arcane Spirit in the infusion ritual. Arcane Spirits are obtained by defeating witches or other magical creatures. Craft this hash in large quantities, as it is a highly-used resource for advancing your magic! 🔮"
	]
	quest.225174409AC422DD.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft Hex Hash&r using a Spirit Infusion ritual."
	quest.225174409AC422DD.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4The All-Purpose Reagent 🧪⚗️"
	quest.22C59ECC83C9194B.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &2&lFoliaath&r is a hostile jungle mob that hides among foliage, disguising itself as an ordinary fern.&r These carnivorous plants lie in wait and spring out to bite any nearby creature that strays too close&r.&r"
		""
		"At first, Foliaaths sit inactive and invulnerable with only their fern base visible, then suddenly emerge to attack when something approaches.&r They strike very quickly and are hard to hit up close, so fighting them in melee is risky&r.&r"
		""
		"A safer tactic is to keep your distance and use projectiles, since the Foliaath will briefly rise out of the ground even when you are outside its bite range.&r When defeated, it has a chance to drop a precious Foliaath Seed, letting you claim a piece of this jungle terror for yourself&r.&r"
	]
	quest.22C59ECC83C9194B.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSlay a &2&lFoliaath&r&l&f, the carnivorous plant monster of the jungle&r"
	quest.22C59ECC83C9194B.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Foliaath"
	quest.22D63A7A4296AE37.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have discovered the rare &a&lXpetrified Ore&r and obtained the powerful &a&lXpetrified Orb&r.&r Now you must decide: use it for an instant boost, or save it for a long‑term upgrade—you will find more ore between Y −6 and 35&r.&r"
		""
		"Right‑clicking the Orb immediately grants 91 Experience Points, raising your current level.&r Or you can keep it and later combine it with a &b&lStellarite Piece&r to forge the &e&lEternal Stella&r, a legendary permanent upgrade item.&r Choose wisely how you spend this &a&larcane resource&r.&r"
	]
	quest.22D63A7A4296AE37.quest_subtitle: "&l&fFind &a&lXpetrified Ore&r&l&f, obtain the Orb, and choose its destiny&r"
	quest.22D63A7A4296AE37.title: "&5&lQuest: Harnessing the Xpetrified Orb"
	quest.237EA306CE1DB162.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &8&lDead King&r is the ultimate late‑game challenge in &b&lIron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks&r, lurking deep underground in the eerie Catacombs structure.&r This ancient undead ruler wields dark sorcery and guards some of the mod’s highest‑tier rewards&r.&r"
		""
		"The fight unfolds in multiple phases, mixing brutal melee strikes, dark magic, life‑draining beams, shockwaves, and summoning attacks.&r Defeating him pushes both your spellcasting and your close‑combat skills to the limit&r.&r"
		""
		"Arrive with strong armor, mana potions, and reliable healing magic.&r Holy or Light‑based spells are especially effective against his powers, and victory can yield unique end‑game loot, including the infamous &8&lNecronomicon&r&r.&r"
	]
	quest.237EA306CE1DB162.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSlay the &8&lDead King&r&l&f, the powerful undead boss in the Catacombs&r"
	quest.237EA306CE1DB162.title: "&5&lQuest: Conquering the Dead King"
	quest.23800D78BD19289D.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lEngineer’s Goggles&r are an essential tool for any inventor in &b&lCreate&r, letting you see hidden details about your machines in real time."
		""
		"Crafted from string, &b&lAny Glass&r, and a &e&lGolden Sheet&r, these goggles reveal your factory’s inner workings."
		""
		"While worn, they show &e&lstress impact&r, &e&lrotational speed&r, and &e&lfluid capacity&r when you look at machines, &b&lStressometers&r, or &b&lSpeedometers&r."
		""
		"With the goggles equipped, your eyes tune into the flow of motion and power inside your contraptions, turning messy setups into clear systems of efficiency."
		""
		"Wear them proudly, because every true engineer needs to see the world in gears and motion."
	]
	quest.23800D78BD19289D.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft and wear the &e&lEngineer’s Goggles&r"
	quest.23800D78BD19289D.title: "&9&lQuest: Engineer’s Goggles"
	quest.23C299B740E3C451.quest_desc: [
		"The &eCrusher&f is a defensive ancient creature covered in sharp thorns that protect it from any threat."
		"It remains neutral unless provoked — but its spikes make it dangerous to touch."
		""
		"These creatures can be found near the &6Desert Ruins&f, guarding the secrets buried beneath the sands."
		"If treated with care, you can even &abreed them using Hanging Roots&f, allowing their kind to continue thriving in this new age."
		""
		"Approach with respect… for even calm Crushers strike hard when angered."
	]
	quest.23C299B740E3C451.quest_subtitle: "&7&oObserve a Crusher."
	quest.23C299B740E3C451.title: "&6&lQuest: The Crusher"
	quest.23D19985C660D946.quest_desc: [
		"&rYour ritual needs demand materials forged in fire. The Blazing Quartz Ore is a key resource found only in the hostile environment of the Nether."
		""
		"You must brave the heat and the mobs to locate these ore blocks. Once mined and processed, the resulting quartz is vital for creating Iridescent Ether and other advanced magical items. Prepare your gear and venture into the fiery deep! 🔥"
	]
	quest.23D19985C660D946.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Find Blazing Quartz Ore&r within the Nether dimension."
	quest.23D19985C660D946.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Locating the Blazing Quartz ♨️⛏️"
	quest.2403E4948A1535EF.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The shards left behind by the &7&lForgotten Guardian&r&f are fragments of real power. To unlock that strength, you must gather enough &6&lForgotten Nuggets&r&f and combine them at a crafting table into a single &6&lForgotten Ingot&r&f."
		""
		"This ingot is the base material for the highest tier of gear in this dimension and marks a big step in your control over the Undergarden’s worst threats. Claim it proudly and get ready for your final upgrades."
	]
	quest.2403E4948A1535EF.quest_subtitle: "&f&lForge a &6&lForgotten Ingot&r&f&l from the nuggets dropped by a &7&lForgotten Guardian&r&f&l"
	quest.2403E4948A1535EF.title: "&7&lQuest: The Ancient Forge"
	quest.24C5E31F7CA7A58F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fBy channeling the power of &e&lAmbrosium Shards&r&f through an &a&lAltar&r&f, you can transform raw &d&lGravitite Ore&r&f into &d&lEnchanted Gravitite&r&f."
		""
		"&fThis mystical material has gravity-defying properties and is used to craft powerful tools, armor, and blocks that can even lift themselves into the air."
	]
	quest.24C5E31F7CA7A58F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lUse an &a&lAltar&r&f &lto obtain &d&lEnchanted Gravitite&r&f"
	quest.24C5E31F7CA7A58F.title: "&7&lQuest: Enchanted Gravitite Creation"
	quest.24ECACA9569E0F76.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your infiltration of the Pyramid Outpost will put you face-to-face with the &c&lKobolleton&r, a small skeletal dinosaur warrior wielding an Egyptian sword. This bony fighter may be small, but it hits like it wants your inventory."
		""
		"Upon defeating this dangerous foe, it will drop its &f&lBones&r and the &a&lAncient Metal Ingot&r, which is vital for crafting new tools and equipment. Slay the &c&lKobolleton&r and claim your first &a&ltrophy of the desert&r."
	]
	quest.24ECACA9569E0F76.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSlay a &c&lKobolleton&f, the small skeletal warrior"
	quest.24ECACA9569E0F76.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Kobolleton"
	quest.250A2D7B72212F85.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &a&lSwamp Biome&r&f is a misty, mysterious land filled with murky waters and tangled roots. &a&lThis is where unique creatures like the &c&lGolden Allay&r&f can appear, shimmering among the vines."
		""
		"&fPrepare to explore the wetlands, where magic and nature intertwine. &d&lLocate a Swamp Biome&r&f, your journey into mystical companionship begins here."
	]
	quest.250A2D7B72212F85.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate a &a&lSwamp Biome"
	quest.250A2D7B72212F85.title: "&6&lQuest: Locate a Swamp Biome"
	quest.25D3128DAD72BBCB.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to &b&lIron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks&r, a mod that throws you straight into classic RPG‑style spellcasting.&r Get ready for a long adventure where you will battle dangerous wizards, raid countless structures, and dive deep into dungeon networks&r.&r"
		""
		"Your path starts with your first spell or magical artifact.&r Gather arcane resources, hone your combat magic, and secure your place among the greatest mages in the land—the age of magic has arrived&r.&r"
	]
	quest.25D3128DAD72BBCB.quest_subtitle: "&l&fDiscover the &b&lIron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks&r&l&f mod and embrace the magical fantasy&r"
	quest.25D3128DAD72BBCB.title: "&5&lWelcome to Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks"
	quest.2603E6355D0BABF0.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lIce Spider&r is a powerful new hostile mob tied to the Ice school of magic.&r It dwells in the &b&lIce Spider Den&r, a ruined stone fortress that generates rarely in icy biomes&r.&r"
		""
		"Beware its grappling pounce, which can trap you inside ice and then transfer damage to you if that ice is broken.&r Its mobility is boosted by the ability to crouch and climb, so it can reach you in tight spaces&r.&r"
		""
		"Defeat the Ice Spider to obtain the &b&lIcy Fang&r, a key component for crafting progressive Ice‑school gear such as the Boreal Blade.&r Fire‑based damage or strong mobility gear will give you a big edge in this fight&r.&r"
	]
	quest.2603E6355D0BABF0.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSlay the &b&lIce Spider&r&l&f found within its den&r"
	quest.2603E6355D0BABF0.title: "&5&lQuest: Slaying the Ice Spider"
	quest.264C6AD31B25A58A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fGolem Overhaul adds 9 unique golem types, each with their own special abilities! Some golems, like the &6&lHay Golem&r&f, help protect your crops, while others are mighty defenders capable of challenging even the &c&lWarden&r&f itself."
		""
		"&fPrepare to discover, build, and command your new mechanical allies!"
	]
	quest.264C6AD31B25A58A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lBegin your journey with the &6&lGolem Overhaul&r&f&l and explore the new golems it introduces&r"
	quest.264C6AD31B25A58A.title: "&a&lWelcome to Golem Overhaul!"
	quest.26646FD842708794.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Deep in the heart of the &6&lGold Dungeon&r&f waits the &6&lSun Spirit&r&f, final guardian of the &b&lAether&r&f. Its blazing fury will push your courage and endurance further than ever before. Endure the flames, seize victory, and restore balance to this radiant realm."
	]
	quest.26646FD842708794.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the mighty &6&lSun Spirit&r&f&l within the &6&lGold Dungeon&r&f&l"
	quest.26646FD842708794.title: "&7&lQuest: Defeat the Gold Boss"
	quest.266CED31B43D277A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&f&lThe &b&lAether&r&f, created by &b&lThe Aether Team&r&f, is the original sky dimension, a realm of floating islands, heavenly light, and dangerous beauty."
		""
		"&fMaintained for modern versions of Minecraft and fully multiplayer compatible, it offers a full &a&lsurvival progression&r&f among the clouds."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lA Hostile Paradise"
		""
		"&fThe &b&lAether&r&f is a world above the Overworld, an endless expanse of &b&lskylands&r&f and &b&lcloud islands&r&f."
		""
		"&fBe careful: one wrong step and you will fall straight back to the world below."
		""
		"&fExplore breathtaking scenery, gather &a&lnew resources&r&f, and survive among strange and mystical creatures."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lMaterials and Tools"
		""
		"&fThe &b&lAether&r&f introduces four primary material tiers:"
		""
		"&f&b&lSkyroot&r&f - light and renewable."
		""
		"&f&7&lHolystone&r&f - strong and abundant."
		""
		"&f&d&lZanite&r&f - reactive to your health."
		""
		"&f&5&lGravitite&r&f - allows tools and armor to defy gravity itself."
		""
		"&fEach tier offers &a&lunique effects&r&f and &a&lupgradable tools&r&f for your journey."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lMobs and Dungeons"
		""
		"&fThe skies are filled with &d&lmythical mobs&r&f, both peaceful and deadly."
		""
		"&fTame &a&lMoas&r&f to soar freely through the skies, or challenge the three perilous &c&lboss dungeons&r&f:"
		""
		"&f&6&lBronze Dungeon&r&f - the first test of courage."
		""
		"&f&7&lSilver Dungeon&r&f - a trial of endurance."
		""
		"&f&e&lGold Dungeon&r&f - face the ultimate challenge and claim legendary rewards."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lUtility Blocks"
		""
		"&fDiscover special blocks unique to the &b&lAether&r&f:"
		""
		"&f&a&lAltar&r&f - used for enchanting and item transformation."
		""
		"&f&b&lFreezer&r&f - create new materials through chilling."
		""
		"&f&d&lIncubator&r&f - hatch &a&lMoa eggs&r&f into loyal flying companions."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lAdventure Awaits"
		""
		"&fComplete your journey and conquer all dungeons to unlock control over time itself using the &e&lSun Altar&r&f."
		""
		"&fOnly then can you bring day and night to this eternal paradise."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip"
		""
		"&fCarry plenty of blocks and a parachute mod if available, the &b&lAether&r&f’s beauty hides some very deadly drops."
	]
	quest.266CED31B43D277A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &b&lAether&r&f&l dimension and begin your skybound adventure"
	quest.266CED31B43D277A.title: "&7&lWelcome to The Aether!"
	quest.26F8D87FC3FFFC98.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&b&lPatterns&r are the blueprints of your autocrafting system. They tell your &b&lME Network&r how to make, transform, or process items automatically. All patterns begin as &b&lBlank Patterns&r, which are then encoded using the &b&lME Pattern Encoding Terminal&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lCrafting Patterns&r. These encode recipes made in a crafting table. They can be placed directly into a &b&lMolecular Assembler&r to automatically craft the recipe when given ingredients."
		""
		"Most commonly, however, they are placed into a &b&lME Pattern Provider&r adjacent to one or more assemblers. Assemblers will auto-eject crafted items to nearby inventories, making this setup the foundation of &b&lAE2&r automation."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lSmithing Table Patterns&r work similarly to Crafting Patterns, but encode smithing table recipes. They function identically to crafting patterns and can be used in the same network setup for seamless automation."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lStonecutting Patterns&r - These encode stonecutter recipes and behave just like crafting and smithing patterns. They can coexist with the others in a single assembler array, making recipe management more compact and efficient."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lProcessing Patterns&r are the most flexible type of pattern. They define that \"if these ingredients are sent out, these results will return\" without caring how it happens. This makes them perfect for modded machines, smelters, or entire factory setups."
		""
		"You could, for example, have a pattern that says: \"1 Cherry Wood Plank becomes 1 Nether Star\" and your ME System will accept it as long as the specified result eventually enters the network."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lParallel Crafting and Scaling&r"
		""
		"Multiple &b&lME Pattern Providers&r with identical patterns can run in parallel, improving speed. You can also scale up recipes by for example, defining \"8 Cobblestone becomes 8 Stone\" so that the provider inserts 8 at once instead of 1."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lPro Tip&r"
		""
		"When setting up advanced factories, always test &b&lProcessing Patterns&r with small batches first. They are powerful, but with great power comes great automation chaos."
	]
	quest.26F8D87FC3FFFC98.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a Blank Pattern and encode it in a ME Pattern Encoding Terminal"
	quest.26F8D87FC3FFFC98.title: "&9&lQuest: ME Patterns"
	quest.271C63CD1EA3A203.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &2&lApothecarist&r is a special neutral mage aligned with the Nature school of magic.&r This spellcaster guards a mangrove swamp‑hut structure in the Overworld, quietly brewing away until disturbed&r.&r"
		""
		"By default the Apothecarist stays peaceful, but stealing from them or landing a hit will turn them hostile.&r Once angered, they unleash a mix of spells and splash potions that stack nasty debuffs on you, so expect a tactical fight rather than a simple brawl&r.&r"
		""
		"Defeating this mage is an important milestone, rewarding you with rare Nature‑themed loot such as the unique &2&lNetherward Tincture&r.&r Come prepared with movement options and strong debuff protection if you want to walk out of that swamp hut victorious&r.&r"
	]
	quest.271C63CD1EA3A203.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSlay the &2&lApothecarist&r&l&f, the unique Nature mage found in its swamp hut&r"
	quest.271C63CD1EA3A203.title: "&5&lQuest: Confronting the Apothecarist"
	quest.273FE4B2509088AF.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lMechanical Arm&r is a &b&lCreate&r component built to &e&ltransfer items&r between inventories and machines with precision and automation. When powered by &e&lrotational energy&r, it can &e&lpick up and place items&r from one container to another, such as chests, depots, belts, and funnels."
		""
		"The arm’s behavior can be fully configured to define &e&linput and output targets&r, letting you build &b&lautomated sorting systems&r, assembly lines, and complex factory networks. Its speed and efficiency depend on the rotation you supply, making it a flexible core for any &b&lCreate automation setup&r."
		""
		"Use &a&lJEI&r to view the crafting recipe and gather every component needed to assemble your first Mechanical Arm."
	]
	quest.273FE4B2509088AF.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lMechanical Arm&r"
	quest.273FE4B2509088AF.title: "&9&lQuest: Mechanical Arm"
	quest.2786BBC4F8C9ACF8.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Crude Scythe is your first essential tool for interacting with the Spirit Arcana. To begin collecting the vital Spirits that fuel all rituals, you must first craft this weapon."
		""
		""
		"The simple recipe requires one Soul Stone, three Iron Ingots, and two sticks. Once equipped, using the Scythe to defeat any mob will cause it to drop its unique type of Spirit, initiating your true magical progression!"
	]
	quest.2786BBC4F8C9ACF8.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Crude Scythe&r to begin collecting spirits from mobs."
	quest.2786BBC4F8C9ACF8.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Forging the Crude Scythe 🔪👻"
	quest.28B72A8ED52F34E3.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fBefore creating life, you'll need a sacred vessel. &a&lCraft an Empty Grail&r&f, a container designed to hold the life essence of monsters."
		""
		"&fThis item will soon be filled with &b&lGreat Essence&r&f using the &d&lGreat Chalice&r&f. A small cup, but the first step toward creation."
	]
	quest.28B72A8ED52F34E3.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft an &6&lEmpty Grail"
	quest.28B72A8ED52F34E3.title: "&6&lQuest: Craft an Empty Grail"
	quest.28C15D5AC223B545.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &b&lSoul Gem&r&f is a diamond infused with trapped souls, swirling with eerie energy. &a&lTo craft one, place a Diamond&r&f inside the &d&lSoul Furnace&r&f and let it absorb the essence of the beyond."
		""
		"&fIt's a vital material for powerful magical crafts and ancient relics."
	]
	quest.28C15D5AC223B545.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCreate a &b&lSoul Gem"
	quest.28C15D5AC223B545.title: "&6&lQuest: Forge a Soul Gem"
	quest.298341B3D285A815.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Casings are both functional and decorative building blocks in &b&lCreate&r, used in the construction of almost every mechanical device."
		""
		"They are crafted by applying alloys or ingots directly to stripped logs using &e&lManual Item Application&r."
		""
		"&f&lAndesite Casing&f = &b&lAndesite Alloy&f + Stripped Log"
		"&e&lBrass Casing&f = &e&lBrass Ingot&f + Stripped Log"
		"&e&lCopper Casing&f = &e&lCopper Ingot&f + Stripped Log"
		"&e&lTrain Casing&f = &e&lBrass Casing&f + &b&lSturdy Sheet&r"
		""
		"Casings can also be applied to &b&lShafts&r, &b&lCogwheels&r, and &b&lMechanical Belts&r to give your machines a refined industrial look."
		""
		"While decorative, they also provide control over mechanical connections, helping isolate parts and organize your system layout with precision."
		""
		"Every polished contraption begins with a solid &e&lCasing&r."
	]
	quest.298341B3D285A815.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCreate any type of &e&lCasing&r"
	quest.298341B3D285A815.title: "&9&lQuest: Casing"
	quest.29B33630314C9320.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your journey to fully revive Dr. Mobstenio starts by tracking down his hidden laboratory.&r The &f&lFrankenstein Castle&r is a special structure that generates in the Swamp biome and serves as your main destination&r.&r"
		""
		"This castle houses the secret lab of Dr. Mobstenio, the creator of the Frankenstein Golem and mastermind behind the mod’s wild experiments.&r Visiting this structure is required to keep progressing along the questline and move closer to bringing the doctor back to life&r.&r"
	]
	quest.29B33630314C9320.quest_subtitle: "&l&fVisit the &f&lFrankenstein Castle&r&l&f structure found in the Swamp biome&r"
	quest.29B33630314C9320.title: "&5&lQuest: Locating the Frankenstein Castle"
	quest.29BBEB4F438C7290.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lChunk Destroyer&r is a powerful machine that can &e&lflatten a full chunk&r (16 x 16 blocks) in under an hour. Designed for large scale terrain management, it makes clearing land for construction, resource gathering, or landscaping a breeze."
		""
		"Set it up carefully, provide sufficient power, and watch as it systematically removes blocks across the entire chunk with speed and efficiency. Perfect for players who want fast &e&lautomated terrain modification&r without the manual effort."
	]
	quest.29BBEB4F438C7290.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lChunk Destroyer&r"
	quest.29BBEB4F438C7290.title: "&9&lQuest: Chunk Destroyer"
	quest.29E203D040ECBBCB.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lWater Wheel&r is one of the earliest and simplest &e&lrotational power sources&r in &b&lCreate&r. Crafted from any planks and a &b&lShaft&r, it uses the natural flow of water to generate steady rotational energy for your machines."
		""
		"When &9&lwater flows&r around the wheel in one direction, it starts to spin, producing &e&l8 RPM&r of rotational speed and supporting up to &e&l256 Stress Units&r. You can connect multiple wheels in parallel to boost your total power output."
		""
		"Experiment with different water placements to squeeze out more efficiency, and remember: even something as peaceful as flowing water can drive an entire mechanical world."
	]
	quest.29E203D040ECBBCB.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft and place a &b&lWater Wheel&r"
	quest.29E203D040ECBBCB.title: "&9&lQuest: Water Wheel"
	quest.2A17DBE89E6BFC3E.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your growing arcane mastery now needs a strong catalyst.&r &d&lMundabitur Dust&r is a highly versatile reagent used for high‑tier crafting and magical transmutation&r.&r"
		""
		"You will need this dust to forge powerful Arcane Gold Ingots and to perform mystical acts like charging a Creeper or creating the Arcane Crystal Obelisk.&r It is also required to activate the &5&lHephaestus Forge&r, so secure the recipe and craft this core dust to unlock the next level of magic&r.&r"
	]
	quest.2A17DBE89E6BFC3E.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft &d&lMundabitur Dust&r&l&f, the essential reagent for transformation&r"
	quest.2A17DBE89E6BFC3E.title: "&5&lQuest: The Dust of Transmutation"
	quest.2A38CDBAEE576662.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The Undergarden is a wide, alien world of bizarre environments. To truly understand it, you must travel from the frozen &b&lFrostfields&r&f to the soggy &4&lBlood Mushroom Bogs&r&f and beneath the looming &7&lSmog Spires&r&f, mapping every shift in the landscape."
		""
		"Seek out every named corner of this realm: the Ancient Sea, Barren Abyss, Dead Sea, Dense Forest, Forgotten Field, Frosty Smogstem Forest, Grongle Growth, Icy Sea, Indigo Mushroom Bog, Ink Mushroom Bog, Smogstem Forest, Veil Mushroom Bog, Wigglewood Forest, and more until all seventeen biomes are found. Leave no shadow uncharted."
	]
	quest.2A38CDBAEE576662.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover all &e&lSeventeen Undergarden Biomes&r&f&l to chart the full breadth of the dark realm"
	quest.2A38CDBAEE576662.title: "&7&lQuest: The Undergarden Cartographer"
	quest.2ABDE55D397861C4.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Once the Full Body is assembled, the next intermediate step in the resurrection process is creating the &f&lClinical Stretch&r.&r This item is required before you can move on to the following stage of reviving your Mobstein creation&r.&r"
		""
		"The Clinical Stretch is used to prepare the constructed body for its imminent revival, stabilizing it so it can safely receive further procedures.&r Craft this piece to get everything ready for the final stages of bringing your Mobstein experiment to life&r.&r"
	]
	quest.2ABDE55D397861C4.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft the &f&lClinical Stretch&r&l&f for initial body preparations&r"
	quest.2ABDE55D397861C4.title: "&5&lQuest: The Clinical Stretch"
	quest.2AEFCC5085C6468F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have proven yourself worthy of the deep dark’s strongest defense. By combining &9&lWarden Carapace&r&f with the special armor recipes, you can forge a complete suit of Warden Armor, including helmet, chestplate, leggings, and boots."
		""
		"Wearing this set wraps you in the same eerie resilience that once protected the Warden itself. Craft the full suit to gain unmatched protection and to truly stand as guardian of the deepest shadows."
	]
	quest.2AEFCC5085C6468F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain a &9&lfull set of Warden Armor&r&f&l"
	quest.2AEFCC5085C6468F.title: "&l&7Quest: The Silent Protector"
	quest.2B1F80FB6DFF4399.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your &b&lME Network&r is growing, and with growth comes limitations. Once you exceed 8 devices, you will start running into &e&lchannel limits&r. Many &b&lApplied Energistics 2&r devices require a channel to function, and managing them efficiently is key to keeping your system running smoothly."
		""
		"To solve this, you will need to craft &b&lSmart Cables&r. These special cables not only connect your devices but also show how many channels are being used through a visible indicator."
		""
		"When you reach beyond 8 channels, it is time to consider building an &b&lME Controller&r, the heart of larger &b&lME Networks&r, allowing for massive expansion and more complex automation."
		""
		"Use &b&lSmart Cables&r extensively to understand how your channels flow and to prevent overloads in your system."
	]
	quest.2B1F80FB6DFF4399.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft &b&lSmart Cables&r &f&lto monitor &b&lME Network&r &f&lchannels&r"
	quest.2B1F80FB6DFF4399.title: "&9&lQuest: Overcoming Limits"
	quest.2B701B3FE3949C73.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &6&lTwilight Lich&r&f is a tall, skeletal boss that waits on the top floor of the tower. The fight is split into three main stages, each with its own trick."
		""
		"Stage One: The Lich is invulnerable behind five spinning &b&lshields&r&f and sends out clones that fire &d&lEnder Pearl&r&f projectiles. Knock out the shields either by hitting them directly or by bouncing its projectiles back—each successful deflection destroys one shield."
		""
		"Stage Two: With the shields gone, the Lich summons waves of &2&lzombie minions&r&f wearing stronger and stronger armor. You can now damage the Lich itself, and bringing its health low enough will start the final phase."
		""
		"Stage Three: The Lich draws a &6&lGold Sword&r&f, starts chasing you, and keeps teleporting around the arena. Survive this aggressive rush and finish it off to win the fight."
		""
		"When you defeat the boss, it can drop enchanted &6&lgolden armor&r&f, a &6&lgolden sword&r&f, &d&lEnder Pearls&r&f, bones, the decorative &6&lTwilight Lich Trophy&r&f, and one of four special &d&lScepters&r&f (Fortification, Life Draining, Twilight, or Zombie)."
	]
	quest.2B701B3FE3949C73.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the &6&lTwilight Lich&r&f&l boss at the top of the &6&lLich Tower&r&f&l"
	quest.2B701B3FE3949C73.title: "&7&lQuest: Defeating the Twilight Lich"
	quest.2B75AFC1125CEBBE.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &5&lAbyssal Sacrifice&r&f is the crucial, resource‑intensive item needed to summon the powerful &3&lLeviathan&r&f boss in the &3&lSunken City&r&f.&r Crafting it is a serious project, demanding rare materials gathered across your entire deep‑sea expedition.&r"
		""
		"The complex recipe calls for valuable vanilla resources such as:&r"
		"A block of &a&lEmerald&r&f, &6&lGold&r&f, &d&lAmethyst&r&f, &7&lIron&r&f, and &b&lDiamond&r&f.&r"
		"A &b&lHeart of the Sea&r&f and a &b&lNautilus Shell&r&f.&r"
		""
		"It also requires two specific mod drops:&r"
		"An &5&lAthame&r&f, a ritual dagger dropped by &5&lDeepling Warlocks&r&f or &5&lPriests&r&f.&r"
		"Either a &b&lCoral Chunk&r&f (dropped by &b&lCoralsus&r&f) or &b&lCrystallized Coral&r&f crafted from &b&lCrystallized Coral Fragments&r&f obtained from &b&lCoral Golems&r&f.&r"
		""
		"Once the sacrifice is complete, you must place it inside the jaws of the &5&lAltar of Abyss&r&f in the deepest chamber of the &3&lSunken City&r&f to begin the boss encounter.&r"
	]
	quest.2B75AFC1125CEBBE.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft the &5&lAbyssal Sacrifice&r&f&l to awaken the &3&lLeviathan&r&f&l&r"
	quest.2B75AFC1125CEBBE.title: "&4&lQuest: Forging the Abyssal Sacrifice"
	quest.2C00CE10F65BB968.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lCharger&r is a versatile block in &b&lApplied Energistics&r that allows you to &e&lcharge supported tools&r and &b&lCertus Quartz Crystals&r."
		""
		"Power can be supplied from the top or bottom using &b&lAE2 cables&r or other mod power cables, accepting &b&lAE&r (Ambient Energy) or &e&lForge Energy&r (FE). Items can be inserted or removed from any side; only results are removable, so you do not need filters to protect your crystals. It can be rotated with a &b&lCertus Quartz Wrench&r to optimize automation setups."
		""
		"The &b&lCharger&r is used to:"
		""
		"- &b&lConvert Certus Quartz Crystals&r into &b&lCharged Certus Quartz Crystals&r"
		""
		"- &e&lCraft a Meteorite Compass&r from a regular Compass"
		""
		"- Serve as the workstation for the &b&lFlux Researcher&r"
		""
		"For manual charging, place a &b&lWooden Crank&r on the top or bottom and right click it until the item is fully charged."
	]
	quest.2C00CE10F65BB968.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lCharger&r"
	quest.2C00CE10F65BB968.title: "&9&lQuest: The Charger"
	quest.2C16B776DA1758EE.quest_desc: [
		"&fWelcome to &6&lNew Game 3&r&f, a &2&lvanilla+&r&f modpack that expands every aspect of Minecraft."
		""
		"&fThis version is heavily focused on &5&lRPG&r&f gameplay, bringing character progression and adventure to life."
		""
		"&fDiscover &a&lnew biomes&r&f, &a&lcreatures&r&f, &a&ltechnologies&r&f, and &e&lmagic&r&f that enrich your survival experience."
		""
		"&fYour new world awaits, bigger, deeper, and more exciting than ever before."
	]
	quest.2C16B776DA1758EE.quest_subtitle: "&f&lStart your adventure in &6&lNew Game 3&r&f&l."
	quest.2C16B776DA1758EE.title: "&6&lWelcome to New Game 3"
	quest.2C3AAF46BAD957C6.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fDeep within the world lies an ancient structure once used to create mechanical life. &a&lKnown as \"The Factory\"&r&f, it's now abandoned, its halls filled with rusted machinery and broken sparks."
		""
		"&fInside, you may discover one of the rarest relics of the Companions! mod: the &d&lBroken Dinamo&r&f. Prepare your gear, follow the hum of static, and uncover the secrets of The Factory."
	]
	quest.2C3AAF46BAD957C6.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind the structure known as \"The &b&lFactory\""
	quest.2C3AAF46BAD957C6.title: "&6&lQuest: Locate The Factory"
	quest.2C7B5F5B295EF649.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fIf your style is wood, it's time to build a &a&lForester's Hut&r&f. Your new &a&lForester&r&f will start gathering logs, saplings, and other wood materials needed for future constructions, tools, and upgrades."
		""
		"&fA steady supply of wood ensures your &6&lBuilder&r&f never runs out of resources, keeping your colony's progress smooth and efficient. Let the forests grow, and your colony will grow with them."
	]
	quest.2C7B5F5B295EF649.quest_subtitle: "&f&lPlace and build a &a&lForester's Hut&r"
	quest.2C7B5F5B295EF649.title: "&6&lStep 6: Forester"
	quest.2D021500C324EE0D.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThrough mastery of the &e&lGold Dungeons&r&f and the discovery of the &7&lStratus Smithing Template&r&f, you can ascend beyond Gravitite and forge armor worthy of the heavens themselves."
		""
		"&fUpgrade your &d&lGravitite Armor&r&f or uncover this divine set through your conquests, become one with the skies, clad in the power of the &7&lStratus&r&f."
	]
	quest.2D021500C324EE0D.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain a full set of &7&lStratus Armor&r&f"
	quest.2D021500C324EE0D.title: "&7&lQuest: Skyforged Ascension"
	quest.2D31F4E5605096FD.quest_desc: [
		"Beneath the heat of the desert lies more than dust — hidden among the dunes, you’ll find &dSuspicious Sand&f, blocks that whisper tales of ancient civilizations."
		""
		"Use your &6Brush&f to gently clean its surface and reveal what’s hidden inside."
		"Artifacts, pottery fragments, or even ancient eggs may rest beneath these fragile grains."
		""
		"Every block of &dSuspicious Sand&f holds a secret… waiting for the right explorer to uncover it."
	]
	quest.2D31F4E5605096FD.quest_subtitle: "&7&oObserve or find Suspicious Sand."
	quest.2D31F4E5605096FD.title: "&6&lQuest: The Secrets of the Sand"
	quest.2D44AC62BBE720E8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fBefore you begin building your colony, you must find the perfect location to settle. Look for a large and open area, at least &e&l8×8 chunks&r&f with terrain that's fairly flat and easy to build on."
		""
		"&fGather the essential materials to prepare for construction: &a&lWood&r&f, &8&lCobblestone&r&f, &8&lDirt&r&f, &c&lIron&r&f, &6&lFlowers&r&f, &f&lString&r&f, &6&lLeather&r&f, &f&lWool&r&f, &a&lSaplings&r&f, and &c&lFood&r&f."
		""
		"&fPreparation is the foundation of every great colony!"
	]
	quest.2D44AC62BBE720E8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind a suitable area to begin your &b&lcolony&r"
	quest.2D44AC62BBE720E8.title: "&6&lQuest: Getting Started"
	quest.2D522DA30760D58D.quest_desc: [
		"With the &fGlider Feathers&f you’ve collected, you can now recreate an ancient tool of flight — the &bHang Glider&f."
		"Combine &fSticks&f and &fGlider Feathers&f to craft this relic once used by explorers of the ancient skies."
		""
		"When equipped, the &bHang Glider&f allows you to &aslowly glide through the air&f, avoiding deadly falls and traveling across the jungle canopy with ease."
		"It’s the wind’s gift — a reminder that freedom always comes to those who look up."
	]
	quest.2D522DA30760D58D.quest_subtitle: "&7&oCraft a Hang Glider."
	quest.2D522DA30760D58D.title: "&b&lQuest: Crafting the Hang Glider"
	quest.2D573777A6DE1358.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your pursuit of the &c&lNether Gauntlet&r boss requires finding its strange forge structure within the scorching &c&lNether dimension&r. You must craft the &6&lEye of the Monstrosity&r to locate this dangerous place."
		""
		"This specialized item acts as a magical compass, guiding you directly to the Gauntlet's hidden ruins. Craft this eye and prepare your gear for the battle in the blazing heart of the &c&lNether&r!"
	]
	quest.2D573777A6DE1358.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft the &6&lEye of the Monstrosity&r&l&f to locate the &c&lNether Gauntlet&r&l&f"
	quest.2D573777A6DE1358.title: "&4&lQuest: Forging the Eye of the Monstrosity"
	quest.2D750DCECA25D899.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &8&lAxe of a Thousand Metals&r is the fearsome weapon used by the Ferrous Wroughtnaut, and it is guaranteed to drop once the boss is slain.&r This makes it one of the most reliable high‑tier melee rewards from that encounter&r.&r"
		""
		"The axe deals 9 base damage with an attack speed of 0.9, and it has two special right‑click abilities.&r Swing Attack performs a wide sweeping strike that damages nearby foes, while Slam Attack (crouch + right‑click on the ground) sends out a shockwave up to 10 blocks that drags enemies toward you&r.&r"
		""
		"Like the Wrought Helm, this axe is completely unbreakable, so it never loses durability and remains a permanent powerhouse in your arsenal.&r It is ideal for players who want a brutal melee weapon that also controls crowds through its shockwave ability&r.&r"
	]
	quest.2D750DCECA25D899.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain the &8&lAxe of a Thousand Metals&r&l&f dropped by the Ferrous Wroughtnaut&r"
	quest.2D750DCECA25D899.title: "&4&lQuest: Claiming the Axe of a Thousand Metals"
	quest.2DBCFBC733834328.quest_desc: [
		""
		"A vast, silent complex known as the &2&lCatacombs&r&f lies buried beneath the &b&lFrostfields&r&f and &7&lForgotten Fields&r&f of the Undergarden. These underground tombs are the only known lairs of the imposing Forgotten Guardians."
		""
		"Search the surface for an entrance, usually around Y-level 48, and steel yourself for the descent. You will need to brave the darkness and its ancient, hostile residents if you want to conquer this mandatory dungeon."
	]
	quest.2DBCFBC733834328.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate the structure and &2&lEnter the Catacombs&r&f&l, home of the Forgotten Guardians"
	quest.2DBCFBC733834328.title: "&7&lQuest: Delving into the Catacombs"
	quest.2DC70DE5D79D6A71.quest_desc: [
		""
		"To uncover the hidden &6&lPyramid Outpost&r&f in the Overworld deserts, you must first create the &6&lEye of the Desert&r&f.&r This special eye works as a &e&lmagical compass&r&f, guiding you straight to the &6&lAncient Remnant&r&f’s domain buried beneath the sands.&r"
		""
		"This item is essential for beginning your journey in &5&lL_Ender’s Cataclysm&r&f.&r With it, you can skip the long wandering search and head directly to one of the mod’s first major challenges.&r Craft this eye, follow where it points, and get ready for the &c&lheat&r&f.&r"
	]
	quest.2DC70DE5D79D6A71.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft the &6&lEye of the Desert&r&f&l to locate the &6&lPyramid Outpost&r&f&l"
	quest.2DC70DE5D79D6A71.title: "&4&lQuest: Forging the Eye of the Desert"
	quest.2E1CCABD1C997F5C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fDeep within Pale Oaks lies the &c&lCreaking Heart&r&f, a \"living\" block that pulses at night. &a&lYou can craft one using Resin and &b&lPale Oak Logs&r&f, or find it naturally in the Pale Garden."
		""
		"&fWhen destroyed, it drops &b&lResin Clumps&r&f on which experience thrives. &d&lDiscover the Creaking Heart&r&f and feel its eerie rhythm."
	]
	quest.2E1CCABD1C997F5C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind or craft a &c&lCreaking Heart&r&f&l block"
	quest.2E1CCABD1C997F5C.title: "&6&lQuest: Find a Creaking Heart"
	quest.2E30D3A752BCE865.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&f&d&lZanite Gemstones&r&f are precious crystals found deep within the floating islands of the &b&lAether&r&f."
		""
		"&fThese beautiful purple gems grow stronger as their wearers’ tools and armor weaken, a curious magic of the skies."
		""
		"&fMine them from the Aether’s caverns and keep one in your inventory to begin harnessing the power of the clouds."
		""
		"&f&lTip"
		""
		"&f&d&lZanite&r&f is often found in caves and mountains, bring a pickaxe and explore the glowing depths."
	]
	quest.2E30D3A752BCE865.quest_subtitle: "&f&lHave a &d&lZanite Gemstone&r&f in your inventory"
	quest.2E30D3A752BCE865.title: "&7&lQuest: A Gem of the Skies"
	quest.2F27DD7C8D007FBE.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &c&lNetherite Monstrosity&r is a formidable Golem-boss residing within the &c&lSoul Forge&r structure in the Nether. With &a&l600 Health&r and &9&l12 Armor&r, preparation is crucial: equip enchanted &8&lNetherite Armor&r and use &c&lFire Resistance Potions&r to survive."
		""
		"The Monstrosity attacks with &c&lSlam Attacks&r, a &c&lCharge Attack&r that inflicts the &7&lBone Fracture&r debuff, and a dangerous &c&lLava Eruption&r. To win, you must clear the arena of lava to stop it from regenerating health."
		""
		"Upon victory, you gain the &6&lInfernal Forge&r pickaxe, the &d&lMonstrous Horn&r (for crafting the Monstrous Helm), and the &c&lLava Power Cell&r used to activate the dormant &8&lNetherite Effigy&r companion."
	]
	quest.2F27DD7C8D007FBE.quest_subtitle: "&l&fDefeat the &c&lNetherite Monstrosity&r&l&f boss found within the &c&lSoul Forge&r&l&f"
	quest.2F27DD7C8D007FBE.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Netherite Monstrosity"
	quest.2F71A978EE5A1A5A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &5&lEnder Golem&r is a formidable mini-boss that serves as a defender of the &5&lRuined Citadel&r structure. You can find multiple Golems by breaking through the circular exposed &e&lEnd Stone&r in the floor, leading you deeper into the Citadel."
		""
		"The Golem has &a&l150 Health&r and &9&l12 Armor&r. Its attacks include a standard melee strike, an &c&lEarthquake attack&r, and a special &d&lVoid Rune&r attack."
		""
		"Upon defeat, the &5&lEnder Golem&r will drop a &d&lVoid Core&r. This core can be used to summon &d&lVoid Runes&r in battle (by right-clicking) or in the &8&lMechanical Fusion Anvil&r to upgrade weapons like the &c&lInfernal Forge&r, granting them powerful void abilities."
	]
	quest.2F71A978EE5A1A5A.quest_subtitle: "&l&fDefeat an &5&lEnder Golem&r&l&f mini-boss and acquire a &d&lVoid Core&r&l&f"
	quest.2F71A978EE5A1A5A.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Ender Golem"
	quest.30890162C5C41FE5.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &5&lRuined Citadel&r is a massive, maze-like structure that generates on the outer End islands. To locate it, you must first defeat the &d&lEnder Dragon&r and travel far into the End dimension."
		""
		"You must craft and use the &d&lEye of Void&r to guide you to this purple citadel. Once inside, you will face an infestation of Endermaptera, dangerous trap blocks, and three &5&lEnder Golem&r mini-bosses. Navigate this maze to reach the lowest level, where the formidable &5&lEnder Guardian&r boss awaits."
	]
	quest.30890162C5C41FE5.quest_subtitle: "&l&fFind the &6&lRuined Citadel&r&l &fstructure on the outer End islands using the &d&lEye of Void&r&l"
	quest.30890162C5C41FE5.title: "&4&lQuest: Locating the Ruined Citadel"
	quest.30DC8344474FDFE4.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lMechanical Crafter&r is an advanced &b&lCreate&r machine that &e&lautomatically crafts items&r using &e&lcustom crafting grids&r powered by &e&lrotational energy&r. Each crafter represents a single slot in a recipe; when arranged in a specific layout, they form a full crafting interface capable of producing complex items on its own."
		""
		"Once all required ingredients are inserted, the crafters &e&ltransfer materials between each other&r and output the final product into the attached inventory. They are essential for &e&lautomating advanced recipes&r such as Mechanical Arms, Precision Mechanisms, and other high tier components."
		""
		"For best results, link multiple Mechanical Crafters together with &b&lBelts&r or Chutes and power them with steady rotational force. Use &a&lJEI&r to view the crafting recipe and gather everything needed to assemble your automated crafting system."
	]
	quest.30DC8344474FDFE4.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lMechanical Crafter&r"
	quest.30DC8344474FDFE4.title: "&9&lQuest: Mechanical Crafter"
	quest.31373F22EE273603.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &d&lAncient Codex&r is one of the strongest spellbooks in the mod, giving a serious edge to any dedicated mage.&r When equipped, this legendary tome provides heavy cooldown reduction on your spells along with a large increase to your maximum mana&r.&r"
		""
		"It is a rare treasure usually hidden in the deepest, toughest dungeons or secret structures added by the mod.&r Seek out these high‑risk locations and claim the Codex—the reward easily justifies the danger&r.&r"
	]
	quest.31373F22EE273603.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain the &d&lAncient Codex&r&l&f to massively boost your spell efficiency&r"
	quest.31373F22EE273603.title: "&5&lQuest: Retrieving the Ancient Codex"
	quest.315D6B9FC8BBB361.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fHidden among the &b&lFrozen Nests&r&f and icy ruins of the north lies the mysterious &b&lSuspicious Ice&r&f, an ancient frozen material that traps relics from a forgotten age."
		""
		"&fUse your &6&lBrush&r&f or &b&lChisel&r&f to carefully uncover what lies within. Inside, you may discover &a&lPottery Fragments&r&f, &c&lFrozen Ancient Meat&r&f, or even the rare &b&lSoarer Egg&r&f."
		""
		"&fEach crystal of ice holds a secret, waiting for the warmth of your curiosity to set it free."
	]
	quest.315D6B9FC8BBB361.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObserve or find &b&lSuspicious Ice&r"
	quest.315D6B9FC8BBB361.title: "&6&lQuest: Suspicious Ice"
	quest.316B7B19BBAAA15A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fYour colonists need a place to rest and gather after a long day of work, the &8&lTavern&r&f is perfect for that."
		""
		"&fIt provides your citizens with shelter and comfort, while also welcoming &6&lvisitors from distant lands&r&f. These travelers can be &a&lrecruited&r&f to join your colony as new citizens, helping your settlement grow and thrive."
		""
		"&fThe &8&lTavern&r&f is more than just a building, it's the heart of your community, where your colony truly begins to feel alive."
	]
	quest.316B7B19BBAAA15A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lPlace and build a &8&lTavern&r"
	quest.316B7B19BBAAA15A.title: "&6&lStep 4: Tavern"
	quest.3173A48D172D517E.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&b&lImmersive Engineering&r, created by &b&lBluSunrize&r and &b&lMr_Hazard&r, brings a &e&lretro futuristic industrial experience&r to Minecraft. This mod introduces powerful &e&lForge Energy based machinery&r and complex multiblock structures that feel like real world engineering systems."
		""
		"Its machines and generators run on &b&lImmersive Flux (IF)&r, an energy unit that works perfectly with &e&lRedstone Flux (RF)&r at a 1 to 1 ratio, making it compatible with other tech mods. You will be building &e&lpower lines&r, crushers, excavators, refineries, and more, all connected through an AC style energy network for a grounded industrial vibe."
		""
		"Get ready to master heavy machinery, high voltage power, and the beauty of detailed engineering. Your industrial revolution starts here."
	]
	quest.3173A48D172D517E.quest_subtitle: "&f&lBegin your journey into the &b&lImmersive Engineering&r&f&l mod&r"
	quest.3173A48D172D517E.title: "&9&lQuest: Welcome to Immersive Engineering"
	quest.319CE124AC07821C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lMechanical Belt&r is a key &b&lCreate&r component that links multiple &b&lShafts&r to transfer rotational power while also moving &e&litems&r and &e&lentites&r between machines."
		""
		"Crafted from &a&lDried Kelp&r, the belt is placed by right clicking between two aligned shafts. It can span up to &e&l20 blocks&r horizontally, vertically, or diagonally at a 45 degree angle, letting you build complex automated systems with ease."
		""
		"Belts can move items from one machine to another, feed &b&lMechanical Presses&r, &b&lDeployers&r, or &b&lSpouts&r, and even carry players and mobs. You can dye belts for style or use &e&lCasings&r to hide the mechanisms behind a clean design."
		""
		"Every automated factory really starts moving with its first spinning &b&lMechanical Belt&r."
	]
	quest.319CE124AC07821C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft and place a &b&lMechanical Belt&r"
	quest.319CE124AC07821C.title: "&9&lQuest: Mechanical Belt"
	quest.31B7805E55B0DF24.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &6&lNetherite Ministrosity&r is a charming and practical companion—a miniature version of the boss that acts as a &e&lmobile storage container&r."
		""
		"To find it, locate the &c&lSoul Forge&r structure in the Nether and search the secret treasure room (behind the lava waterfalls) for the dormant Golem."
		""
		"To activate your new pet, you must use the &c&lLava Power Cell&r (a drop from the Netherite Monstrosity). Once powered, the Ministrosity becomes a loyal companion that provides mobile inventory expansion, following you on your adventures."
		""
		"You can even store this valuable companion in an empty &7&lBucket&r for safe transportation through dangerous areas or dimensions."
	]
	quest.31B7805E55B0DF24.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain and activate the &6&lNetherite Ministrosity&r&l&f companion"
	quest.31B7805E55B0DF24.title: "&4&lQuest: Sowing the Ministrosity"
	quest.31F35097830D3012.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &a&lImporter&r&f is an essential automation block in &b&lRefined Storage&r&f.&r"
		""
		"&fIt lets your system automatically pull items from connected inventories like chests, furnaces, or &e&lmachines&r&f, sending everything straight into your digital network.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lHow It Works&r"
		""
		"&fPlace the &a&lImporter&r&f facing the inventory you want to extract from, for example the output side of a furnace or a chest.&r"
		""
		"&fOnce connected via &b&lCables&r&f to your &b&lController&r&f, it will start transferring items into your network’s storage disks or external storage units.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lFiltering and Speed Upgrades&r"
		""
		"&fYou can install &a&lSpeed Upgrades&r&f to accelerate item transfer or &a&lStack Upgrades&r&f to move entire stacks at once.&r"
		""
		"&fFilters let you &b&lselect which items&r&f the Importer will transfer, making it easy to separate specific resources.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lAutomation Tip&r"
		""
		"&fPair Importers with &a&lExporters&r&f to create fully automated production lines.&r"
		""
		"&fFor example, pull smelted ingots from a furnace while sending ores in automatically.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip&r"
		""
		"&fIf your Importer is not working, double‑check its orientation.&r"
		""
		"&fIt has to face the inventory you want to extract from.&r"
	]
	quest.31F35097830D3012.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft an &a&lImporter&f&l and connect it to an external inventory to &a&lpull items&f&l into your storage network"
	quest.31F35097830D3012.title: "&9&lQuest: Crafting the Importer"
	quest.327965765970AB69.quest_desc: [
		"The &eCrusher&f is a spiked, ancient creature whose body is covered in sharp thorns for protection."
		"With the help of your &6Chisel&f, you can carefully remove some of these thorns — but beware, doing so will anger the creature!"
		""
		"When attacked, the &eCrusher&f will retaliate with powerful headbutts, so prepare yourself before attempting this."
		"The &fCrusher Thorns&f you collect can later be used to craft ancient tools and defensive gear."
	]
	quest.327965765970AB69.quest_subtitle: "&7&oObtain Crusher Thorns."
	quest.327965765970AB69.title: "&6&lQuest: Crusher Thorns"
	quest.32C3A2CC4DBAA9D7.quest_desc: [
		""
		"After conquering the mighty &7&lSilver Dungeon&r&f and defeating the &b&lValkyrie Queen&r&f, you probably expected some legendary power… not farming gear. Still, even heroes have to grow crops sometimes, so give that &b&lValkyrie Hoe&r&f a swing and make the fields proud."
	]
	quest.32C3A2CC4DBAA9D7.quest_subtitle: "&f&lUse a &b&lValkyrie Hoe&r&f&l"
	quest.32C3A2CC4DBAA9D7.title: "&7&lQuest: I Defeated the Silver Dungeon and All I Got Was This Stupid Hoe"
	quest.333BDE2CC2D1D00F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have slain the Warden and claimed its Heart of the Deep, but one last barrier remains. First, clear every trace of &9&lSculk&r&f and debris from the inner frame of the reinforced deepslate portal so the magic can flow."
		""
		"When the frame is spotless, right click the portal with the Heart in hand. The power of the deep will surge through the stone, lighting the gate and opening the path to the Otherside, a realm that lies beyond even the deep dark."
	]
	quest.333BDE2CC2D1D00F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lUse the &9&lHeart of the Deep&r&f&l to ignite the Otherside Portal"
	quest.333BDE2CC2D1D00F.title: "&7&lQuest: Igniting the Otherside Gate"
	quest.334FBE7BD72A84E9.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lSchematicannon&r is a powerful &b&lCreate&r machine built to &e&lautomatically build structures&r from saved &b&lSchematics&r. It lets you place detailed constructions &e&lblock by block&r in Survival, perfectly recreating your designs without manual placement."
		""
		"To use it, load a &b&lSchematic&r into the cannon, fill it with &e&lBuilding Materials&r, &e&lGunpowder&r, and &e&lrotational power&r, then watch as it fires blocks into position with precision. This tool shines in large construction projects, &e&lbase building&r, and &e&lcreative automation setups&r in survival."
		""
		"Use &a&lJEI&r to view the crafting recipe and gather all components needed to assemble your Schematicannon, then get ready to fire your blueprints into reality."
	]
	quest.334FBE7BD72A84E9.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lSchematicannon&r"
	quest.334FBE7BD72A84E9.title: "&9&lQuest: Schematicannon"
	quest.3395087BE8124B25.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fWhile exploring the frozen lands, you may come across strange icy blocks that seem different. This is the &b&lSuspicious Ice&r&f, a rare archaeological material that hides ancient treasures within its frozen core."
		""
		"&fIt can often be found inside the &b&lIce Spike Castle&r&f or beneath layers of compact snow. Use your &6&lPaintbrush&r&f to carefully uncover the secrets it holds, or your &b&lChisel&r&f for tougher layers."
		""
		"&fInside, you might find &a&lancient artifacts&r&f, &c&lFrozen Ancient Meat&r&f, or even the rare &d&lWalker Egg&r&f. Every block tells a story from Minecraft's forgotten past."
	]
	quest.3395087BE8124B25.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObserve or find &b&lSuspicious Ice&r"
	quest.3395087BE8124B25.title: "&6&lQuest: Secrets Beneath the Ice"
	quest.33B9301C15044B74.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &8&lWitherstein&r is a twisted being, creator of the first Wither mob and the one who betrayed and corrupted the monsters.&r This corrupted boss dwells inside the Witherstein Ruins found in Jungle biomes, waiting for challengers brave enough to face it&r.&r"
		""
		"You must confront and defeat the Witherstein to avenge Dr. Mobstenio and open the way for his return to life.&r When slain, the boss drops Syringe Mobstenio Blood, a crucial item required to complete the ritual that finally revives the doctor&r.&r"
	]
	quest.33B9301C15044B74.quest_subtitle: "&l&fDefeat the &8&lWitherstein&r &l&fboss in its Ruins&r"
	quest.33B9301C15044B74.title: "&5&lQuest: Avenging the Doctor"
	quest.33CBB7D62A5E3F2E.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&b&lImmersive Engineering&r introduces several new &e&lvaluable ores&r that are essential for crafting machinery, tools, and power systems. Unlike other mods, Immersive Engineering requires steady mining and large quantities of resources, so gathering efficiently from the start is key to your success."
		""
		"Your goal is to collect the &e&lraw forms&r of all the ores the mod adds, along with &e&lvanilla ores&r for your future machines and alloys. Keep your &b&lEngineer's Hammer&r handy, because these materials will soon become the backbone of your industrial empire."
		""
		"Ores to Collect:"
		""
		"- &f&lUranium Ore&r"
		""
		"- &f&lBauxite Ore&f (Aluminium)&r"
		""
		"- &f&lLead Ore&r"
		""
		"- &f&lSilver Ore&r"
		""
		"- &f&lNickel Ore&r"
		""
		"Mine deep, gather plenty, and prepare your foundry for what comes next."
	]
	quest.33CBB7D62A5E3F2E.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain the raw version of every ore added by &b&lImmersive Engineering&r"
	quest.33CBB7D62A5E3F2E.title: "&9&lQuest: Resource Collection — Raw Materials"
	quest.33E4C869082472A0.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Once the Full Body is assembled, the next intermediate step is creating the &b&lClinical Stretch&r.&r This item is required to move forward to the following stage of Mobstein’s resurrection process, so the ritual cannot continue without it&r.&r"
		""
		"The Clinical Stretch is used to ready the body for its imminent revival, stabilizing it before the final procedures begin.&r Craft this component to prepare for the last steps of bringing your Mobstein creation fully to life&r.&r"
	]
	quest.33E4C869082472A0.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft the &b&lClinical Stretch&r&l&f for initial body preparations&r"
	quest.33E4C869082472A0.title: "&5&lQuest: The Clinical Stretch"
	quest.3429EFB6BBBC2FC5.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Old tales describe a powerful golem‑like ally that can be awakened with the strange dormant power of &7&lForgotten&r&f stone. By placing a &d&lCarved Gloomgourd&r&f atop a prepared Forgotten body, you can breathe life into a loyal Minion."
		""
		"This sturdy construct will fight beside you as a living shield and guardian while you push into the most dangerous biomes. Forge this ancient ally and turn the deep’s own magic to your advantage."
	]
	quest.3429EFB6BBBC2FC5.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCreate a &7&lForgotten Minion&r&f&l using a &7&lForgotten&r&f&l and a &d&lCarved Gloomgourd&r&f&l"
	quest.3429EFB6BBBC2FC5.title: "&7&lQuest: Summoning the Sentinel"
	quest.344FF5423A26D273.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Deep within &e&lThe Bumblezone&r&f lies a relic of sweet guidance: the &e&lTantalizing Honey Compass&r&f. Said to resonate with the &e&lBee Queen&r&f’s throne, it points toward secrets hidden in the golden maze. Craft it or unearth it from ancient hive structures, and let the sweetness show you the way."
	]
	quest.344FF5423A26D273.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft or find a &e&lTantalizing Honey Compass&r&f&l"
	quest.344FF5423A26D273.title: "&7&lQuest: Follow the Sweet Signal"
	quest.3487CC8C990C9E64.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lEncased Fan&r is a versatile &b&lCreate&r component that generates powerful &e&lair streams&r. It can move entities, push items vertically, and handle &e&lBulk Processing&r steps like &e&lWashing&r, &e&lBlasting&r, &e&lHaunting&r, and &e&lSmoking&r."
		""
		"It connects to your power network from the back, drawing &e&lrotational energy&r to push or pull air depending on the direction of rotation."
		""
		"This fan is essential for automating resource processing and building large scale contraptions. Use &a&lJEI&r to check the recipe and gather everything you need to assemble it."
	]
	quest.3487CC8C990C9E64.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft an &b&lEncased Fan&r"
	quest.3487CC8C990C9E64.title: "&9&lQuest: Encased Fan"
	quest.357B1A16DA71C540.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &9&lEye of Abyss&r&f is a crucial navigation tool that behaves like an &a&lEye of Ender&r&f, flying toward the nearest &3&lSunken City&r&f structure.&r This item is essential for finding the elusive, massive underwater complex where the &3&lLeviathan&r&f boss resides.&r"
		""
		"The &9&lEye of Abyss&r&f is one of the easier eyes to craft, requiring &8&l4 Obsidian&r&f, &5&l4 Crying Obsidian&r&f, and &a&l1 Eye of Ender&r&f.&r Once created, you can throw this eye repeatedly, as it does not break, making it a reusable tool for tracking the rare structure.&r Secure this item and get ready to begin your deep‑sea adventures.&r"
	]
	quest.357B1A16DA71C540.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft the &9&lEye of Abyss&r&f&l to locate the &3&lSunken City&r&f&l&r"
	quest.357B1A16DA71C540.title: "&4&lQuest: Forging the Eye of the Abyss"
	quest.359DCD12D826AD76.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to the world of &d&lSkill Tree&r&f, an RPG-style system that adds a whole new layer of character customization. This mod gives you over 100 different &a&lnodes&r&f to shape your chosen class and playstyle."
		""
		"Earn &a&lSkill Points&r&f by gaining XP (shared across your team) and spend them to specialize your build. You can follow paths of &c&lOffense&r&f or &b&lDefense&r&f, unlock &d&lSpell Modifiers&r&f to upgrade your spells, or pick up &d&lPassive Spells&r&f with powerful triggers and combat effects. Dive into the tree and start forging your own legend."
	]
	quest.359DCD12D826AD76.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &d&lSkill Tree&r&f&l mod and begin unlocking your first node"
	quest.359DCD12D826AD76.title: "&a&lInitiation into the Skill Tree"
	quest.35AB7FB62D21C737.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fHidden deep within the jungle, the &c&lMonkey Temple&r&f stands as a relic of forgotten civilizations. Vines cover its walls, and strange echoes fill its empty halls, hinting at secrets long buried."
		""
		"&fAdventurers say that rare treasures and mysterious creatures dwell inside, guarding the temple's heart. &d&lLocate the Monkey Temple&r&f and uncover the mysteries of its ancient power."
	]
	quest.35AB7FB62D21C737.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate the ancient &c&lMonkey Temple&r&f&l structure"
	quest.35AB7FB62D21C737.title: "&6&lQuest: Locate the Monkey Temple"
	quest.35E120385D1FB024.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lMolecular Assembler&r&f is the heart of your autocrafting system. Toss items into it and let it work. It'll automatically pull recipes from an adjacent &d&lME Pattern Provider&r&f or use patterns you've inserted directly into the machine. Once it finishes, the results pop straight into your inventories."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lHow It Works?&r&f&l"
		""
		"When placed next to a &b&lME Pattern Provider&r&f, the assembler receives both the &e&lpattern information&r&f and the required ingredients. It then executes the recipe and &a&lauto-ejects&r&f the crafted items to any adjacent inventory, usually returning them directly to the &b&lpattern provider's&r&f return slots."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lAutomation Made Simple"
		""
		"A single &b&lMolecular Assembler&r&f connected to a &b&lPattern Provider&r&f is all you need to automate most crafting patterns. Add more assemblers around the provider and you'll greatly increase crafting throughput — letting multiple recipes run in &a&lparallel&r&f."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lIntegration Tip"
		""
		"Assemblers work with many &a&lautomation mods&r&f. Use them alongside pipes, storage buses, and interfaces to build &a&ladvanced factories&r&f that can craft, process, and route items seamlessly through your &b&lME Network&r&f."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip"
		""
		"Surround a &b&lPattern Provider&r&f with up to 6 &b&lMolecular Assemblers&r&f for maximum speed and efficiency!"
	]
	quest.35E120385D1FB024.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &e&lMolecular Assembler&r&f."
	quest.35E120385D1FB024.title: "&9&lQuest: Molecular Assembler"
	quest.36322D7747CB9B5C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&c&lFiery Blood&r&f is a valuable material dropped by two of the dimension’s scariest fire-themed bosses: the &c&lHydra&r&f and the &c&lUr-Ghast&r&f."
		""
		"When you defeat these powerful enemies, you can collect several bottles of this burning liquid. This resource matters because you can combine &c&lFiery Blood&r&f with an &7&lIron Ingot&r&f to create a &c&lFiery Ingot&r&f, opening the way to stronger gear."
	]
	quest.36322D7747CB9B5C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain &c&lFiery Blood&r&f&l, the boss drop from the &c&lHydra&r&f&l and &c&lUr-Ghast&r&f&l"
	quest.36322D7747CB9B5C.title: "&7&lQuest: Securing the Fiery Blood"
	quest.365CB3381B7068E4.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &c&lGrim Reaper&r&f is the ultimate challenge in &6&lMinecraft Comes Alive: Reborn&r&f. It can be summoned by lighting the &d&lGrim Altar&r&f, but only under the right conditions."
		""
		"&fTo begin the ritual, all three &a&lObsidian Pillars&r&f must be lit before igniting the &b&lEmerald Block&r&f at the center. Make sure it is nighttime, otherwise you'll receive the message \"The Reaper fears the sunlight.\""
		""
		"&fWhen defeated, the Grim Reaper drops his legendary weapon, the &c&lScythe&r&f, capable of &a&lkilling fallen villagers&r&f at the cost of short-term life drain."
		""
		"&fYour legend can also be upgraded into the &a&lStaff of Life&r&f."
		""
		"&fFace this legendary foe and reclaim the power of death itself!"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lBoss Fight Details:"
		""
		"&fThe Grim Reaper has &c&l200 HP&r&f and &a&lregenerate 4 HP every 5 seconds&r&f. He can fly, cast spells, and wield &5&lDark Magic&r&f. Because he is skilled as an &5&lInfernal Smite&r&f enchantment, this is particularly effective against him."
		""
		"&f&lAttacks:"
		""
		"&f&l■ &c&lBlock&r&f: Raises his scythe to nullify all incoming damage, then &a&lteleports a short distance away&r&f."
		"→ &e&lTip&r&f: Wait for this phase to end before attacking again."
		""
		"&f&l■ &c&lSlash&r&f: &a&lCharges forward&r&f with his scythe, dealing &c&lunblockable damage&r&f and applying the Wither effect."
		"→ &e&lTip&r&f: Strafe sideways and counterattack quickly."
		""
		"&f&l■ &c&lLightning Strike&r&f: &a&lHovers and calls down lightning&r&f every 5-10 seconds. Lightning may summon armored &c&lzombies or skeletons&r&f."
		"→ &e&lTip&r&f: Keep moving, spawned mobs have low health from lightning fire."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lVictory:"
		""
		"&fUpon defeating the &c&lGrim Reaper&r&f, you'll obtain the &c&lScythe&r&f, a weapon of immense dark power. With it, you can choose to balance life and death itself, or pursue the light by forging the &a&lStaff of Life&r&f."
		""
		"&fYour actions will define the fate of your village and its people."
	]
	quest.365CB3381B7068E4.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFace and defeat the &c&lGrim Reaper&r&f - a powerful undead boss that guards the line between life and death&r"
	quest.365CB3381B7068E4.title: "&6&lQuest: Defeat the Grim Reaper"
	quest.36781768617005F4.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The road to Holy Magic requires sacred scripture, obtained through a short chain of events.&r First infiltrate an Evoker Fort and locate the written book hidden inside its halls&r.&r"
		""
		"Next, bring this book to a captive &a&lWandering Trader&r in the same fort to have it translated.&r Finally, take the translated text to a Priest villager and trade it for the &a&lVillager Bible&r, a relic that grants +10 percent Holy Spell Power, +10 percent Cast Time Reduction, and +200 Max Mana when equipped&r.&r Follow the steps and claim your blessing&r.&r"
	]
	quest.36781768617005F4.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain the &a&lVillager Bible&r&l&f by trading with a Priest&r"
	quest.36781768617005F4.title: "&5&lQuest: The Villager's Holy Word"
	quest.36F6342931315C01.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe most effective way to manage the Spirits you harvest is the Spirit Pouch. This powerful pouch automatically collects all Spirits dropped by mobs, storing up to 512 Spirits of any type, eliminating inventory clutter."
		""
		""
		"To craft it, you first need to perform a ritual at the Spirit Altar to create the Soulwoven silk, Once you have the silk, use it to craft the Pouch and master the management of your arcane resources! 🩸"
	]
	quest.36F6342931315C01.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Spirit Pouch&r for automated Spirit collection."
	quest.36F6342931315C01.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4The Soul Carrier 🎒👻"
	quest.37738514E5906273.quest_desc: [
		"Among the mossy ruins of the &aAbandoned Village&f, you may uncover piles of &8Suspicious Gravel&f — strange blocks that hide the relics of an ancient jungle civilization."
		""
		"Use your &6Brush&f carefully to reveal the secrets buried within."
		"Each piece of gravel may conceal &ePottery Fragments&f or even &2prehistoric eggs&f that hold the key to the past."
		""
		"Listen closely as you dig… the jungle whispers through every grain of dust."
	]
	quest.37738514E5906273.quest_subtitle: "&7&oObserve or find Suspicious Gravel."
	quest.37738514E5906273.title: "&2&lQuest: The Hidden Gravel"
	quest.377A500CE5F11954.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The Demolishing Modifier is the ultimate upgrade for your gathering tools, letting pickaxes, shovels, axes, and hoes break blocks in a wide 3×3 area.&r This destructive power is unlocked by using the &a&lTerrastomp Prism&r on your tool&r.&r"
		""
		"Use the &5&lHephaestus Forge&r to craft this elemental prism, then apply it to your chosen tool on a Smithing Table.&r Claim the &a&lTerrastomp Prism&r to massively speed up your mining and building projects&r.&r"
	]
	quest.377A500CE5F11954.quest_subtitle: "&l&fAcquire a &a&lTerrastomp Prism&r&l&f to unlock Demolishing Modifier power&r"
	quest.377A500CE5F11954.title: "&5&lQuest: The Demolishing Prism"
	quest.379E1561339A8733.quest_desc: [
		"With the power of ancient craftsmanship, you can now forge a defensive relic lost to time — the &6Reinforced Shield&f."
		""
		"At a &9Smithing Table&f, combine a &fShield&f, a &fCrusher Thorn&f, and an &6Ancient Smithing Upgrade&f."
		"The result is a legendary defense tool capable of &cdamaging enemies&f whenever you block their attacks."
		""
		"Once wielded by the guardians of old, the &6Reinforced Shield&f turns every defense into a strike of retaliation."
	]
	quest.379E1561339A8733.quest_subtitle: "&7&oUpgrade a Shield using Crusher Thorns and an Ancient Smithing Upgrade."
	quest.379E1561339A8733.title: "&6&lQuest: The Reinforced Shield"
	quest.37AEC6DC788A7173.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &9&lEcho Shard&r&f carries wild power drawn from the deep dark, but in its raw state it is unstable and unsafe. To harness it, you must bind it with the strongest materials you can find, taken from both the skies and the depths."
		""
		"Combine a single Echo Shard with four pieces of &7&lPhantom Membrane&r&f and four fragments of &9&lWarden Carapace&r&f in a crafting grid. The reinforced shard that emerges becomes a key ingredient for advanced gear and a mark of your command over both the night sky and the Warden’s lair."
	]
	quest.37AEC6DC788A7173.quest_subtitle: "&f&lReinforce an &9&lEcho Shard&r&f&l using 4 &9&lWarden Carapace&r&f, 4 &7&lPhantom Membrane&r&f, and 1 &9&lEcho Shard&r&f&l"
	quest.37AEC6DC788A7173.title: "&7&lQuest: Sealing the Echo"
	quest.37D7282EF950F76C.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Repair Pylon is a powerful endgame structure that allows you to repair any item with durability without consuming Experience or breaking down like a vanilla anvil. This structure relies solely on the consumption of Spirits."
		""
		""
		""
		"First, you must craft the Tainted Rock Item Pedestal (which uses Tainted Rock). Then, you must gather all four elemental Spirits—Infernal, Aerial, Aquatic, and Spirit—along with large amounts of Tainted Rock and Twisted Rock. Assemble the structure and infuse it with the required components to unlock this vital, permanent repair station! 🖤"
	]
	quest.37D7282EF950F76C.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Build the Repair Pylon multiblock&r for infinite item repair."
	quest.37D7282EF950F76C.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Building the Eternal Repair 🛠️♾️"
	quest.386FCE6B5B57FAE5.quest_desc: [
		"Once your &bGlider&f has hatched, care for it and watch as it enjoys the melodies of your world."
		"When it sits near a &dMusic Disc Player&f and dances to the rhythm of the records, it may drop a precious &fGlider Feather&f."
		""
		"Collect these soft feathers — they’re light as air and filled with the essence of the ancient skies."
		"With a few of them, you’ll soon be able to craft the legendary &bGlider Wing&f."
	]
	quest.386FCE6B5B57FAE5.quest_subtitle: "&7&oObtain a Glider Feather."
	quest.386FCE6B5B57FAE5.title: "&2&lQuest: Glider Feather"
	quest.38885A6D817A8A5D.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to the &2&lTwilight Forest&r&f, a mod that opens up a magical new dimension built for long, wandering adventures. This realm is packed with new &a&lbiomes&r&f, unique &d&ldungeons&r&f, and several distinct final &c&lbosses&r&f waiting at the end of your journey."
		""
		"To get started, you will need to create the portal. Dig a two-by-two hole, fill it with &9&lwater&r&f, surround it with any type of &a&lflower&r&f from the Overworld, then toss a &b&lDiamond&r&f into the pool. Once the portal activates, step through and let the new adventure begin."
	]
	quest.38885A6D817A8A5D.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &2&lTwilight Forest&r&f&l mod and begin your exploration"
	quest.38885A6D817A8A5D.title: "&7&lWelcome to The Twilight Forest"
	quest.3894796C46B0A983.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your first mission in the Overworld is to track down the &6&lPyramid Outpost&r&f, an ancient structure guarded by dangerous &c&lwarriors&r&f who protect its hidden treasures and &6&lchests&r&f.&r Do not let the calm desert dunes fool you; this place is anything but peaceful.&r"
		""
		"You can locate this pyramid using the &6&lEye of the Desert&r&f.&r Once you arrive, you must find two things: the &6&lDesert Collar&r&f hidden in &6&lchests&r&f or &e&lsuspicious sand&r&f, and the secret entrance that leads to the pyramid’s center.&r Beware, the walls around the inner chamber are &8&lindestructible&r&f, forcing you to use the intended path instead of digging straight in.&r"
	]
	quest.3894796C46B0A983.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind the &6&lPyramid Outpost&r&f&l structure in the Overworld &e&lDesert&r&f&l biome"
	quest.3894796C46B0A983.title: "&4&lQuest: Locating the Cursed Pyramid"
	quest.38A59697813C57F2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have conquered the skies, but now it is time to harness the power of the beast itself.&r The &6&lDragon Scale&r is a rare crafting material needed to forge top‑tier Draco Arcanus tools and armor&r.&r"
		""
		"To obtain it, combine a Dragon Head from a slain dragon with the ritualistic &4&lMystical Dagger&r in a simple crafting grid.&r Secure this &6&llegendary material&r to begin creating some of the strongest equipment in the arcane world&r.&r"
	]
	quest.38A59697813C57F2.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft a &6&lDragon Scale&r&l&f using a Mystical Dagger and a Dragon Head&r"
	quest.38A59697813C57F2.title: "&5&lQuest: The Draconic Scale"
	quest.38ADBCC0C25EA403.quest_desc: [
		"&rWelcome to Malum, a deep and dark magic mod centered around Spirit Arcana—paracausal energy derived directly from the soul. Your journey into the occult begins with a strange artifact."
		""
		"You must find the mod's Encyclopedia—a mysterious journal imprinted onto the world by an unknown author. This book is your guide to understanding how to harness Arcana, explore its secrets, and master the forbidden power of the soul! 💀"
	]
	quest.38ADBCC0C25EA403.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Discover the Malum Mod&r and begin your study of Spirit Arcana."
	quest.38ADBCC0C25EA403.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Initiation into the Spirit Arcana 🩸✨"
	quest.390E6B23F579C5FE.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lSonorous Staff&r is a rare tool that channels the dark, echoing energy of the &9&lSculk&r. It is highly sought after and can only be made with components hidden in the deepest corners of the &8&lAncient City&r."
		""
		"Craft or track down this staff to bend the terrifying power of &b&lsound&r to your will and break the silence of the deep. Wielding this magical weapon marks a big step toward mastering the &d&lDeeper and Darker&r mod."
	]
	quest.390E6B23F579C5FE.quest_subtitle: "&f&lAcquire a &b&lSonorous Staff&f, a powerful artifact born from the depths"
	quest.390E6B23F579C5FE.title: "&7&lQuest: Wielding the Sonorous Staff"
	quest.391B6D47F1781BD6.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Not every inhabitant of the Undergarden wants you dead on sight. The &7&lStoneborn&r&f are a calm, rock‑skinned folk who live as traders and villagers in this harsh realm."
		""
		"Track down one of their outposts or wandering merchants and start a trade. Doing business with them is the best way to get unique goods and to learn how the dimension’s economy really works."
	]
	quest.391B6D47F1781BD6.quest_subtitle: "&f&lTrade with a &7&lStoneborn&r&f&l"
	quest.391B6D47F1781BD6.title: "&7&lQuest: Interdimensional Business"
	quest.3A3B89B9022FF769.quest_desc: ["&fPlace a &b&lBook of Lore&r&f inside another &b&lBook of Lore&r&f."]
	quest.3A3B89B9022FF769.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLore-ception!"
	quest.3A3B89B9022FF769.title: "&7&lQuest: Lore-ception!"
	quest.3A869FFB34E62980.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&l1K Storage Disk&r&f is your first &a&ldigital storage&r&f medium. It allows your system to &a&lhold up to 1,000 items&r&f in a single dis, no more chests or cluttered storage rooms!"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lCrafting Steps"
		""
		"To create a &b&l1K Disk&r&f, you'll need:"
		""
		"- &b&l1K Storage Part&r&f"
		""
		"- &b&lRedstone Dust&r&f"
		""
		"- &b&lGlass&r&f"
		""
		"- &b&lSilicon&r&f"
		""
		"Combine them in a &b&lCrafting Table&r&f to form your first &b&l1K Storage Disk.&r&f"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lStorage Tiers"
		""
		"As your network grows, you can upgrade to higher-capacity:"
		""
		"- &b&l4K&r&f - 4,000 items"
		""
		"- &b&l16K&r&f - 16,000 items"
		""
		"- &b&l64K&r&f - 64,000 items"
		""
		"Each tier uses the previous disk as an ingredient, making &a&lupgrading seamless.&r&f"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip"
		""
		"You can insert and remove &b&lStorage Disks&r&f from a &b&lDisk Drive&r&f without breaking it. Perfect for &a&lupgrading&r&f or organizing your data drives!"
	]
	quest.3A869FFB34E62980.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&l1K Storage Disk&r&f&l to begin storing items in your &b&lRefined Storage&r&f&l network"
	quest.3A869FFB34E62980.title: "&9&lQuest: Crafting a 1K Storage Disk"
	quest.3AB27BE4E99F3B28.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lCrushing Wheels&r are powerful &b&lCreate&r machines that act as the &e&ladvanced upgrade&r to the &b&lMillstone&r. When driven with &e&lrotational energy&r in opposite directions, they crush items between them, running &e&lCrushing recipes&r to produce valuable materials and byproducts."
		""
		"Items must be inserted from the side the wheels are &e&lspinning away from&r so they get pulled in and processed correctly. This setup is ideal for &e&lore doubling&r, recycling, and bulk material refinement, letting you squeeze more resources out of raw materials than standard crafting or smelting."
		""
		"Pair your Crushing Wheels with a &b&lMechanical Belt&r or &e&lChute system&r for full automation, feeding items in and collecting outputs automatically. Use &a&lJEI&r to check the crafting recipe and gather everything needed to build this high efficiency processing machine."
	]
	quest.3AB27BE4E99F3B28.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a pair of &b&lCrushing Wheels&r"
	quest.3AB27BE4E99F3B28.title: "&9&lQuest: Crushing Wheel"
	quest.3AE26614E4712AF8.quest_desc: [
		"With the &eStraw Blocks&f you’ve gathered from the &aAbandoned Village&f, you can now recreate one of the most important relics of ancient nature — the &6Nest&f."
		""
		"Crafted from &eStraw Blocks&f and &6Sticks&f, this special block allows you to safely place &aancient eggs&f, helping them hatch faster."
		"You can also use it for decoration by placing normal eggs that will never hatch — a tribute to the life of the jungle."
		""
		"Every Nest brings the ancient world one step closer to rebirth."
	]
	quest.3AE26614E4712AF8.quest_subtitle: "&7&oCraft a Nest."
	quest.3AE26614E4712AF8.title: "&2&lQuest: Crafting the Nest"
	quest.3B0587C146BCD505.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fDeep within the caves, the &8&lCoal Golem&r&f roams quietly among veins of coal. With &c&l10 HP&r&f and a modest &c&l2 attack damage&r&f, it may seem harmless until you bring it to life."
		""
		"&fRight-click the golem with &f&lFlint and Steel&r&f to ignite its fiery core. Once lit, it becomes &c&lhostile toward mobs&r&f, defending you using Rage before turning to ash after its final strike."
		""
		"&fWhen defeated, it drops &8&lCoal&r&f, a small token of its smoldering loyalty."
	]
	quest.3B0587C146BCD505.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind and tame a &8&lCoal Golem&r&f&l to witness its fiery nature&r"
	quest.3B0587C146BCD505.title: "&6&lQuest: Flames of the Deep - The Coal Golem"
	quest.3B2279536B8558B7.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lQuantum Catcher&r is an essential tool for any mage, letting you capture and safely move entities around your world.&r This powerful item is crafted from a mix of forbidden and arcane materials&r.&r"
		""
		"To create it, combine &a&lSpawner Scrap&r, dropped by breaking a Spawner, with an &b&lArcane Crystal Block&r on a Smithing Table&r. Secure the Catcher to gain full control over mob movement and relocation in your adventures&r.&r"
	]
	quest.3B2279536B8558B7.quest_subtitle: "&l&fAcquire the &b&lQuantum Catcher&r&l&f for entity transport&r"
	quest.3B2279536B8558B7.title: "&5&lQuest: The Quantum Catcher"
	quest.3B293A3B0FCD3ED4.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fBefore marriage comes the promise, the &b&lEngagement Ring&r&f allows you to officially get engaged to your loved one in &6&lMinecraft Comes Alive: Reborn&r&f."
		""
		"&fWhen your relationship reaches &d&l50 Hearts&r&f (this value can be configured), you can gift this ring to a villager to become engaged. Once engaged, neither other players nor villagers can marry your partner."
		""
		"&fTo craft it, use the same recipe as the &6&lWedding Ring&r&f, but place a &b&lDiamond&r&f in the top-center slot instead of a gold Ingot, and surround it with &6&l8 Gold Ingots&r&f."
		""
		"&fNote: Engagement is a promise, you cannot propose yet until marriage."
		""
		"&fTake the first step toward your happily ever after."
	]
	quest.3B293A3B0FCD3ED4.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft an &b&lEngagement Ring&r&f to propose to your special villager&r"
	quest.3B293A3B0FCD3ED4.title: "&6&lQuest: Craft the Engagement Ring"
	quest.3B5239122F5B8944.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have mastered the forge and can now work with the raw power of &7&lForgotten Ingots&r&f. Your final task for this tier is to fully arm yourself by upgrading your &6&lCloggrum&r&f tools at the smithing table."
		""
		"Use these ingots to create the complete arsenal: Sword, Pickaxe, Axe, Shovel, Hoe, and the mighty Battleaxe. With every Forgotten tool in hand, you are ready to face the true rulers of the Undergarden."
	]
	quest.3B5239122F5B8944.quest_subtitle: "&f&lUpgrade your &6&lCloggrum&r&f&l set to &6&lall six Forgotten tools&r&f&l using &7&lForgotten Ingots&r&f&l"
	quest.3B5239122F5B8944.title: "&7&lQuest: The Arsenal of the Deep"
	quest.3B750BD9C53DF834.quest_desc: [
		"&rYour Spirit Altar is useless without the proper setup for your infusions. The Item Pedestal is an essential block that must be placed within a four-block radius of the Altar to hold the materials required for your rituals."
		""
		"Craft these pedestals and arrange them around your Altar. Properly placing your components on these pedestals is the first step in performing any successful Spirit Infusion! ✨"
	]
	quest.3B750BD9C53DF834.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft an Item Pedestal&r to hold ritual components."
	quest.3B750BD9C53DF834.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Setting the Stage ⚙️🏺"
	quest.3BC3BA20F1A4FF73.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &a&lPale Garden&r&f is a mystical variation of the &a&lDark Forest&r&f. Search for Pale Oak trees&r&f, Pale Moss, and Eyeblossoms that thrive in this eerie grove. &b&lNo animals roam here&r&f, only the soft sounds of the wind and the whispers of the moss."
		""
		"&fStep into the &a&lPale Garden&r&f and uncover its secrets."
	]
	quest.3BC3BA20F1A4FF73.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind and explore the &a&lPale Garden&r&f&l biome"
	quest.3BC3BA20F1A4FF73.title: "&6&lQuest: Discover the Pale Garden"
	quest.3BDB57580EA6FD76.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Hold the &e&lTantalizing Honey Compass&r&f close and feel it tug you toward the hive’s heart. Once awakened, its power reveals hidden paths and treasures scattered throughout &e&lThe Bumblezone&r&f. Follow where it points, and the bees will surely approve of your honey-scented journey."
	]
	quest.3BDB57580EA6FD76.quest_subtitle: "&f&lActivate the &e&lHoney Compass&r&f&l’s tracking and locating abilities"
	quest.3BDB57580EA6FD76.title: "&7&lQuest: Sweet Direction Awakened"
	quest.3C2183A2E05B39F4.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to &c&lRogues and Warriors&r&f, a mod that brings in RPG-style combat skill sets based on classic Rogue and Warrior archetypes. Your journey here begins with a simple but important choice."
		""
		"First, find a &d&lSpell Binding Table&r&f in village gazebos or craft one yourself (do not forget the &f&lbookshelves&r&f). Use it to create your first &d&lSpell Book&r&f: either the &a&lRogue Manual&r&f or the &6&lWarrior Codex&r&f."
		""
		"The &a&lRogue Manual&r&f focuses on dodging blows and tricking enemies, working best with fast dual-wielded weapons like &a&lDaggers&r&f. The &6&lWarrior Codex&r&f leans into weakening and smashing foes, and pairs well with heavy, slow weapons such as &6&lDouble Axes&r&f."
		""
		"Master the new weapon options and try out the armor sets designed to match each combat style. Once you step into this arena, your legend starts growing right away."
	]
	quest.3C2183A2E05B39F4.quest_subtitle: "&f&lChoose your &c&lcombat path&r&f&l and claim your first arena manual"
	quest.3C2183A2E05B39F4.title: "&a&l Initiation into the Arena"
	quest.3C2B6469DFE5EDCF.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &5&lHephaestus Forge&r is the core of all high‑level forbidden magic, and assembling it is a ritual in itself.&r Gathering the materials is only the first step; the final construction must follow a precise pattern&r.&r"
		""
		"First, build the required multiblock layout with the correct Darkstone and decorative blocks.&r Then place a Smithing Table on the central Gilded Chiseled Polished Darkstone, sneak, and right‑click it with &d&lMundabitur Dust&r to call down corrupted lightning that completes the Forge and unlocks powerful rituals&r.&r"
	]
	quest.3C2B6469DFE5EDCF.quest_subtitle: "&l&fBuild the &5&lHephaestus Forge&r&l&f multiblock structure&r"
	quest.3C2B6469DFE5EDCF.title: "&5&lQuest: Constructing the Hephaestus Forge"
	quest.3CDD75CA27248623.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &2&lKobolediator&r&f is a formidable foe and the strongest warrior in the &6&lPyramid Outpost&r&f, second only to the &6&lAncient Remnant&r&f.&r This massive skeletal reptile has incredible strength and swings an enormous &7&lsword&r&f that can cut you down in just a few hits if you are careless.&r"
		""
		"Be especially careful of its powerful &c&lcharge attacks&r&f, which let it close the distance fast and hit like a runaway minecart.&r If you manage to bring down this deadly enemy, it will drop &6&lAncient Metal Ingots&r&f, its &f&lbones&r&f, and its &2&lhead&r&f.&r You can place the head as a trophy or use it to craft the &2&lSkeletal Reptile Helmet&r&f as a reward for your victory.&r"
	]
	quest.3CDD75CA27248623.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSlay a &2&lKobolediator&r&f&l, the huge skeletal reptile warrior"
	quest.3CDD75CA27248623.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Kobolediator"
	quest.3D3A5C269601B1EF.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fA simple loaf of bread... infused with a living core. &a&lUse the Homunculus&r&f in your recipe to create the &c&lBig Bread&r&f, a strange creation that seems to move slightly."
		""
		"&fThis peculiar bread hides something mysterious inside. &d&lBake your Big Bread&r&f and prepare for the next step."
	]
	quest.3D3A5C269601B1EF.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &6&lBig Bread&r&f&l using a &d&lHomunculus"
	quest.3D3A5C269601B1EF.title: "&6&lQuest: Bake a Big Bread"
	quest.3D73833AD5D2EC24.quest_desc: [
		""
		"To master elemental magic, you need the &b&lElementarium Enhancer&r, a powerful artifact that combines the essence of the four elements.&r With it, you can forge key elemental items like &b&lElemental Prisms&r inside the &5&lHephaestus Forge&r.&r"
		""
		"This Enhancer is a rare prize, with a small chance to appear in the chests of ancient structures&r.&r Search the deepest corners of Jungle Temples, Desert Pyramids, and Underwater Ruins, and claim it to unlock a new tier of magic&r.&r"
	]
	quest.3D73833AD5D2EC24.quest_subtitle: "&l&fAcquire the &b&lElementarium Enhancer&r&l&f from an ancient structure&r"
	quest.3D73833AD5D2EC24.title: "&5&lQuest: Unlocking the Elementarium"
	quest.3DAAC3ADECBA2796.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You seek the pinnacle of arcane power: the &e&lEternal Modifier&r, which completely removes durability from an item, making it truly unbreakable and immortal.&r"
		""
		"This power comes at a steep cost: first, obtain the legendary &e&lEternal Stella&r by performing a complex ritual at the &5&lHephaestus Forge&r.&r This ritual requires a rare &b&lStellarite Piece&r as the core ingredient.&r Once you have the Stella, apply it to any item with a durability bar to grant it &a&leverlasting life&r.&r"
	]
	quest.3DAAC3ADECBA2796.quest_subtitle: "&l&fAcquire the &6&lEternal Modifier &fby crafting and using the &6&lEternal Stella&f"
	quest.3DAAC3ADECBA2796.title: "&5&lQuest: Forging the Eternal"
	quest.3DDD5F0E60A41795.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Tired of running back to your storage terminal every time you need something? With the &b&lWireless Transmitter&r&f and &b&lWireless Grid&r&f, you can access your storage network from anywhere - within range!"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lWireless Transmitter"
		""
		"This device extends your network's reach wirelessly. Place it on a cable connected to your &b&lController&r&f. Once powered, it will emit a wireless signal that allows portable devices to connect to your network. You can also upgrade its range with &a&lRange Upgrades&r&f, extending your access radius significantly."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lWireless Grid"
		""
		"The &b&lWireless Grid&r&f acts as a &a&lportable inventory terminal&r&f. After crafting it, you must link it to your network by right-clicking on a &b&lController&r&f or &b&lGrid&r&f while sneaking. Once linked, it allows you to &a&linsert&r&f and &a&lextract&r&f items remotely, just like a normal Grid."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPower Requirements"
		""
		"The &b&lWireless Grid&r&f uses energy from your inventory (or a compatible power item) each time it's used. Make sure to keep it &a&lcharged&r&f so you don't lose access while you're away from your base."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip"
		""
		"Combine the &b&lWireless Grid&r&f with &a&lRange Upgrades&r&f and &a&lEnergy Cells&r&f for a powerful mobile storage terminal that keeps you connected wherever you go."
	]
	quest.3DDD5F0E60A41795.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lWireless Transmitter&r&f&l and a &b&lWireless Grid&r&f&l to access your &b&lRefined Storage&r&f&l network remotely"
	quest.3DDD5F0E60A41795.title: "&9&lQuest: Wireless Access to Your Network"
	quest.3DF1CABD9EEF45F8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Overworld iron will not keep you safe from the beasts that lurk in this dimension. Your next step in survival is to forge a complete set of basic &6&lCloggrum Armor&r&f, helmet, chestplate, leggings, and boots."
		""
		"Suit up in this sturdy shell before heading into the deeper, more dangerous biomes. Down here, proper gear is the difference between “explorer” and “fossil.”"
	]
	quest.3DF1CABD9EEF45F8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain a &6&lfull suit of Cloggrum armor&r&f&l"
	quest.3DF1CABD9EEF45F8.title: "&7&lQuest: Cover Me in Coprolite"
	quest.3E4A00DBD4113ECB.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&e&lTreated Wood Planks&r are a key building material in &b&lImmersive Engineering&r, used in the construction of essential machines such as the &b&lWater Wheel&r, &e&lHV Capacitor&r, and &b&lWindmill Blade&r."
		""
		"To craft them, surround &e&l8 wooden planks&r with &e&lCreosote Oil&r in the crafting grid. The resulting planks not only look sturdy but also burn at the same rate as regular wood."
		""
		"There are &e&l3 variants&r available: Horizontal, Vertical, and Packaged, all interchangeable in recipes and easily customized using a &b&lChisel&r for decoration."
	]
	quest.3E4A00DBD4113ECB.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft &e&lTreated Wood Planks&r"
	quest.3E4A00DBD4113ECB.title: "&9&lQuest: Treated Wood Planks"
	quest.3E59155776E037EA.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lGrid&r&f is your main &a&linterface&r&f for interacting with your Refined Storage system. It allows you to &a&lsearch, view, insert, and extract&r&f any items or fluids stored in your connected drives. All from one convenient screen."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lHow It Works"
		""
		"Once crafted, place the &b&lGrid&r&f next to a &a&lpowered Controller&r&f or connect it via &b&lCables&r&f. When the Grid powers on, it will display everything stored within your network. You can &a&linstantly move items&r&f in and out, or use the &a&lsearch bar&r&f to find specific materials."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lTypes of Grids"
		""
		"There are several &b&lGrid&r&f variants to enhance functionality:"
		""
		"- &b&lGrid&r&f - Standard item access interface."
		""
		"- &b&lCrafting Grid&r&f - Includes a built-in crafting table for quick recipes."
		""
		"- &b&lPattern Grid&r&f - Used for creating &a&lPatterns&r&f for automation."
		""
		"- &b&lFluid Grid&r&f - Allows access to stored &a&lfluids&r&f."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lManaging Storage"
		""
		"Anything you &a&linsert&r&f into the Grid is automatically sent to available &b&lstorage disks&r&f in your network. Items can also be &a&lextracted&r&f directly for crafting or building, making it the &a&lheart of your daily&r&f interaction with Refined Storage."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip"
		""
		"You can &a&lcustomize&r&f the Grid's display. Switch between list and grid views, sort by name, quantity, or mod, and even set filters for better organization!"
	]
	quest.3E59155776E037EA.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lGrid&r&f&l and connect it to your &b&lRefined Storage&r&f&l network"
	quest.3E59155776E037EA.title: "&9&lQuest: Crafting the Grid"
	quest.3E7A9F6D2E95432C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &b&lPale Oak Tree&r&f is the heart of the Pale Garden. &a&lHarvest its wood&r&f to craft new blocks, planks, fences, and more, expanding your building possibilities."
		""
		"&fIts leaves drop &b&lPale Oak Saplings&r&f, which can be planted in a 2x3 formation to grow your own trees. &d&lCollect Pale Oak Logs&r&f and bring this eerie beauty to your home."
	]
	quest.3E7A9F6D2E95432C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain &b&lPale Oak Logs&r&f&l from the &a&lPale Garden"
	quest.3E7A9F6D2E95432C.title: "&6&lQuest: Collect Pale Oak Logs"
	quest.3EFD67E9AAABD6E7.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fGently place the &d&lCroissant Egg&r&f on solid ground and wait for it to hatch. &a&lFeed it three buckets of milk&r&f to help it grow and become your loyal &c&lCroissant Dragon&r&f."
		""
		"&fIts frosting grants buffs to its owner, and its pastry wings glide through the air. Your first living creation is complete. Welcome to a world where alchemy meets sweetness."
	]
	quest.3EFD67E9AAABD6E7.quest_subtitle: "&f&lPlace the &c&lCroissant Egg&r&f&l on the ground to hatch your &c&lCroissant Dragon"
	quest.3EFD67E9AAABD6E7.title: "&6&lQuest: Hatch the Croissant Dragon"
	quest.3F08CF6F675F470A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &d&lSoul Furnace&r&f is no ordinary forge; it cooks items into their soul-like state. &a&lFill it with Essence&r&f using the Great Chalice, then cook special items such as the &c&lBig Bread&r&f to create powerful soul-infused materials."
		""
		"&fMastering the &d&lSoul Furnace&r&f opens the path to homunculi, crystals, and living creations. &d&lSpite the Soul Furnace&r&f and begin your alchemical journey."
	]
	quest.3F08CF6F675F470A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lPlace a &d&lGreat Chalice&r&f&l on top of a &d&lSoul Furnace&r&f&l and fill it"
	quest.3F08CF6F675F470A.title: "&6&lQuest: Power the Soul Furnace"
	quest.3F4F89F6755B7056.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lSteel Ingot&r is a vital material in &b&lImmersive Engineering&r, used to craft powerful machines, tools, and components across multiple mods."
		""
		"You can produce &b&lSteel Ingots&r by placing &e&l1 Iron Ingot&r and &b&lCoal Coke&r into a &b&lCrude Blast Furnace&r. After some time, the furnace will refine the materials into durable &b&lSteel Ingots&r, ready for your next big industrial project."
		""
		"Collect plenty, because you will need them for advanced machinery and multiblock structures."
	]
	quest.3F4F89F6755B7056.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain a &b&lSteel Ingot&r"
	quest.3F4F89F6755B7056.title: "&9&lQuest: Steel Ingot"
	quest.3F52B55C529B214D.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &c&lHydra&r&f is a huge, many-headed serpent boss that lives in the &4&lFire Swamp&r&f (also known as the Red Swamp), usually found in the middle of a regular swamp biome. It is an extremely dangerous enemy that relies on burning breath attacks and brutal bites."
		""
		"Before you challenge it, bring a strong &c&lFire Resistance Potion&r&f (8 minutes is a good idea) so most of its flame attacks, including the flamethrower, barely touch you. The Hydra stays rooted in one spot, so the real danger is its damage, not its movement."
		""
		"Keep your distance and send its own &c&lfireballs&r&f back by hitting them toward the heads. Be careful: when one head is destroyed, two more will grow in its place. If you win, the Hydra drops &c&lFiery Blood&r&f, which can be used to craft some of the best &6&larmor&r&f and &6&ltools&r&f in the mod."
	]
	quest.3F52B55C529B214D.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the terrifying &c&lHydra&r&f&l boss in the &4&lFire Swamp&r&f&l"
	quest.3F52B55C529B214D.title: "&7&lQuest: Slaying the Hydra"
	quest.3F555359B1887966.quest_desc: [
		"&rTotem Magic allows you to create permanent magical effects (Auras) over an area, which can include healing, speed, protection, or growth. To begin, you must first craft the Runewood Totem Base."
		"Once the base is placed, you must stack five Runewood Logs on top of it. Then, infuse Arcane Spirit and two additional Spirits into the logs according to the specific ritual you wish to activate (e.g., Healing uses Arcane and Sacred Spirits). Right-click the base to activate the aura and bring the magical effect into the world!"
	]
	quest.3F555359B1887966.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Build the Runewood Totem&r and activate your first permanent aura ritual."
	quest.3F555359B1887966.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Activating Totem Magic 🌳🔮"
	quest.3FCF8BCA85801CEC.quest_desc: [
		""
		"End the tedious loop of mining and then smelting.&r The &c&lFiery Modifier&r is a strong elemental upgrade that can be applied to all your gathering tools, including pickaxes, shovels, axes, and hoes&r.&r"
		""
		"Once added, this modifier will automatically smelt any mined block that has a valid smelting recipe, such as ores or cobblestone.&r Obtain the &c&lSmelter Prism&r through a &5&lHephaestus Forge&r ritual and use it on your tool to enjoy instant results and faster mining runs&r.&r"
	]
	quest.3FCF8BCA85801CEC.quest_subtitle: "&l&fAcquire the &c&lFiery Modifier&r&l&f to auto‑smelt mined blocks&r"
	quest.3FCF8BCA85801CEC.title: "&5&lQuest: The Smelting Inferno"
	quest.40602579D060C067.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fEvery growing colony needs a steady food supply to keep its citizens healthy and happy. The fastest way to begin producing food is by building a &b&lFisher's Hut&r&f near a body of water."
		""
		"&fYou may also construct a &a&lFarmer's Hut&r&f or one of the &6&lAnimal Herder&r&f huts, but the &b&lFisher&r&f is often the quickest to set up. Later, consider building a &6&lRestaurant&r&f so your colonists can eat automatically without your help."
		""
		"&fA well-fed colony is a thriving one, so make food your next priority!"
	]
	quest.40602579D060C067.quest_subtitle: "&f&lPlace and build a &a&lFisher's Hut&r"
	quest.40602579D060C067.title: "&6&lStep 5: Food"
	quest.40A120CE4B3CF164.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have learned the basics of &b&lImmersive Engineering&r: generating, storing, and using &b&lImmersive Flux (IF)&r, building multiblock structures, and automating production. Now it is time to explore the &e&lrest of the mod&r using all the tools, items, and guides at your disposal."
		""
		"Consult the &b&lEngineer's Manual&r, experiment with &b&lThermoelectric Generators&r, &b&lWire Networks&r, &b&lAccumulators&r, and advanced machinery. Build, test, and interact with the remaining components. You will gain hands on experience and discover creative setups for energy distribution, resource processing, and automation."
		""
		"This quest is about &e&lunderstanding the full potential&r of the mod and preparing yourself to &b&lmaster industrial engineering&r in Minecraft."
	]
	quest.40A120CE4B3CF164.quest_subtitle: "&f&lInteract with and learn about all remaining blocks, machines, and tools in the mod"
	quest.40A120CE4B3CF164.title: "&9&lQuest: Explore Immersive Engineering&r"
	quest.40A3C14DD6030CC9.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &d&lGreat Chalice&r&f can be crafted like a Cauldron, but using Copper Ingots. &a&lKill monsters&r&f to collect Small or Great Essence, then pour them into the Chalice."
		""
		"&fOnce it's full, interact with it while holding an &6&lEmpty Grail&r&f to obtain a &d&lFilled Grail&r&f. The power of souls now rests in your hands."
	]
	quest.40A3C14DD6030CC9.quest_subtitle: "&f&lUse the &d&lGreat Chalice&r&f&l to fill your &6&lEmpty Grail"
	quest.40A3C14DD6030CC9.title: "&6&lQuest: Fill the Grail"
	quest.41FA3221021D33B9.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Spirit Crucible is a key late-game utility that allows you to transmute basic materials into rarer resources like Blazing Quartz, Glowstone Dust, or even Copper and Amethyst."
		"To craft this transmutational furnace, you need a precise recipe: a Furnace, eight Twisted Rocks, eight Tainted Rocks, two Hex Hash, and a large combination of Infernal and Arcane Spirits. Once built, you can place an Alchemical Impetus inside and fuel the process by adding the required Spirits to begin your alchemical work!"
	]
	quest.41FA3221021D33B9.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Spirit Crucible&r to transmute materials."
	quest.41FA3221021D33B9.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Forging the Spirit Crucible ⚗️🧪"
	quest.42066BD036F1916E.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fHidden deep within &a&lslime chunks&r&f, the &a&lSlime Golem&r&f bounces into action to defend its territory. It can spawn naturally in two forms: the &a&lBig Slime Golem&r&f with &c&l50 HP&r&f and &c&l5 attack&r&f, or the &a&lSmall Slime Golem&r&f with &c&l20 HP&r&f and &c&l3 attack&r&f."
		""
		"&fRepair these golems using &a&lSlimeballs&r&f, and when defeated, they'll drop &a&l1-3 Slimeballs&r&f depending on their size."
		""
		"&fTheir elastic bodies make them surprisingly tough and agile, perfect for holding off intruders in swampy lands or deep cave systems. Whether big or small, these squishy guardians prove that even the softest things can pack a punch!"
	]
	quest.42066BD036F1916E.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate a &a&lSlime Golem&r&f&l in a slime chunk and observe its unique size variants&r"
	quest.42066BD036F1916E.title: "&6&lQuest: The Bouncy Protector - Slime Golem"
	quest.42599B9351660F86.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your new &6&lSlingshot&r&f is not worth much without proper ammo. Pick up a simple &7&lDepthrock Pebble&r&f and load it into the pouch."
		""
		"Aim at any safe target, whether it is a wall, a stump, or an unlucky mob, and loose the shot to test the power and trajectory of your new ranged weapon."
	]
	quest.42599B9351660F86.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFire a &6&lSlingshot&r&f&l with a &7&lDepthrock Pebble&r&f&l"
	quest.42599B9351660F86.title: "&7&lQuest: Flinging Rocks"
	quest.427FDB1188613601.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to &a&lArchers&r&f (RPG Series), a mod focused on mastering ranged combat and the archer archetype. To begin your training, find a &d&lSpell Binding Table&r&f in a village gazebo or build one yourself, making sure to surround it with &f&lbookshelves&r&f."
		""
		"Use the table to craft your &a&lArchery Manual&r&f, your personal spellbook of bow skills. Once equipped, its skills work with any bow or crossbow you own. You will unlock a new set of craftable ranged weapons and armor pieces made to boost your &a&larchery&r&f."
		""
		"For extra efficiency, craft the &a&lAuto-Fire Hook&r&f, a special gadget that attaches to your ranged weapon and lets you keep firing just by holding the use key. Master your bow and write your name across the battlefield."
	]
	quest.427FDB1188613601.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &a&lArchers&r&f&l mod and craft your &a&lArchery Manual&r&f&l"
	quest.427FDB1188613601.title: "&a&lThe Way of the Arrow"
	quest.42AAF11763261DF8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&f&6&lVanilla Backport&r&f brings modern Minecraft features to older versions, adding new biomes, mobs, blocks, and mechanics for a richer world."
		""
		"&fExplore &a&lChase the Skies&r&f with new heights, discover &a&lThe Garden Awakens&r&f with fresh flora, watch nature &a&lSpring to Life&r&f with vibrant growth, and embark on adventures with &a&lBundles of Bravery&r&f to carry your journey."
		""
		"&fYour classic Minecraft world just got a massive upgrade."
	]
	quest.42AAF11763261DF8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lBegin your adventure and explore the new features brought by &6&lVanilla Backport&r&f&l"
	quest.42AFCBAD6E3112F1.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The goo left behind by cute &b&lScintlings&r&f turns out to be perfect sticky ammo. Load a &6&lScintling Goo Ball&r&f into your slingshot and launch it at a creature of your choice."
		""
		"It probably will not finish them off, but it will slow them down and irritate them nicely. Sometimes petty revenge is still very satisfying."
	]
	quest.42AFCBAD6E3112F1.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFire a &6&lScintling Goo Ball&r&f&l at something to annoy it"
	quest.42AFCBAD6E3112F1.title: "&7&lQuest: Flying Inconvenience"
	quest.42D9BEB9AA7A3EFA.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lBrass Ingot&r is one of the most essential materials in &b&lCreate&r, used to craft advanced machinery and precision tools."
		""
		"To produce &e&lBrass&r, you need a &c&lBlaze Burner&r beneath a &b&lMixer&r and combine &e&lCopper Ingots&r with &b&lZinc Ingots&r. The intense heat from the burner allows the perfect alloy reaction, creating one of Create’s most valuable metals."
		""
		"&e&lBrass&r is used in crafting &e&lFunnels&r, &e&lTunnels&r, &e&lFlywheels&r, and even &a&lMechanical Crafters&r, the key component for building the mighty &c&lCrushing Wheel&r."
		""
		"Mastering &e&lBrass&r marks your first real step into the world of &e&ladvanced automation&r."
	]
	quest.42D9BEB9AA7A3EFA.quest_subtitle: "&f&lMix &e&lCopper Ingots&f&l and &b&lZinc Ingots&f&l to obtain a &e&lBrass Ingot&r"
	quest.42D9BEB9AA7A3EFA.title: "&9&lQuest: Brass Ingot"
	quest.42DF66B39E4CFCA5.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &d&lKnight Phantom&r&f is a floating boss found in a large chamber of the &8&lGoblin Knight Stronghold&r&f. The fight is against six identical figures, each with its own health bar, all moving in the same pattern to throw you off."
		""
		"Only one of them is the real Knight Phantom, the one with a solid, more opaque body. All of the Phantoms attack by hurling various &6&lKnightly tools&r&f across the room. To win, you must take down all six Phantoms in turn, always aiming for the one that looks physical."
		""
		"When you succeed, a &6&lChest&r&f appears in the center of the arena, filled with enchanted &d&lPhantom armor&r&f and a selection of &6&lKnightly tools&r&f as your reward."
	]
	quest.42DF66B39E4CFCA5.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat all six &d&lKnight Phantoms&r&f&l inside the Stronghold"
	quest.42DF66B39E4CFCA5.title: "&7&lQuest: Slaying the Knight Phantom"
	quest.42E482E3E33BD18D.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fOne of the most iconic features of the Aether’s floating islands is the &b&lAercloud&r&f, mystical clouds that react when stepped on."
		""
		"&fAmong them, the &b&lBlue Aercloud&r&f is a favorite: soft, bouncy, and full of kinetic sky energy."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lFinding Aerclouds"
		""
		"&fBlue Aerclouds naturally spawn around the edges and undersides of Aether islands."
		""
		"&fThey appear as &b&llight-blue, semi-transparent blocks&r&f that gently shimmer in the sunlight."
		""
		"&fBe cautious when exploring for them, one wrong move could send you falling into the void (and back to the Overworld)."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lThe Bounce"
		""
		"&fWhen you land on a &b&lBlue Aercloud&r&f, you will be launched &a&linto the air&r&f with a satisfying bounce."
		""
		"&fUse this to reach higher places, cross gaps, or just enjoy the thrill of sky acrobatics."
		""
		"&fOther Aerclouds have different effects, experiment with them all to see how they can help you navigate this aerial paradise."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip"
		""
		"&fCombine &b&lBlue Aerclouds&r&f with &d&lGravitite Tools&r&f or &a&lMoa mounts&r&f for maximum mobility."
		""
		"&fMastering their use can make traversing the &b&lAether&r&f faster, safer, and a lot more fun."
	]
	quest.42E482E3E33BD18D.quest_subtitle: "&fFind and bounce on a &b&lBlue Aercloud&r&f in the &b&lAether&r&f"
	quest.42E482E3E33BD18D.title: "&7&lQuest: Bounce on a Blue Aercloud"
	quest.4339B5C1FF181388.quest_desc: [
		""
		"To progress in &b&lApplied Energistics&r, you will need &b&lFlux Crystals&r, a vital material used for crafting many key components."
		""
		"You can create &b&lFlux Crystals&r by throwing the following items into water:"
		""
		"- &b&l1 Charged Certus Quartz Crystal&r"
		""
		"- &e&l1 Redstone Dust&r"
		""
		"- &b&l1 Nether Quartz&r"
		""
		"They will react to form &e&l2 Flux Crystals&r. Doing this automatically is left as an exercise for the reader."
		""
		"If you do not have a &b&lCharged Certus Quartz Crystal&r yet, you can produce one using the &b&lCharger&r. Simply place a &b&lCertus Quartz Crystal&r in the &b&lCharger&r and power it manually with a &e&lWooden Crank&r or through energy cables."
	]
	quest.4339B5C1FF181388.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain &b&l1x Flux Crystal&f and &b&l1x Charged Certus Quartz Crystal&r"
	quest.4339B5C1FF181388.title: "&9&lQuest: The Power of Fluix"
	quest.433DEF2B6861D093.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Mermorphs are the new friendly denizens of the deep, appearing both inside Sea Villages and naturally in various ocean biomes.&r They are bound to the water and cannot survive long on land, making them a distinctive and fragile sight when encountered&r.&r"
		""
		"To complete this quest, locate an Ocean biome and look for one of these underwater villagers to begin interacting with them.&r Treat them kindly, they are naturally friendly toward players, and any attempt to harm them with a Trident will simply be ignored&r.&r"
	]
	quest.433DEF2B6861D093.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSee a &b&lMermorph&r&l&f for the first time in an ocean biome&r"
	quest.433DEF2B6861D093.title: "&4&lQuest: Encountering the Mermorph"
	quest.437CE794B6429D59.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &c&lUr-Ghast&r&f is a huge, tentacled Ghast boss that waits at the very top of a &8&lDark Tower&r&f, boasting a massive health pool of 250 points."
		""
		"It uses three different attack patterns and can be hurt in several ways. One key tactic is to activate the &c&lGhast Traps&r&f in the rooms below the arena: charge them by killing &c&lGhastlings&r&f, then trigger them with &4&lRedstone&r&f to fire a damaging red beam at the Ur-Ghast, while normal ranged attacks also help whittle it down."
		""
		"When you finally bring it down, a chest will appear containing the &c&lUr-Ghast Trophy&r&f, more &c&lFiery Blood&r&f, and valuable &6&lCarminite&r&f. Put this colossal spirit to rest and enjoy the loot."
	]
	quest.437CE794B6429D59.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the powerful &c&lUr-Ghast&r&f&l boss at the top of the &8&lDark Tower&r&f&l"
	quest.437CE794B6429D59.title: "&7&lQuest: Slaying the Ur-Ghast"
	quest.438BC071A3AA2328.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Gathering the magical energy called Aureal by hand is slow work.&r An &b&lArcane Crystal Obelisk&r solves this by passively filling the Aureal bar of your &5&lHephaestus Forge&r when placed on a Pedestal spot nearby&r.&r"
		""
		"To construct it, stack 2 Arcane Crystal Blocks on top of an Arcane Polished Darkstone Block in the correct location.&r Finish the transformation by right‑clicking the structure with &d&lMundabitur Dust&r, then relax while the Obelisk quietly keeps your Aureal topped up&r.&r"
	]
	quest.438BC071A3AA2328.quest_subtitle: "&l&fBuild an &b&lArcane Crystal Obelisk&r&l&f to automate Aureal generation&r"
	quest.438BC071A3AA2328.title: "&5&lQuest: Constructing the Obelisk"
	quest.43E5A9384AA0756B.quest_desc: [
		"&rSoulstained Steel is an essential magical metal, forming the core of advanced armor and weapons in Malum. To forge this alloy, you must perform a Spirit Infusion ritual at your Altar."
		""
		""
		"The necessary ingredients include Iron Ingots and four Processed Soulstones, which are combined with Wicked Spirit, Earthen Spirit, and Arcane Spirit. Secure this ingot to unlock the ability to craft gear that absorbs spiritual damage!"
	]
	quest.43E5A9384AA0756B.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft a Soulstained Steel Ingot&r, a base for powerful Soul gear."
	quest.43E5A9384AA0756B.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Forging Soulstained Steel ⚙️🛡️"
	quest.44082E1C6FA54E16.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Once a Villager has been turned into a Mermorph Worker, you can specialize them into different roles with special Seashell items.&r This lets you build a functional underwater village with focused trades instead of generic workers&r.&r"
		""
		"- &b&lSeashell of Blacksmith&r: Crafted on an Anvil using an Aquamarine Crystal, an Amethyst Cluster, and six Nautilus Shells; use it to convert a Mermorph into a Blacksmith."
		""
		"- &b&lSeashell of Hunter&r: Crafted similarly, but with a Fletching Table in the center instead, turning a Mermorph into a Hunter."
		""
		"With more shells, Mermorphs can also become Farmers or Architects, unlocking new trade options and progression paths in your ocean settlement&r.&r"
	]
	quest.44082E1C6FA54E16.quest_subtitle: "&l&fChange a Mermorph’s profession using the &b&lSeashell of Blacksmith&r&l&f or &b&lSeashell of Hunter&r"
	quest.44082E1C6FA54E16.title: "&4&lQuest: Mastering Mermorph Professions"
	quest.4462C3BB499E4031.quest_desc: [
		""
		"To find the massive &b&lFrosted Prison&r&f in the snowy biomes, you must first craft and use the &3&lEye of Curse&r&f.&r This special eye works as a &e&lmagical compass&r&f, directing you straight to the lair of the formidable &3&lMaledictus&r&f boss.&r"
		""
		"Craft this item and get ready for &b&lfreezing temperatures&r&f and the deadly &7&lDraugr&r&f forces that guard the prison.&r Bundle up, because this dungeon is colder than any regular snow biome you have seen.&r"
	]
	quest.4462C3BB499E4031.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft the &3&lEye of Curse&r&f&l to locate the &b&lFrosted Prison&r&f&l&r"
	quest.4462C3BB499E4031.title: "&4&lQuest: Forging the Eye of Curse"
	quest.44A8DA8647FFB7FD.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lHand Crank&r is a simple &b&lCreate&r component that generates &e&lrotational force&r manually through player interaction. By right clicking repeatedly, you can produce a small but steady stream of mechanical power, perfect for &e&learly game automation&r or testing simple machines."
		""
		"It can drive nearby &b&lMechanical Presses&r, &b&lMixers&r, cogs, and other components that need rotational input. While it does not provide much &e&lStress Capacity&r, it is a reliable and accessible power source when you are just starting out, before building bigger engines or windmills."
		""
		"Use &a&lJEI&r to view the crafting recipe and gather the materials needed to make this essential starter tool."
	]
	quest.44A8DA8647FFB7FD.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &e&lHand Crank&r"
	quest.44A8DA8647FFB7FD.title: "&9&lQuest: Hand Crank"
	quest.44AC36814E27C4C3.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &a&lExporter&r&f is basically your automation buddy in &d&lRefined Storage&r&f. It lets your network automatically push items from your storage into external inventories like Chests, Machines, or Furnaces."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&l&fHow It Works"
		""
		"&fPlace the &a&lExporter&r&f facing the inventory where you want items to go. Once it's connected to your &b&lController&r&f with &b&lCables&r&f, you can configure what items it should export using its filter slots."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&l&fFiltering and &6&lUpgrades&r&f"
		""
		"&fInsert items into the &a&lExporter&r&f's filter to specify which ones should be sent out. You can also use &2&lSpeed&r&f and &2&lStack&r&f &2&lUpgrades&r&f to increase the transfer rate and move entire stacks at once."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&l&fAutomation Tips"
		""
		"&fHook up multiple &a&lExporters&r&f to feed items into different machines automatically. You can also use &8&lRedstone&r&f to turn the &a&lExporter&r&f on or off based on external signals."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lPro &f&lTip:&r"
		""
		"&fCombine &a&lExporters&r&f with &2&lRegulator Upgrades&r&f to keep a specific amount of items in external inventories, so your machines stay supplied without overfilling them."
	]
	quest.44AC36814E27C4C3.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft an &aExporter&f and connect it to an external inventory to automatically send items from your storage network"
	quest.44AC36814E27C4C3.title: "&9&lQuest: Crafting the Exporter"
	quest.44B6F0F432BC9579.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The adorable, glowing &b&lScintlings&r&f are gentle, harmless residents of this realm. Yet in the scramble to survive, sometimes innocence gets caught in the crossfire."
		""
		"This quest marks a darker step in your story: the moment you spilled blood that never needed to be shed. Take a good look at that tiny victim, hero… you monster."
	]
	quest.44B6F0F432BC9579.quest_subtitle: "&f&lYou killed an innocent &b&lScintling&r&f&l. You monster…"
	quest.44B6F0F432BC9579.title: "&7&lQuest: Terrible Person"
	quest.44D33C35CAE57FA9.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&e&lCreosote Oil&r is a byproduct fluid produced in the &b&lCoke Oven&r while making Coal Coke. This valuable fluid is essential for crafting &e&lTreated Wood Planks&r, a core building material in &b&lImmersive Engineering&r."
		""
		"To collect it, simply insert an empty &b&lBucket&r, &b&lGlass Bottle&r, or &b&lJerrycan&r into the Coke Oven's fluid output slot, or use a &b&lPump&r to extract it automatically."
		""
		"Keep that oil handy, you will need plenty for your engineering projects."
	]
	quest.44D33C35CAE57FA9.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain a bucket of &e&lCreosote Oil&r"
	quest.44D33C35CAE57FA9.title: "&9&lQuest: Creosote Oil"
	quest.44D7B66E64006A9C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fTo uncover the ancient secrets frozen in &d&lSuspicious Ice&r&f, you'll need more than just a &6&lPaintbrush&r&f, you'll need a &b&lChisel&r&f."
		""
		"&fThe &b&lChisel&r&f is a stronger excavation tool, capable of breaking through the toughest archaeological materials like ice, sand, and gravel infused with ancient remains."
		""
		"&fGather the required materials and craft your own &b&lChisel&r&f. With it in hand, you'll be ready to extract the rarest relics buried deep within time itself."
	]
	quest.44D7B66E64006A9C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lChisel&r"
	quest.44D7B66E64006A9C.title: "&6&lQuest: Crafting the Chisel"
	quest.451FEC650BD9FF00.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lWire Connectors&f (LV, MV, and HV)&r are essential components in &b&lImmersive Engineering&r's power network. They allow machines, generators, and accumulators to send and receive &b&lImmersive Flux (IF)&r or &e&lRedstone Flux (RF)&r."
		""
		"Simply attach a &b&lWire Connector&r to a machine's power plug, then use a &b&lWire Coil&r to link it to another Connector or &b&lWire Relay&r. Note that each Connector can only support one wire connection at a time, a limitation introduced in version 0.8."
		""
		"If you ever need to remove a wire, use your trusty &b&lEngineer's Wire Cutters&r on the Connector to cleanly disconnect it."
	]
	quest.451FEC650BD9FF00.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft or obtain &b&lWire Connector&f (LV)&r"
	quest.451FEC650BD9FF00.title: "&9&lQuest: LV Wire Connector"
	quest.4523A279C5E2EC5C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"A new power is rising in the skies: the &6&lBrass Boss&r&f, a guardian of the deepest secrets of the &b&lAether&r&f. Its strength surpasses all who came before, a true trial even for veteran sky warriors. Stand against this mechanical menace and prove that no &c&lstorm&r&f, &c&lflame&r&f, or &c&lfury&r&f can break your resolve."
	]
	quest.4523A279C5E2EC5C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the mighty &6&lBrass Boss&r&f &lin the &b&lAether's&r&f&f &lfinal challenge"
	quest.4523A279C5E2EC5C.title: "&7&lQuest: Defeat the Brass Boss"
	quest.45312BEB7355535F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fStone and ores are essential for your colony's growth, making the &8&lMine&r&f the next logical step in your expansion."
		""
		"&fBy constructing a Mine, your citizens will begin gathering valuable materials like &8&lCobblestone&r&f, &8&lStone&r&f, &c&lIron&r&f, and more, providing the foundation for advanced buildings, tools, and equipment."
		""
		"&fA reliable source of minerals will keep your &6&lBuilder&r&f and &a&lCraftsmen&r&f supplied, ensuring your colony continues to thrive deep below the surface."
	]
	quest.45312BEB7355535F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lPlace and build a &8&lMine&r"
	quest.45312BEB7355535F.title: "&6&lStep 7: Miner"
	quest.454A98D4325ECF82.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Before you can truly claim the depths, you need a reliable connection back home. The &d&lCatalyst&r&f is the core of your return portal, stabilizing the wild dimensional energies around you."
		""
		"Gather a pure &b&lDiamond&r&f, gleaming &6&lGold&r&f, and sturdy &7&lIron&r&f, then forge them together into this powerful anchor. Without it, you risk being trapped in the Undergarden for good, so craft it well, unless you fancy a permanent vacation in the dark."
	]
	quest.454A98D4325ECF82.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &d&lCatalyst&r&f&l using a &b&lDiamond&r&f&l, &6&l4 Gold Ingots&r&f&l, and &7&l4 Iron Ingots&r&f&l"
	quest.454A98D4325ECF82.title: "&7&lQuest: The Dimensional Catalyst ⚙️💎"
	quest.4621F30F62523F4C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fYour journey doesn't end here. There are many more companions waiting to be discovered, each with unique powers, stories, and secrets. Explore the world, unlock new challenges, and build your ultimate team of allies."
	]
	quest.4621F30F62523F4C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind and meet all the companions available in the Companions mod"
	quest.4621F30F62523F4C.title: "&6&lQuest: Discover All Companions"
	quest.468286BED2D78219.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&f&lBlessed Amethyst Crab&r Meat &fis a key consumable you need to survive the &c&ldebuffs&r &finflicted by the &c&lLeviathan&r &fboss&r. &fWhen eaten, it grants the &b&lBlessing of Amethyst&r &fstatus effect for &a&l90 seconds&r."
		""
		"&fThis blessing gives full immunity to three nasty effects used by the Leviathan&r: &c&lDarkness&r, &c&lAbyssal Fear&r, &c&lAbyssal Burn&r."
		""
		"&fTo obtain the &a&lBlessed Meat&r:"
		""
		"&fAcquire regular Crab Meat by defeating the &a&lAmethyst Crab &fmini-boss in &a&lLush Caves&r."
		""
		"&fLocate the &b&lAltar of Amethyst&r &finside the &b&lSunken City&r &fstructure&r."
		""
		"&fPlace the raw Crab Meat on the Altar to perform the blessing ritual, turning it into its &a&limmune-granting form&r."
		""
		"&fConsuming this item is a crucial step before facing the terrifying &c&lLeviathan&r."
	]
	quest.468286BED2D78219.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain &a&lBlessed Amethyst Crab Meat &fto gain immunity against the &c&lLeviathan&r"
	quest.468286BED2D78219.title: "&4&lQuest: The Abyssal Blessing"
	quest.48B1515D2F2701F9.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Upon successfully defeating the formidable &c&lNetherite Monstrosity&r boss, you will be rewarded with the &6&lInfernal Forge&r. This unique tool is a highly valuable, dual-purpose item:"
		""
		"It acts as a potent &c&lweapon&r, dealing &c&l13 attack damage&r."
		""
		"It functions as an excellent &e&lpickaxe&r and is completely &a&lunbreakable&r."
		""
		"Claim this weapon of the deep &c&lNether&r to solidify your status as a master of both combat and mining!"
	]
	quest.48B1515D2F2701F9.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain the &6&lInfernal Forge&r&l&f, the unbreakable pickaxe and weapon"
	quest.48B1515D2F2701F9.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Inferno Forge"
	quest.4909BFC6FD759F89.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Stand before the &b&lValkyrie Queen&r&f, the relentless guardian of the &7&lSilver Dungeon&r&f. Prove your worth by defeating her and claiming the &7&lSilver Key&r&f as your prize. Her speed and power will push your skills to the limit, only the truly brave will walk out victorious."
	]
	quest.4909BFC6FD759F89.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the &b&lValkyrie Queen&r&f&l in the &7&lSilver Dungeon&r&f&l"
	quest.4909BFC6FD759F89.title: "&7&lQuest: Defeat the Silver Boss"
	quest.49883C84EB21AC1E.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The stone of this realm hides ores and minerals unlike anything on the surface. To start exploiting the depths, you first need to mine a single piece of native ore."
		""
		"Whether it turns out to be &6&lCloggrum&r&f, &b&lFroststeel&r&f, or something even rarer, secure at least one sample. That lone chunk is your first foothold in the Undergarden’s rich underground resources."
	]
	quest.49883C84EB21AC1E.quest_subtitle: "&f&lAcquire &6&lany Undergarden ore&r&f&l"
	quest.49883C84EB21AC1E.title: "&7&lQuest: Deep Extraction"
	quest.49D3A86FD45BC28F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"A gentle hum of wings fills the air as you move closer to a &e&lBee Nest&r&f. Inside, tireless bees craft golden nectar and defend their precious hive. Take another step if you dare, but tread carefully, one wrong move, and the hive may not appreciate your curiosity."
	]
	quest.49D3A86FD45BC28F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lApproach a &e&lBeehive&r&f&l or &e&lBee Nest&r&f&l"
	quest.49D3A86FD45BC28F.title: "&7&lQuest: Buzzing Curiosity"
	quest.49EB5A2343411DF2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lEnchanted Spell Book&r is a valuable artifact that greatly expands your magical reserves.&r When equipped as your primary spellbook, it grants a sizeable bonus to maximum mana so you can cast more spells before needing to recover&r.&r"
		""
		"You will usually find this tome as loot in the many new towers, forts, and dungeons added by the mod.&r Explore these dangerous locations and secure the book to keep your mana bar ready for long, powerful battles&r.&r"
	]
	quest.49EB5A2343411DF2.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain an &b&lEnchanted Spell Book&r&l&f to increase your Max Mana&r"
	quest.49EB5A2343411DF2.title: "&5&lQuest: The Enchanted Tome"
	quest.49ECCBB5A3B88B7A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fDeep within &b&lThe Factory&r&f, the sound of static whispers through the ruins. &a&lHidden among the old machinery&r&f lies the &d&lBroken Dinamo&r&f, a silent remnant of once powerful energy source."
		""
		"&fIt no longer moves, but faint sparks flicker from its core, hinting that it can be repaired. &d&lSecure the Broken Dinamo&r&f and prepare to bring it back to life."
	]
	quest.49ECCBB5A3B88B7A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate a &d&lBroken Dinamo&r&f&l inside The Factory"
	quest.49ECCBB5A3B88B7A.title: "&d&lQuest: Find the Broken Dinamo"
	quest.4A7A557C7002E2B5.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &4&lNether Gauntlet&r&f is a powerful boss that appears in rare structures scattered around the fiery &4&lNether&r&f.&r This massive foe relies on huge fists and &5&lmagic attacks&r&f to crush anything that gets too close.&r"
		""
		"The Gauntlet can only be harmed by striking its &e&leye&r&f.&r Watch out for its heavy &c&lpunches&r&f, a continuous &c&llaser beam&r&f that chips away at your health, and a devastating &c&lcharged fist attack&r&f that gives you just a brief window to dodge.&r Defeat this brutal boss to claim your reward of &6&lAncient Debris&r&f and prove you can survive the hottest part of the Nether.&r"
	]
	quest.4A7A557C7002E2B5.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the &4&lNether Gauntlet&r&f&l boss in its rare &4&lNether&r&f&l structure"
	quest.4A7A557C7002E2B5.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Nether Gauntlet"
	quest.4B01FA950D80AEA1.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lCryomancer&r is a powerful hostile mage who commands the Ice school of magic with freezing, slowing, and damaging spells.&r This sorcerer is usually found guarding dangerous Mountain Towers that generate in snowy and mountain biomes&r.&r"
		""
		"Defeating this opponent is a key step in advancing your Ice magic.&r Cryomancer Towers contain valuable loot, including spell scrolls and &b&lFrozen Bones&r, the main focus item for Ice magic, so bring fire‑based spells or strong mobility gear to counter their icy attacks and claim your prize&r.&r"
	]
	quest.4B01FA950D80AEA1.quest_subtitle: "&l&fDefeat the &b&lCryomancer&r&l&f, master of Ice magic, in their mountain tower&r"
	quest.4B01FA950D80AEA1.title: "&5&lQuest: Slaying the Cryomancer"
	quest.4B1259CC68703C6F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &5&lEnder Guardian&r is the final boss of the &5&lRuined Citadel&r, found two levels deeper than the main structure, directly below the Ender Golem. This boss has &a&l333 Health&r and &9&l20 Armor&r."
		""
		"During the fight, the Guardian uses deadly attacks: it will knock you into the air, &c&lcharge&r at you, and summon &d&lVoid Runes&r that deal large amounts of damage."
		""
		"When the &5&lEnder Guardian&r reaches &e&lhalf health&r, it will smash the ground, causing both it and you to fall to the level below. Once defeated, it drops the &d&lGauntlet of the Guard&r. This unique weapon allows you to hold the right mouse button to suck nearby entities towards you."
	]
	quest.4B1259CC68703C6F.quest_subtitle: "&l&fDefeat the powerful &5&lEnder Guardian&r&l&f at the lowest level of the &5&lRuined Citadel&r&l&f"
	quest.4B1259CC68703C6F.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Ender Guardian"
	quest.4B3079E9D8042482.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fHidden deep within the icy wilderness lies the &b&lIce Spike Castle&r&f, a majestic structure made of frozen towers and ancient magic. Only the bravest adventurers dare to search for it, as the cold winds and treacherous conditions in make the journey perilous."
		""
		"&fFind the castle and uncover the secrets frozen within its walls."
	]
	quest.4B3079E9D8042482.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind structure - &b&lIce Spike Castle&r"
	quest.4B3079E9D8042482.title: "&6&lQuest: The Frozen Fortress"
	quest.4B98704054699764.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fBuried deep within the &d&lSuspicious Ice&r&f of the &b&lFrozen Nests&r&f lies one of the rarest relics of the ancient skies, the &b&lSoarer Egg&r&f."
		""
		"&fCarefully use your &6&lBrush&r&f or &b&lChisel&r&f to reveal it without breaking its fragile shell. This precious egg carries the life of a majestic bird capable of flight and grace beyond imagination."
		""
		"&fFew explorers have ever seen one, will you be among them?"
	]
	quest.4B98704054699764.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind a &b&lSoarer Egg&r&f&l in Suspicious Ice&r"
	quest.4B98704054699764.title: "&6&lQuest: The Soarer Egg"
	quest.4BC5CD3FE13DFE14.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your Tier 1 &5&lHephaestus Forge&r is ready for basic magic, but it cannot yet handle the most complex spells.&r To unlock advanced rituals and store more essences, you must start the upgrade sequence&r.&r"
		""
		"These upgrades use unique, one‑time rituals that do not create items but instead raise your Forge by one full tier.&r Learn the required recipes, perform each &d&lupgrade ritual&r, and push your Forge all the way to Tier 5 to wield its full arcane potential&r.&r"
	]
	quest.4BC5CD3FE13DFE14.quest_subtitle: "&l&fExecute the special &d&lupgrading rituals&r&l&f to increase the Hephaestus Forge Tier&r"
	quest.4BC5CD3FE13DFE14.title: "&5&lQuest: Upgrading the Master Forge"
	quest.4CA480EE500B3600.quest_desc: [
		""
		"After so many battles, dungeons, and skybound adventures, even heroes need a break. Rest your head among the clouds and drift into dreams under the endless sky. At this point, you have truly made the &b&lAether&r&f your home."
	]
	quest.4CA480EE500B3600.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSleep in a &f&lBed&r&f&l within the &b&lAether Dimension&r&f&l"
	quest.4CA480EE500B3600.title: "&7&lQuest: Finally, Rest Among the Clouds"
	quest.4D4780EAC4B847D9.quest_desc: [
		"&rEther is a mystical light source and a necessary ingredient for mid-to-late-game rituals and decorative items like Ether Torches and Brasiers."
		""
		"To create this key element, you must perform a Spirit Infusion ritual at your Altar. The required ingredients are Glowstone, Blazing Quartz (found in the Nether), Blaze Powder, and a mix of Infernal Spirits and Arcane Spirits. Successfully craft the Ether to unlock a new tier of ritual magic! 🌌"
	]
	quest.4D4780EAC4B847D9.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Ether&r for mystical light and advanced rituals."
	quest.4D4780EAC4B847D9.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Forging the &dIridescent Ether&r ✨🔮"
	quest.4D51620C233B3439.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Fire from the Overworld is unreliable, or even outright banned, in the &e&lEternal Starlight&r&f’s strange magical environment. The &6&lSalpeter Matchbox&r&f is a crucial, dimension-specific tool that lets you safely and consistently start a &c&lfire&r&f using local materials."
		""
		"Gather the needed ingredients, including the volatile &7&lSalpeter&r&f, and combine them to create this key utility item. Learning how to handle fire in this alien world opens the door to new &a&lcrafting&r&f and &a&lprocessing&r&f options you would not reach otherwise."
	]
	quest.4D51620C233B3439.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &6&lSalpeter Matchbox&r&f&l, a controlled flame source for the dimension"
	quest.4D51620C233B3439.title: "&7&lQuest: The Salpeter Matchbox"
	quest.4D8160932B245729.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You launch an &5&lEnder Pearl&r&f toward the &e&lBee Nest&r&f, and the world seems to hold its breath. In an instant, the air shimmers with golden light, and you feel yourself pulled straight through the hive’s heart into the Bumblezone."
	]
	quest.4D8160932B245729.quest_subtitle: "&f&lEnter the &e&lBumblezone Dimension&r&f&l by throwing an &5&lEnder Pearl&r&f&l at a &e&lBeehive&r&f&l or &e&lBee Nest&r&f&l"
	quest.4D8160932B245729.title: "&7&lQuest: Through the Hive Gate"
	quest.4DB072B6AEADAFB2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lCogwheel&r is a basic yet vital component in &b&lCreate&r, used to relay &e&lrotational energy&r throughout your machines."
		"By linking cogwheels together, you can transfer motion in different directions, adjust speed, or even build intricate &b&lmechanical systems&r."
		""
		"Pairing a &e&lCogwheel&r with a &e&lLarge Cogwheel&r lets you change rotation direction or create &e&lRPM Enhancing Rigs&r, setups that double or halve rotational speed."
		"They are also essential for powering &b&lMechanical Crafters&r, &b&lMixers&r, &b&lPumps&r, and other kinetic components that keep your factory moving."
		""
		"Every contraption’s heartbeat runs through its cogwheels: keep them spinning and your world of creation stays alive."
	]
	quest.4DB072B6AEADAFB2.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &e&lCogwheel&f&l using a &b&lShaft&f&l and any Planks&r"
	quest.4DB072B6AEADAFB2.title: "&9&lQuest: Cogwheel"
	quest.4DBEF977ECB08191.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lAndesite Alloy&r is the foundation of all mechanical progress in &b&lCreate&r. It is your first step toward building &b&lkinetic machines&r, gears, and mechanical wonders that bring your world to life."
		""
		"You can get it by combining &l&7andesite&r with either an &f&lIron Nugget&r or a &b&lZinc Nugget&r, crafted by hand or through &e&lMixing&r if you want better efficiency."
		""
		"Once crafted, this versatile alloy becomes the core material for components like &b&lShafts&r, &b&lCogwheels&r, and other &l&7andesite based parts&r that keep your machines running."
		""
		"Every great contraption starts with this humble but powerful alloy, so stock up and let the machinery begin."
	]
	quest.4DBEF977ECB08191.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft or mix &b&lAndesite Alloy&r&f&l"
	quest.4DBEF977ECB08191.title: "&9&lQuest: Andesite Alloy"
	quest.4E0D6597B0B81E49.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You now seek the darkest forms of magic, tied to life force and undeath.&r The &4&lNecronomicon&r is a terrifying Unique Spell Book, usually found only after defeating a powerful Necromancer or raiding a corrupted Catacomb&r.&r"
		""
		"When equipped, it grants +200 Max Mana and automatically inscribes three strong Blood spells and one Fire spell: Blood Slash 5, Blood Step 5, Ray of Siphoning 5, and Blaze Storm 5.&r It also gives +2 levels to the Raise Dead spell and is ready to cast with VJ, letting you wield true necromantic power through this forbidden tome&r.&r"
	]
	quest.4E0D6597B0B81E49.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain the dreaded &4&lNecronomicon&r&l&f, the unique book of Blood Magic&r"
	quest.4E0D6597B0B81E49.title: "&5&lQuest: Sealing the Necronomicon Tome"
	quest.4E16FD61821ACCC8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The most volatile and powerful ore in the Arcanus world is &6&lStella Arcanum&r, an extremely rare block that yields the crucial &b&lStellarite Piece&r when mined correctly&r.&r"
		""
		"Venture into the deep strata from Y‑44 up to Y‑42 to locate it, but be cautious—this ore is known to be &c&lvery dangerous&r when broken&r.&r Mine it from a safe distance, avoid harm, and claim this &a&lultimate crafting component&r for your rituals&r.&r"
	]
	quest.4E16FD61821ACCC8.quest_subtitle: "&l&fFind the incredibly rare &6&lStella Arcanum Ore&r&l&f between Y‑layers −44 and 42&r"
	quest.4E16FD61821ACCC8.title: "&5&lQuest: The Starlight's Heart"
	quest.4E5FEE08C6BDF110.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The mystical &2&lEdelwood&r is a rare material needed for many rituals.&r Search dense Dark Forest biomes for its source: a hollow log up to four blocks tall with a carved face always visible at the top&r.&r"
		""
		"If you prefer to grow it yourself, right‑click an Oak Sapling or a Dead Bush with a &8&lDark Soul&r to create a Growing Edelwood that will mature into a full tree.&r Once you have the logs, remember that smelting them yields &8&lDark Matter&r, and oily logs can be tapped with a Glass Bottle for oil, making Edelwood a very flexible tool for your arcane studies&r.&r"
	]
	quest.4E5FEE08C6BDF110.quest_subtitle: "&l&fFind an &2&lEdelwood Tree&r&l&f naturally generating in a Dark Forest biome&r"
	quest.4E5FEE08C6BDF110.title: "&5&lQuest: Locating the Edelwood"
	quest.4F18C4C6F9AE801E.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have proven your strength against the &b&lValkyrie Queen&r&f and claimed her treasures. Among them rests the &c&lRegeneration Stone&r&f, a relic of immense healing power. Take it and keep it close, for you will need its blessing… the &6&lGold Dungeon&r&f is waiting for you."
	]
	quest.4F18C4C6F9AE801E.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain a &c&lRegeneration Stone&r&f&l from the &7&lSilver Dungeon&r&f&l"
	quest.4F18C4C6F9AE801E.title: "&7&lQuest: The Final Challenge Awaits"
	quest.4F6AEAC672B31477.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You already wield a &6&lCloggrum Battleaxe&r&f, but the Undergarden still hides stronger materials. Combine the axe with a rare &2&lForgotten Ingot&r&f on a smithing table and you can push it to truly legendary status."
		""
		"Track down the ingot, often taken from the Forgotten themselves, and complete the upgrade. The reforged weapon will strike harder and last longer, which is exactly what you want when the deepest threats are staring back at you."
	]
	quest.4F6AEAC672B31477.quest_subtitle: "&f&lUpgrade your &6&lCloggrum Battleaxe&r&f&l using a &2&lForgotten Ingot&r&f&l"
	quest.4F6AEAC672B31477.title: "&7&lQuest: Forging the Forgotten Axe"
	quest.500A65626D35D535.quest_desc: [
		"Knowledge is the foundation of all &5Soul Magic&r. The &dEncyclopedia Arcana&r serves as your guide through the mysterious arts of &dMalum&r."
		"Within its pages lie the secrets of &5Spirit Infusion&r, &5Soulstones&r, and &dancient rituals&r long forgotten."
		""
		"To craft it, combine precious &dArcane Ingredients&r infused with soul energy — the first step toward mastering forbidden knowledge."
		"With the &dEncyclopedia Arcana&r in hand, you can finally begin to understand the true essence of magic… and the cost it demands. 💀"
	]
	quest.500A65626D35D535.quest_subtitle: "&7Craft the &dEncyclopedia Arcana&f."
	quest.500A65626D35D535.title: "&5&lQuest: &r&dThe Encyclopedia Arcana 📖✨"
	quest.500E1D89F5621220.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fSay goodbye to silent, lifeless villagers. &6&lMinecraft Comes Alive (MCA) Reborn&r&f transforms your world into a thriving community full of personality and emotion!"
		""
		"&fYou can now &a&linteract, befriend, marry, and even raise children&r&f, each with unique genetics and traits."
		""
		"&fForm meaningful connections, build families, and watch your village truly come alive. Your story in Minecraft is no longer just about survival, it's about life, legacy, and love."
	]
	quest.500E1D89F5621220.quest_subtitle: "&f&lBegin your new life among the villagers in &6&lMinecraft Comes Alive Reborn&r"
	quest.500E1D89F5621220.title: "&a&lWelcome to Minecraft Comes Alive Reborn!"
	quest.50B51E749A0F6BB4.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lEngineer's Wire Cutters&r are an essential tool in &b&lImmersive Engineering&r, designed for &e&lmanaging your power network&f with precision. They allow you to disconnect wires, craft wires, and create &e&lMetal Press Molds&r."
		""
		"Using the Wire Cutters while looking at empty air removes a single wire at a time, while using them on a &b&lWire Connector&r or &b&lWire Relay&r disconnects all attached wires instantly. Perfect for reorganizing your energy network or fixing mistakes, this tool ensures your electrical setups stay tidy and efficient."
	]
	quest.50B51E749A0F6BB4.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft &b&lEngineer's Wire Cutters&r"
	quest.50B51E749A0F6BB4.title: "&9&lQuest: Engineer’s Wire Cutters"
	quest.5178BC7860D76F2C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"To control mob movement, you need a tool that can capture entities in mid‑motion.&r The &b&lQuantum Catcher&r is that tool, a powerful device that relies on a rare material taken from a destroyed spawner&r.&r"
		""
		"First, acquire &a&lSpawner Scrap&r by breaking a Spawner.&r Then place this scrap on a Smithing Table together with an &b&lArcane Crystal Block&r; this final combination creates the &b&lQuantum Catcher&r, giving you the ability to safely relocate and manage entities&r.&r"
	]
	quest.5178BC7860D76F2C.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain &a&lSpawner Scrap&r&l&f and combine it to create a &b&lQuantum Catcher&r"
	quest.5178BC7860D76F2C.title: "&5&lQuest: The Quantum Catcher"
	quest.5208FA072371EEBC.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&e&lFluid Pipes&r are a core component of &b&lImmersive Engineering&r for transporting liquids throughout your factory. They automatically pull liquids from an output side and push them into an input side, streamlining fluid management between machines and storage tanks."
		""
		"Right click a &e&lFluid Pipe&r with an &b&lEngineer's Hammer&r at the connecting spot to enable or disable connections as needed. For convenience or aesthetics, &ee&lFluid Pipes&r can be covered with &b&lTreated Wood Scaffolding&r or &e&lSteel Scaffolding&r, which can also be used to climb them."
		""
		"While &ee&lFluid Pipes&r move liquids slowly on their own, connecting them to a &b&lFluid Pump&r can speed up fluid transport, consuming some &e&lRedstone Flux (RF)&r in the process. Together with &e&lFluid Pipes&r and proper piping networks, your factory gains full control over liquid distribution."
	]
	quest.5208FA072371EEBC.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &e&lFluid Pipe&r"
	quest.5208FA072371EEBC.title: "&9&lQuest: Fluid Pipe"
	quest.5220D825801DB85C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"To start with &b&lApplied Energistics&r, you will first need a &b&lMeteorite&r. Meteorites are fairly common and often leave massive craters, but if you have not found one, craft a &b&lMeteorite Compass&r to locate the nearest mysterious cube."
		""
		"Inside the meteorite, you will find:"
		""
		"- &b&lCertus Quartz Clusters&r and buds"
		""
		"- &b&lBudding Certus Blocks&r of various tiers"
		""
		"- &b&lA Mysterious Cube&r in the center"
		""
		"Mine the certus quartz clusters and any certus quartz blocks you find. Be careful with budding certus blocks; without &b&lSilk Touch&r, they degrade by one tier. Never break a &b&lFlawless Budding Certus&r, even with &b&lSilk Touch&r, it will degrade to &b&lFlawed Budding Certus&r and cannot be repaired."
		""
		"Finally, mine the &b&lMysterious Cube&r to obtain all 4 &b&lInscriber Presses&r, essential for crafting your first &b&lME&r components."
	]
	quest.5220D825801DB85C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lGather the initial resources from a meteorite&r"
	quest.5220D825801DB85C.title: "&9&lQuest: Getting the Initial Materials"
	quest.524528B2ADEE5358.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fHigh above the frozen peaks, where the air turns sharp and the snow never melts, lie the &b&lFrozen Nests&r&f, ancient resting places built from &f&lStraw Frozen&r&f."
		""
		"&fThese majestic structures often appear in &b&lSnowy Mountain biomes&r&f and may contain hidden &b&lSuspicious Ice blocks&r&f concealing valuable relics. Search them carefully. Within their icy layers, you might uncover rare treasures such as the &a&lFell Pottery Fragment&r&f or the &b&lSoarer Egg&r&f."
		""
		"&fOnly the bravest explorers can withstand the cold long enough to find them."
	]
	quest.524528B2ADEE5358.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind structure - &b&lFrozen Nests&r"
	quest.524528B2ADEE5358.title: "&6&lQuest: The Frozen Nests"
	quest.5270CF5895352FEE.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The chaos of the &4&lRot&r&f shrinks away from focused, purifying light. By combining a &e&lGlimmering Tooth&r&f, likely pried from a Rotspawn itself, with a Dimlight Torch, you can forge a &d&lShard Torch&r&f."
		""
		"This special light source does more than chase back the darkness; it actively burns any blighted creatures that draw too close. Place these torches wisely to carve out safe zones and hold back the creeping infection."
	]
	quest.5270CF5895352FEE.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &d&lShard Torch&r&f&l, a beacon that damages nearby &4&lRotspawn&r&f&l"
	quest.5270CF5895352FEE.title: "&7&lQuest: The Light of Purity"
	quest.5276087D26616422.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fIn the dry &6&lBadlands&r&f, the &6&lTerracotta Golem&r&f stands as a hardened guardian of the sand. With &c&l20 HP&r&f and a base &c&l8 attack&r&f, this golem's power can be upgraded depending on what you offer it."
		""
		"&fRight-click with a &a&lDead Bush&r&f to grant it a ranged attack, or use a &a&lCactus&r&f to increase its melee strength to &c&l6 Damage&r&f. Repair it with &8&lClay&r&f, and when destroyed, it drops &6&l9-2 Terracotta blocks&r&f."
		""
		"&fYou can also summon one by placing a &6&lTerracotta Golem Statue&r&f next to a heat source, such as lava or fire."
		""
		"&fWhether formed from clay or born of the desert's heat, the &6&lTerracotta Golem&r&f is a fierce protector, adaptable, durable, and always ready for battle."
	]
	quest.5276087D26616422.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate or summon a &6&lTerracotta Golem&r&f&l and enhance its combat abilities&r"
	quest.5276087D26616422.title: "&6&lQuest: The Desert Defender - Terracotta Golem"
	quest.52A29986D0525D86.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your path through the Pyramid Outpost leads you to the &c&lWadjet&r, a skeletal serpent that strikes with an ancient spear and &b&ldesert magic&r. Stay alert; this thing does not believe in fair fights."
		""
		"This serpent has dangerous attacks, especially the power to pull &e&lsandstone blocks&r from the ground and hurl them at you. Defeat the &c&lWadjet&r to claim an &a&lAncient Metal Ingot&r, a key material for crafting new gear. Face this magical foe and enjoy your &a&lreward&r."
	]
	quest.52A29986D0525D86.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSlay a &c&lWadjet&f, the skeletal serpent mage of the desert"
	quest.52A29986D0525D86.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Wadjet"
	quest.542C6545584AAA28.quest_desc: [
		""
		"A true arcane master draws power from the oldest beings.&r The &5&lDragonskin Spell Book&r is a legendary tome that greatly strengthens your dimensional abilities, said to be crafted from the hide of a mighty Ender creature or found in rare End City chests&r.&r"
		""
		"Equipping this book as your spellbook grants a big bonus to Ender spell power and a large increase to maximum mana.&r Track down this artifact to command the void and wield the magic of the End itself&r.&r"
	]
	quest.542C6545584AAA28.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain a &5&lDragonskin Spell Book&r&l&f&r"
	quest.542C6545584AAA28.title: "&5&lQuest: The Dragonskin Tome"
	quest.546E169385495F44.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lFrosted Prison&r&f is a massive frozen fortress that generates in &b&lsnowy biomes&r&f and acts as a major dungeon.&r This icy stronghold is guarded by an entire battalion of &7&lDraugr&r&f enemies armed with powerful &8&lBlack Steel&r&f weapons.&r"
		""
		"To reach this imposing structure, you must first craft and use the &3&lEye of Curse&r&f.&r Once inside, you will have to fight your way through the prison, facing the massive axe‑wielding &7&lAptrgangr&r&f mini‑bosses, all the way down to the lowest level where the formidable &3&lMaledictus&r&f boss awaits.&r"
	]
	quest.546E169385495F44.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind the &b&lFrosted Prison&r&f&l structure in a snowy biome using the &3&lEye of Curse&r&f&l&r"
	quest.546E169385495F44.title: "&4&lQuest: Locating the Frosted Prison"
	quest.54DB63999B7CBF47.quest_desc: [
		""
		"To find the elusive &5&lRuined Citadel&r structure hidden deep in the outer End islands, you must craft the &d&lEye of Void&r. This specialized item acts as a magical compass, guiding you directly to the home of the &5&lEnder Guardian&r boss."
		""
		"Craft this Eye and prepare for a long journey through the &d&lEnd dimension&r, as the Citadel is located far from the main island. Securing this item is the key to unlocking the &c&lfinal challenges&r of the mod!"
	]
	quest.54DB63999B7CBF47.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft the &d&lEye of Void&r&l &fto locate the &5&lRuined Citadel&r&l"
	quest.54DB63999B7CBF47.title: "&4&lQuest: Forging the Eye of Void"
	quest.5536996DAC9BD658.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lSpout&r is a &b&lCreate&r component used to &e&lfill liquid containers&r and handle &e&lcrafting with fluids&r. When supplied with &e&lfluid input&r from a tank or pipe, it automatically dispenses liquids into bottles, buckets, or items placed below it."
		""
		"This makes it a key piece in &b&lautomated processing lines&r, perfect for brewing &e&lpotions&r, filling containers, or running &e&lfluid based recipes&r in your factory. It also works with &b&lBasins&r and &b&lDeployer&r setups for more advanced crafting automation."
		""
		"Place the Spout above your target block or item, feed it &e&lrotational power&r and fluid, and let it handle the filling for you. Use &a&lJEI&r to check the crafting recipe and gather all the components you need to build it."
	]
	quest.5536996DAC9BD658.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lSpout&r"
	quest.5536996DAC9BD658.title: "&9&lQuest: Spout"
	quest.55496640D14D8E30.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &a&lConstructor&r&f is a versatile automation tool in &b&lRefined Storage&r&f.&r"
		""
		"&fIt lets your network &a&lplace resources&r&f directly into the world, perfect for farming setups, block placement automation, or item output systems.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lHow It Works&r"
		""
		"&fPlace the Constructor facing the direction you want items or blocks to be placed.&r"
		"&fOnce connected to your &b&lController&r&f with &b&lCables&r&f, it can access any item stored in your network and place it automatically.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lConfiguration&r"
		""
		"&fOpen the Constructor’s interface and insert the item or block you want it to place.&r"
		""
		"&fYou can use &a&lSpeed Upgrades&r&f and &a&lStack Upgrades&r&f to increase its placement rate or handle multiple items more efficiently.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lAutomation Example&r"
		""
		"&fUse a Constructor to place saplings on dirt while an &a&lImporter&r&f collects logs and drops, creating a fully automated tree farm.&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip&r"
		""
		"&fPair Constructors with &b&lRedstone control&r&f or &a&lRegulator Upgrades&r&f to manage when blocks are placed and how many are used.&r"
	]
	quest.55496640D14D8E30.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft a &a&lConstructor&r&f &land connect it to your storage network to automatically place items or blocks&r"
	quest.55496640D14D8E30.title: "&9&lQuest: Crafting the Constructor"
	quest.5553351DB5407A9E.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lGatekeeper&r&f will grant you the &e&lOrb of Prophecy&r&f, a powerful relic you need to move forward. Once the orb is in your hand, return to the &e&lPortal Ruins&r&f and carefully clear away every &2&lportal vine&r&f blocking the inner frame of the ancient gateway."
		""
		"When the frame is clean, right-click the portal’s base with the orb. The &b&lstarlight energy&r&f will surge through the structure, lighting the gateway and opening the path to the next important stop in the cosmos."
	]
	quest.5553351DB5407A9E.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSpeak with the &b&lGatekeeper&r&f&l to obtain the &e&lOrb of Prophecy&r&f&l, clear the portal vines, and activate the gateway"
	quest.5553351DB5407A9E.title: "&7&lQuest: Prophecy of the Starlight"
	quest.559836D2100510C0.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lMechanical Saw&r is a &b&lCreate&r component powered by &e&lrotational force&r, built for automated &e&lchopping&r and &e&lstonecutting&r. When placed facing sideways, it will automatically &e&lchop down trees&r and cut blocks in front of it; once the bottom log is gone, the &e&lentire tree&r, leaves and all, falls in one go."
		""
		"It efficiently breaks:"
		""
		"- &f&lLogs, Stripped Logs, Wood, Stripped Wood&r"
		""
		"- &f&lLeaves&r"
		""
		"- &f&lMushroom Stems and Wart Blocks&r"
		""
		"- &f&lCactus and Mangrove Roots&r"
		""
		"&e&l2x2 trees&r can also be cleared completely with a &e&l“2x2 bypass”&r setup, simply by removing the block above the saw’s cutting target."
		""
		"When facing upward, the &b&lMechanical Saw&r performs &e&lsawing and stonecutting recipes&r, turning:"
		""
		"- &f&lWood → Stripped Wood → Planks&r"
		""
		"- &f&lAndesite Alloy → Shafts&r"
		""
		"- &f&lStone materials → Stonecutter outputs&r"
		""
		"Attach it to a &b&lCreate Contraption&r to make it portable; it will power itself and &e&ldamage entities&r and &e&lbreak blocks&r depending on speed. Use &a&lJEI&r to view the crafting recipe and all required materials."
	]
	quest.559836D2100510C0.quest_subtitle: " &f&lCraft a &b&lMechanical Saw&r"
	quest.559836D2100510C0.title: "&9&lQuest: Mechanical Saw"
	quest.55A58CBF8BBD0196.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lMechanical Harvester&r is a vital &b&lCreate&r component built to &e&lautomate crop collection&r. When attached to a moving &b&lContraption&r, it harvests fully grown crops, breaks them, and grabs the drops instantly as it passes over farmland."
		""
		"This makes it perfect for building &e&llarge scale farms&r and automated harvesting machines powered by rotational energy. Combine it with &b&lMechanical Bearings&r, &b&lLinear Chassis&r, and &b&lDeployers&r to create efficient rotating or moving farm layouts."
		""
		"It works with most standard crops and can be used in &e&lloping contraptions&r that replant and collect your produce for you. Use &a&lJEI&r to check the crafting recipe and gather every component needed to assemble it."
	]
	quest.55A58CBF8BBD0196.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lMechanical Harvester&r"
	quest.55A58CBF8BBD0196.title: "&9&lQuest: Mechanical Harvester"
	quest.55DE6ACD8F90AA6C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fWith the power of the &8&lEater's Tooth&r&f in your hands, you can now recreate one of the most legendary weapons of ancient times, the &6&lAncient Mace&r&f."
		""
		"&fCombine the &8&lEater's Tooth&r&f with &f&lWooden Planks&r&f and a &f&lStick&r&f to forge this lost weapon once wielded by forgotten civilizations. It strikes with the &c&ldamage of an Iron Axe&r&f, yet swings with the &a&lspeed of a Sword&r&f, a perfect balance of power and precision."
		""
		"&fHold it proudly, for you now carry a weapon shaped by the past itself."
	]
	quest.55DE6ACD8F90AA6C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft an &6&lAncient Mace&r&f&l using an &8&lEater's Tooth&r"
	quest.55DE6ACD8F90AA6C.title: "&6&lQuest: Forging the Ancient Mace"
	quest.566B0D0AEDB40D37.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &c&lNaga&r&f is the first major boss you will face in the &2&lTwilight Forest&r&f. This huge serpent tears through any &a&lleaves&r&f in its way as it lunges toward you, turning the courtyard into a mess of broken greenery."
		""
		"A solid strategy is to wait for it to charge or lash out, then block the attack with your &7&lshield&r&f. This stuns the Naga for a moment, giving you a clear opening to move to the side and strike. Once it goes down, the Naga drops its loot in the center of the arena, which you can use to craft and equip the &6&lNaga Armor&r&f."
	]
	quest.566B0D0AEDB40D37.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the powerful &c&lNaga&r&f&l boss in its Courtyard"
	quest.566B0D0AEDB40D37.title: "&7&lQuest: Slaying the Naga Serpent"
	quest.56AB773A83EC7F18.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fMaledictus is the final boss of the &b&lFrosted Prison&r&f dungeon, boasting high mobility and complex multi‑phase combat mechanics.&r He is summoned by right‑clicking the &8&lCursed Tombstone&r&f located in the chamber at the dungeon’s lowest level.&r"
		""
		"Before the fight, you must defeat an &7&lAptrgangr&r&f to obtain the &d&lStrange Key&r&f needed to unlock the boss chamber.&r Come prepared; once you step inside, there is no easy escape.&r"
		""
		"&f&lKey Mechanics&r&f&r"
		""
		"- &f&lRage Meter&r&f: His damage increases as his &c&lRage Meter&r&f fills with each successful hit he lands on you.&r If he fails to keep hitting, the rage slowly decays, giving you short breathing windows.&r"
		""
		"- &f&lWeapon Phases&r&f: He cycles between three distinct weapon phases during the fight.&r"
		""
		"- &f&lPhantom Maces&r&f: Used for close‑range combat, including the brutal &c&lRupturing Descent&r&f slam attack.&r"
		""
		"- &f&lPhantom Halberd&r&f: Focused on mobility and reach, featuring powerful lunges like &c&lWarrior’s Lunge&r&f and summoning spectral halberds with &c&lThousand Pierced Fall&r&f.&r"
		""
		"- &f&lPhantom Bow&r&f: Used at range to fire four &c&lhoming arrows&r&f that deal heavy damage if not dodged.&r"
		""
		"- &f&lAttack Indicators&r&f: Watch his colored wrist rings carefully.&r &a&lGreen&r&f means the attack is blockable, &6&lOrange&r&f means it will break your shield, and &c&lRed&r&f means you must dodge or suffer the full hit.&r"
		""
		"When defeated, &3&lMaledictus&r&f drops &d&l3–4 Cursium Ingots&r&f, the material required to craft the high‑end &d&lCursium Armor&r&f set, along with a chance at his rare &d&lmusic disc&r&f.&r The &8&lCursed Tombstone&r&f then goes on cooldown, but he can be summoned again later for farming.&r"
	]
	quest.56AB773A83EC7F18.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat &3&lMaledictus&r&f&l, the relentless phantom general of the &b&lFrosted Prison&r&f&l&r"
	quest.56AB773A83EC7F18.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Maledictus"
	quest.56B70EDBFD09FE71.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lDeployer&r is a versatile &b&lCreate&r component that &e&lsimulates player interactions&r with blocks or entities exactly &e&l2 blocks ahead&r of its face. When powered by &e&lrotational energy&r, it can place, use, or interact with items from its internal inventory just like a real player."
		""
		"It is essential for &b&lautomation setups&r such as &e&litem placement&r, right click actions, harvesting, crafting, and complex block interaction systems. Attach a &b&lHand, Tool, or Item&r to the Deployer to define its job; for example, giving it a pickaxe lets it mine, while a hoe turns it into a crop harvester."
		""
		"Combine it with &b&lMechanical Pistons&r, &b&lSequenced Gearshifts&r, and &b&lConveyor Belts&r to build fully automated production lines and factories. Use &a&lJEI&r to check the crafting recipe and gather all the parts you need for your first Deployer."
	]
	quest.56B70EDBFD09FE71.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lDeployer&r"
	quest.56B70EDBFD09FE71.title: "&9&lQuest: Deployer"
	quest.570D2EC45411C87C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fTo begin your adventure among the clouds, you will first need to open the gateway to the &b&lAether&r&f, a realm high above the Overworld."
		""
		"&fUnlike a Nether Portal, this one glows with heavenly energy and hums with the sound of wind through clouds."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lHow to Build the Portal"
		""
		"&fYou will need:"
		""
		"&f&e&lGlowstone Blocks&r&f - at least 10, to form a rectangular frame (just like a Nether Portal)."
		""
		"&f&b&lWater Bucket&r&f - this will serve as your “flint and steel” for activation."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lStep-by-Step"
		""
		"&fBuild a vertical frame of &e&lGlowstone&r&f, 4 blocks tall and 5 blocks wide."
		""
		"&fFill the inside with a &b&lwater source&r&f by right-clicking the center with your bucket."
		""
		"&fWatch as the portal activates, shimmering with sky-blue energy."
		""
		"&fNow step inside and let the clouds carry you away to your new home in the skies."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lA New Beginning"
		""
		"&fAs you emerge in the &b&lAether&r&f, you will find yourself surrounded by floating islands of &b&lSkyroot&r&f and &7&lHolystone&r&f."
		""
		"&fFrom this point forward, your survival depends on your courage and curiosity, the &d&lHostile Paradise&r&f awaits."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip"
		""
		"&fBring plenty of building blocks and food before entering, resources are different in the &b&lAether&r&f, and falling means an express trip back to the Overworld."
	]
	quest.570D2EC45411C87C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lConstruct and activate a &e&lGlowstone Portal&r&f&l to enter the &b&lAether&r&f&l dimension"
	quest.570D2EC45411C87C.title: "&7&lQuest: Entering the Aether"
	quest.57159FE15CAA8B6B.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lIronbound Tome&r is the core spellbook for all magical progress in Iron Spells ’n Spellbooks.&r This sturdy, metal‑bound volume lets you start your spellcasting journey, storing and channeling your first arcane powers&r.&r"
		""
		"Look for it in dungeon loot and magic towers, or craft one yourself if you have the right materials.&r Once you secure the Ironbound Tome, you officially take your first step from curious adventurer to true spellcaster&r.&r"
	]
	quest.57159FE15CAA8B6B.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain the &b&lIronbound Tome&r&l&f from the Iron Spells ’n Spellbooks mod&r"
	quest.57159FE15CAA8B6B.title: "&5&lQuest: The Ironbound Tome"
	quest.5727294DDF7179BF.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Even in endless darkness, life still finds a way. The &6&lGloomgourd&r&f is a key source of light and material in the Undergarden, so track down one of its seeds and plant it."
		""
		"Care for this strange fungal crop and let it grow into a steady supply of gourds. With a good patch of Gloomgourds, you gain a renewable resource for both torches and food."
	]
	quest.5727294DDF7179BF.quest_subtitle: "&f&lPlant a &6&lGloomgourd seed&r&f&l"
	quest.5727294DDF7179BF.title: "&7&lQuest: Purple Pumpkins"
	quest.57296986656223ED.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The most common, yet deceptively dangerous, threat in the Undergarden is the &4&lRotspawn&r&f, creatures twisted by chaotic corruption. The smallest of them, the &4&lRotling&r&f, is fragile alone but lethal in swarms."
		""
		"Secure the area by hunting down this lesser foe before its numbers grow. Cull the Rotlings and halt the spread of rot before it turns the depths into a true infestation."
	]
	quest.57296986656223ED.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSlay the weakest of the &4&lRotspawn&r&f&l, the &4&lRotling&r&f&l."
	quest.57296986656223ED.title: "&7&lQuest: Culling the Rotling Threat"
	quest.590F59EC9852717A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fManaging all your colony's resources by hand can be tiring. That's where the &6&lWarehouse&r&f and the &b&lCourier's Hut&r&f come in!"
		""
		"&fThe &6&lWarehouse&r&f serves as a central storage location for all materials, while &b&lCouriers&r&f automatically transport items between the Warehouse and your citizens' workplaces, from the &a&lForester&r&f and &b&lFisher&r&f to the &8&lMiner&r&f and &6&lBuilder&r&f."
		""
		"&fYou can also use the &a&lResource Scroll&r&f to easily track and manage your supplies. With this system in place, your colony will run smoother than ever before."
	]
	quest.590F59EC9852717A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lPlace and build a &6&lWarehouse&r&f&l and a &b&lCourier's Hut&r"
	quest.590F59EC9852717A.title: "&6&lStep 8: Warehouse and Courier"
	quest.593669D92778EC84.quest_desc: [
		""
		"To find the elusive &7&lAncient Factory&r dungeon in the Overworld, you must craft the specialized &6&lEye of Mech&r. This item works like an Eye of Ender but points specifically to the Factory's deep underground location."
		""
		"To craft the &6&lEye of Mech&r, you need to surround an &a&lEye of Ender&r with &c&l4 Redstone Blocks&r and &f&l4 Iron Ingots&r."
		""
		"Remember to use the Eye in the Overworld, and when it floats straight upward, you are directly above the Factory. Secure this key to access the dungeon and challenge the &8&lHarbinger&r boss!"
	]
	quest.593669D92778EC84.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft the &6&lEye of Mech&r&l&f to locate the &7&lAncient Factory&r&l&f dungeon"
	quest.593669D92778EC84.title: "&4&lQuest: Forging the Eye of Mech"
	quest.59381EC67C8FA903.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &5&lNight Lich&r&f is the first major boss of this mod, dwelling in rare &5&lLich Towers&r&f that spawn in &b&lcold biomes&r&f.&r You can track down these towers by following the &e&lSoul Stars&r&f dropped by &c&lUndead mobs&r&f you have already hunted.&r"
		""
		"The Lich fights with several dangerous attacks.&r It can hurl a massive &c&lmagic orb&r&f, fire a piercing &c&llaser beam&r&f for steady damage, and summon &3&lPhantoms&r&f to swarm you from above.&r Bring your best gear, because defeating this powerful foe will reward you with a large amount of &a&lexperience&r&f and mark your first real victory against the mod’s bosses.&r"
	]
	quest.59381EC67C8FA903.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the &5&lNight Lich&r&f&l boss found in its rare &5&lLich Towers"
	quest.59381EC67C8FA903.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Night Lich"
	quest.595CB0351BC8F9A8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &6&lTown Hall&r&f is the heart of your colony. It's what officially creates it and serves as its center."
		""
		"&fUse the &6&lBuild Tool&r&f to position your Town Hall carefully. This tool lets you preview the structure before placing it, ensuring it's facing the right direction and at the correct Y level. Some buildings may need to be raised or lowered, so plan wisely!"
		""
		"&fOnce your &6&lTown Hall&r&f block is placed, your colony will come to life as your first &a&l4 citizens&r&f arrive to begin their new lives under your leadership."
	]
	quest.595CB0351BC8F9A8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lPlace and build your &6&lTown Hall&r"
	quest.595CB0351BC8F9A8.title: "&6&lStep 2: Town Hall"
	quest.598E03A239BAFBF8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&b&lThe Guide&r is your in game reference for &b&lApplied Energistics&r, helping you navigate all of the mod's features and mechanics. Access the sidebar on the left to find a &b&ltable of contents&r, making it easy to locate and topic."
		""
		"Many pages feature &e&linteractive scenes&r:"
		""
		"- Use the Plus and Minus buttons to zoom"
		""
		"- Left click and drag to rotate the camera"
		""
		"- Right click and drag to translate the view"
		""
		"To craft &b&lThe Guide&r, place a &b&lBook&r into a &b&lCharger&r to imbue it with the essential knowledge of &b&lAE2&r. It is the perfect companion for mastering storage networks, automation, and crafting systems."
	]
	quest.598E03A239BAFBF8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft &b&lThe Guide&r"
	quest.598E03A239BAFBF8.title: "&9&lQuest: The Guide"
	quest.59EFE8322A1818AD.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &8&lNecromancer&r is a hostile magic‑mob aligned with the Blood and Undead theme, usually found in dark dungeons and specific sinister structures.&r This foe relies on powerful death magic to raise skeletons or zombies and swarm you under waves of minions&r.&r"
		""
		"Expect a difficult encounter where the Necromancer hurls spell‑waves of necromantic energy that can debuff or curse you while more undead join the fight.&r Taking down this minion‑master is important for progression, as they often drop rare loot for the undead or blood‑magic path&r.&r"
		""
		"Their spoils can include scrolls and components used to craft dark gear, so coming prepared with holy or cleansing magic pays off handsomely.&r Survive the onslaught, break their control over the dead, and claim their twisted treasures for yourself&r.&r"
	]
	quest.59EFE8322A1818AD.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSlay the &8&lNecromancer&r&l&f, the dark mage who commands the undead&r"
	quest.59EFE8322A1818AD.title: "&5&lQuest: Slaying the Necromancer"
	quest.5A4F61E543ABA22B.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lLV Wire Coil&r is an essential part of &b&lImmersive Engineering&r's power transfer network. It connects &b&lWire Connectors&r and &b&lWire Relays&r, allowing the transfer of &e&lenergy&r in the form of &b&lImmersive Flux (IF)&r, fully compatible with &e&lRedstone Flux (RF)&r systems."
		""
		"When powered, &e&lLV Wire Coils&r can &e&ldamage mobs&r that make contact with them. If you need safer cabling, you can craft &b&lInsulated LV Wire Coils&r, which eliminate the risk of accidental shocks while maintaining the same power rating."
		""
		"Originally known as the &b&lCopper Wire Coil&r before version 0.8, this cable remains the backbone of early game energy distribution in Immersive Engineering."
	]
	quest.5A4F61E543ABA22B.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft an &e&lLV Wire Coil&r"
	quest.5A4F61E543ABA22B.title: "&9&lQuest: LV Wire Coil"
	quest.5AC371419D6D8DB9.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &c&lRespawn Totem&r&f is a sacred artifact built from the remains of the &c&lSacred Pontiff&r&f. &a&lUse the Old Cloth and Relic Gold&r&f dropped by the fallen boss to forge this powerful relic."
		""
		"&fIt can revive nearby tamed allies a limited number of times, a true blessing in desperate battles."
	]
	quest.5AC371419D6D8DB9.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCreate the &c&lRespawn Totem"
	quest.5AC371419D6D8DB9.title: "&6&lQuest: Craft the Respawn Totem"
	quest.5AEE9F5F2C0C4C17.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lPlacerPlus&r is a versatile automation block that &e&lplaces blocks automatically&r whenever it receives a &b&lRedstone pulse&r. Perfect for building, construction projects, or automated setups, it allows you to control &e&lblock placement&r precisely and efficiently without manual intervention."
		""
		"Combine it with &b&lRedstone circuits&r or other automation machines to create advanced, self building contraptions in your world."
	]
	quest.5AEE9F5F2C0C4C17.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lPlacerPlus&r"
	quest.5AEE9F5F2C0C4C17.title: "&9&lQuest: PlacerPlus"
	quest.5AFAF8167B1CB186.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &d&lGreat Chalice&r&f is a mystical container for Essence, obtained by slaying monsters. &a&lOnce full, it can fill an Empty Grail&r&f to produce a &b&lFilled Grail&r&f, used in rare recipes."
		""
		"&fThis is the foundation of soul crafting and essential for deeper alchemy. &d&lCraft your first Chalice&r&f and harness the essence of life."
	]
	quest.5AFAF8167B1CB186.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft the &d&lGreat Chalice&r&f&l using &7&lCopper Ingots"
	quest.5AFAF8167B1CB186.title: "&6&lQuest: Craft The Great Chalice"
	quest.5AFBB89759C8AF05.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&f&lPage 1 - Overview"
		""
		"&fWith &6&lMCA Reborn&r&f installed, villagers become far more human-like than in vanilla Minecraft. They now have &e&lGenders, Personalities, Traits, Genetics,&r&f and &e&lFamily Trees&r&f."
		""
		"&fOver time, you can &a&lbuild relationships, form families, and truly live among them&r&f."
		""
		"&fVillagers still retain their core behaviors, professions, jobs, and sleeping routines, but now they also &a&lfeel alive, react to your actions, and form emotional connections with you&r&f."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPage 2 - Interactions and UI"
		""
		"&fRight-click a villager to open the &a&linteraction menu&r&f. They'll greet you with a \"Hello!\" and you can choose how to interact, talk, trade, or &a&lflirt&r&f. Each villager's &a&lpersonality and mood&r&f will affect how they respond."
		""
		"&fThe interface shows:"
		""
		"&f&l■ &fName and Profession"
		""
		"&f&l■ &fMood and Personality"
		""
		"&f&l■ &fRelationship Hearts"
		""
		"&f&l■ &fTraits and Family Tree"
		""
		"&f&l■ &fMarital Status and Genetics"
		""
		"&fSome menus like &a&lWork&r&f or &a&lInventory&r&f only appear if the villager is married to you or part of your family."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/ui.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPage 3 - Talking and Building Relationships"
		""
		"&fThe main way to bond with villagers is by &a&ltalking to them!&r&f You can:"
		""
		"&f&l■ &a&lChat&r&f - simple conversation (+1 or +3 heart)"
		""
		"&f&l■ &a&lTell Jokes&r&f - success depends on mood or personality"
		""
		"&f&l■ &a&lTell Stories&r&f - from simple tales to epic adventures"
		""
		"&f&l■ &a&lHug, Flirt, or Kiss&r&f - bold actions that depend on your current relationship"
		""
		"&fEach success builds &a&ltrust&r&f, each failure may &c&lhurt it&r&f. Choose wisely, your words shape your bond!"
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/talk.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPage 4 - Interacting Beyond Words"
		""
		"&fYou can &a&lgive gifts&r&f to villagers, homes or work areas, and even tell them to follow you during adventures!"
		""
		"&fMarried villagers (or children you raise) can &a&lwork for you&r&f, farming, fishing, or chopping wood."
		""
		"&fThey'll also &a&lreact to the world&r&f around them, sleep, relax, and even ride horses if allowed. Your interactions define their &a&lloyalty and happiness&r&f."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/work.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPage 5 - Family and Growth"
		""
		"&fWhen you marry a villager, you can eventually have &a&lchildren&r&f. After procreation, a &a&lBaby Item&r&f appears in your inventory. After 20 minutes, it grows into a &a&lChild&r&f."
		""
		"&fChildren pass through stages: &a&lBaby → Toddler → Child → Teen → Adult&r&f, each with unique dialogues, interactions, and personalities."
		""
		"&fFamily trees will &a&lrecord your generations&r&f, showing parents and grandparents over time."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/babies.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPage 6 - Relationships and Villager Bonds"
		""
		"&fVillagers can also &a&lmarry each other!&r&f Give one a &6&lMatchmaker's Ring&r&f, and they'll instantly pair with the nearest villager."
		""
		"&fAfter marriage, gifting one of them a &a&lCake&r&f will cause them to have a child."
		""
		"&fLove, friendship, and family, &6&lMCA Reborn&r&f turns your world into a thriving village. Form bonds, raise generations, and create stories that last for lifetimes."
	]
	quest.5AFBB89759C8AF05.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLearn how the villagers in &6&lMinecraft Comes Alive: Reborn &fwork&r"
	quest.5AFBB89759C8AF05.title: "&6&lQuest: Understanding Villagers - MCA Reborn Basics"
	quest.5B2CE0152C495C0C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You now hold the &d&lCatalyst&r&f, but the real test is breaking through the dimensional barrier itself. Beyond it lies &2&lThe Undergarden&r&f, a chaotic realm haunted by invasive &4&lRotspawn&r&f yet filled with hardy &2&lflora&r&f that thrives in endless gloom."
		""
		"Light the portal frame you have built and step through without looking back. Take a deep breath and dive into this strange subterranean world, your descent, and the danger that comes with it, begins the moment you fall."
	]
	quest.5B2CE0152C495C0C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lIgnite a portal and &2&lEnter the Undergarden&r&f&l, slipping beneath the Overworld’s bedrock"
	quest.5B2CE0152C495C0C.title: "&7&lQuest: Tumble into the Deep"
	quest.5BC2B490AA3582B2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You can place this gruesome &2&lskull&r&f as a decoration to commemorate your victory over the &2&lKobolediator&r&f, giving your base a nice “do not mess with me” vibe.&r Or, if you prefer power over style, you can instead use it as a key ingredient to craft the &2&lSkeletal Reptile Helmet&r&f.&r Claim this symbol of strength to either adorn your lair or upgrade your gear.&r"
	]
	quest.5BC2B490AA3582B2.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain the &2&lKobolador’s Head&r&f&l as a trophy and crafting component"
	quest.5BC2B490AA3582B2.title: "&4&lQuest: Claiming the Kobolador Skull"
	quest.5C0178E774D4C2D6.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fSomewhere in the swamp, &a&lCornelius&r&f waits for a challenger. He's no ordinary gambler—bring him a bee, and upon its demise, he'll pledge loyalty to you."
		""
		"&a&lUse Copper, Nether, or End Coins&r to let him summon mysterious allies in your favor. Who knows? You might even play a game of Jackblack if you're feeling lucky."
	]
	quest.5C0178E774D4C2D6.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate &a&lCornelius&r&f&l, the casino dealer companion"
	quest.5C0178E774D4C2D6.title: "&2&lQuest:\\ Find\\ Cornelius"
	quest.5C1CD8A81BB779FD.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&b&lQuarryPlus&r introduces advanced &e&lmining machinery&r inspired by BuildCraft's quarry, but with exciting upgrades. These miners can be &e&lenchanted&r with enchantments like &b&lFortune&r or &b&lSilk Touch&r, automatically collecting resources efficiently and safely."
		""
		"No need to worry about &9&lwater&r or &c&llava&r in mined chunks: the mod provides machines to &e&lremove all liquids&r. &b&lQuarryPlus&r machines are versatile, supporting multiple energy types including &e&lRF&r, &e&lEU&r, &e&lMJ&r, and &e&lForge Energy&r, making them compatible with almost any power system."
		""
		"Prepare to harness the full power of automated, enchanted mining to gather resources faster than ever."
	]
	quest.5C1CD8A81BB779FD.quest_subtitle: "&f&lExplore the &b&lQuarryPlus&f mod and understand its &e&lcore features&r"
	quest.5C2D4DF6829D744F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &b&lAether&r&f is a vast world floating high above the clouds, filled with wondrous landscapes and mysterious creatures."
		""
		"&fFrom lush skylands to crystalline peaks and glowing groves, each biome tells part of the Aether’s ancient story."
	]
	quest.5C2D4DF6829D744F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover all &b&lAether Biomes&r&f"
	quest.5C2D4DF6829D744F.title: "&7&lQuest: Explorer of the Skies"
	quest.5C5A22B3340DE8C0.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Reviving an enhanced creature starts with building its physical form from scratch.&r After producing Decomposed Leather by “cooking” regular leather, your next objective is to craft any &f&lFull Body&r component for the mob you want to resurrect&r.&r"
		""
		"This stage is vital because the Full Body acts as the base on which the creature will be brought back to life.&r Check the mod’s guidebook or your crafting recipes for the exact body you need, then begin assembling your new Mobstein companion piece by piece&r.&r"
	]
	quest.5C5A22B3340DE8C0.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft any &f&lFull Body&r&l&f component for the resurrection process&r"
	quest.5C5A22B3340DE8C0.title: "&5&lQuest: Assembling the Full Body"
	quest.5D36F2620C04BAD2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &d&lTears&r&f music disc is a rare drop from defeating a Ghast with its own Fireball. &a&lOnce obtained&r&f, play it in a &e&lJukebox&r&f to fill your base with a haunting melody."
		""
		"&fThis disc has a comparator output of 10 and represents the sorrow of the Nether. &d&lClaim the Tears&r&f disc and enjoy its melancholic beauty."
	]
	quest.5D36F2620C04BAD2.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain the &d&lTears&r&f&l music disc and play it in a &e&lJukebox"
	quest.5D36F2620C04BAD2.title: "&6&lQuest: Play \"Tears\" by Anos Roddy"
	quest.5D965F4157EFBFDD.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &c&lUmvuthana Raptor&r is a tougher variant of the Abayuthana, easily recognized by its long talons and its ability to block incoming attacks.&r It leads hunting packs that spawn alongside four other Abayuthana in Savanna biomes&r.&r"
		""
		"Approach with caution, since the Raptor and its pack attack players and animals on sight and will try to circle around you while making clever use of blocking.&r Bringing down the Raptor is crucial because its death causes the entire pack to scatter&r.&r"
		""
		"The Umvuthana Raptor can drop feathers and the &c&lMask of Fury&r, an item that grants bonus strength when worn and can be used together with the Sol Visage to summon additional Raptors as followers.&r Defeating this leader therefore not only secures the savanna but also strengthens your own warband&r.&r"
	]
	quest.5D965F4157EFBFDD.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSlay an &c&lUmvuthana Raptor&r&l&f, the leader of the savanna hunting packs&r"
	quest.5D965F4157EFBFDD.title: "&4&lQuest: Taming the Umvuthana Raptor"
	quest.5E482B847E4C174F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Sometimes your base grows beyond a single location, maybe you've built an outpost, a factory, or a distant mining area. The &b&lTransmitter&r&f, &b&lReceiver&r&f, and &b&lNetwork Card&r&f work together to &a&llink multiple storage networks&r&f wirelessly, letting them share items and data seamlessly."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lTransmitter"
		""
		"The &b&lTransmitter&r&f is placed on the main network and acts as the sending side of the connection. It uses a &b&lNetwork Card&r&f to define which &b&lReceiver&r&f it's linked to. Once linked, it sends all network data through the card instantly, without needing cables."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lReceiver"
		""
		"Place the &b&lReceiver&r&f on the remote network where you want to receive the connection. Once active, it synchronizes item access, autocrafting, and storage visibility from the main network, as if they were physically connected."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lNetwork Card"
		""
		"The &b&lNetwork Card&r&f is the key that links both devices. To set it up, place the &b&lReceiver&r&f first, then right-click the Receiver with the &b&lNetwork Card&r&f to store its location, and finally insert the card into the &b&lTransmitter&r&f. "
		""
		"Once configured, the two networks are connected instantly, even across dimensions if your configuration allows it."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip"
		""
		"This system is perfect for remote mining stations or secondary crafting hubs. Just keep in mind that both sides must have power and &a&lchunk loading&r&f to stay connected."
	]
	quest.5E482B847E4C174F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lNetwork Card&r&f&l, a &b&lTransmitter&r&f&l, and a &b&lReceiver&r&f&l to create a wireless link between two separate &b&lRefined Storage&r&f&l networks"
	quest.5E482B847E4C174F.title: "&9&lQuest: Linking Networks Remotely"
	quest.5ECDE08F06056BFF.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &c&lHarbinger&r is a powerful mechanical boss, a Wither variant found dormant in the center of the &c&lAncient Factory&r. To start the fight, you must place a &e&lNether Star&r into its chest cavity."
		""
		"With almost &a&l400 Health&r, the Harbinger is a tough fight, remaining in the air and attacking with deadly &c&llasers&r and &c&lmissiles&r. You should use &6&lranged weapons&r and &b&lshields&r to block its laser attacks."
		""
		"A key strategy is to use the &b&lEMP blocks&r scattered around the dungeon, which can be charged when not receiving Redstone power. Activating an &b&lEMP&r will stun the Harbinger and deal a small amount of damage."
		""
		"Upon destroying the &c&lHarbinger&r, it drops a &8&lWitherite Block&r, which can be smelted into &8&l9 Witherite Ingots&r. These ingots are used to craft the &8&lMechanical Fusion Anvil&r and new weapons."
	]
	quest.5ECDE08F06056BFF.quest_subtitle: "&l&fDefeat &c&lthe Harbinger&r&l&f, the powerful mechanical Wither boss"
	quest.5ECDE08F06056BFF.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Harbinger"
	quest.5F2DA5323DC77FB7.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your first goal in the &e&lEternal Starlight&r&f is to track down the remains of the ancient &e&lportal&r&f that brought you here. The &e&lPortal Ruins&r&f are a key structure and probably hide a few clues about the magic that keeps this world running."
		""
		"Search the landscape for moss-covered, broken &7&lstone&r&f scattered across the terrain. Finding these ruins is your first real step toward understanding how travel works in the &e&lStarlight Dimension&r&f."
	]
	quest.5F2DA5323DC77FB7.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind the &e&lPortal Ruins&r&f&l within the dimension"
	quest.5F2DA5323DC77FB7.title: "&7&lQuest: Locating the Starlight Ruins"
	quest.60470E5F2CED86EB.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your long-term goal is to build a fully revealed map of the &2&lTwilight Forest&r&f, showing every hidden structure and secret. To kick off that process, you first need a &d&lBlank Magic Map&r&f."
		""
		"This map works as the base parchment that you later combine with your &d&lMagic Map Focus&r&f (crafted from a &7&lRaven Feather&r&f, &a&lTorch Berries&r&f, and &e&lGlowstone&r&f). Secure this blank map so you can start charting the strange new dimension in detail."
	]
	quest.60470E5F2CED86EB.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain a &d&lBlank Magic Map&r&f&l to create your guide to the dimension"
	quest.60470E5F2CED86EB.title: "&7&lQuest: The Blank Magic Map"
	quest.605B26F2C3134F63.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have broken through the ceiling of the Overworld and stumbled into a dark, subterranean realm. This is &2&lThe Undergarden&r&f, a world where hardy &2&lflora&r&f thrives without sunlight and strange creatures call the gloom their home."
		""
		"But this realm is under siege from the invasive &4&lRotspawn&r&f, chaotic monsters that spread corruption wherever they roam. Your first test of survival is simply to endure this hostile land, from here, your journey of discovery into the Deep truly begins."
	]
	quest.605B26F2C3134F63.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &2&lUndergarden Mod&r&f&l and take your first step into the Deep"
	quest.605B26F2C3134F63.title: "&7&lQuest: Welcome to the Undergarden Mod!"
	quest.61F2D8E553136D7F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &b&lSoarer&r&f is a majestic ancient bird, reborn from the &b&lSoarer Egg&r&f you uncovered within the &d&lSuspicious Ice&r&f. To help it grow and gain strength, feed it with the rare &a&lToxlacanth fish&r&f."
		""
		"&fWith time and care, your &b&lSoarer&r&f will spread its great wings, soaring through the skies with grace and power. Treat it kindly, for few have ever earned the trust of a creature so ancient and free."
	]
	quest.61F2D8E553136D7F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lMake a &b&lSoarer Craw&r"
	quest.61F2D8E553136D7F.title: "&6&lQuest: Raising the Soarer"
	quest.6210F7919FD8926A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have gathered the highest‑tier arcane materials.&r The &6&lDeorum Ingot&r is the peak of this mod’s metallurgy, channeling divine power into a solid form and serving as the base for the strongest items available&r.&r"
		""
		"Combine your hardest‑won resources, including potent Arcane Gold and purified &b&lStellarite&r, to forge this rare legendary metal.&r Create the &6&lDeorum Ingot&r and unlock the ability to craft equipment worthy of a deity&r.&r"
	]
	quest.6210F7919FD8926A.quest_subtitle: "&l&fCraft a &6&lDeorum Ingot&r&l&f, the metal of the gods&r"
	quest.6210F7919FD8926A.title: "&5&lQuest: Forging the Deorum Ingot"
	quest.6301DB5F0FD6A99D.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fIn &6&lGolem Overhaul&r&f, each golem has a unique construction recipe and material. Thanks to &a&lJust Enough Items (JEI)&r&f, you can check the crafting and building structures anytime."
		""
		"&fSimply open &a&lJEI&r&f, search for \"Golem Core\" or the golem's name, and discover the materials required to bring your mechanical guardians to life!"
	]
	quest.6301DB5F0FD6A99D.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLearn how to build the new golems using the &a&lJEI Mod&r"
	quest.6301DB5F0FD6A99D.title: "&6&lQuest: The Art of Golem Creation"
	quest.63EF3547C612793D.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Deep in the Catacombs stalks the &7&lForgotten Guardian&r&f, a massive ancient sentinel that shields the deepest secrets of the Undergarden. This creature stands as a serious barrier and a true test of all the strength you have gathered so far."
		""
		"Enter its domain, brace yourself for a brutal fight, and bring the Guardian down to prove your dominance over the Catacombs. For a warrior of the deep, this is one battle that cannot be avoided."
	]
	quest.63EF3547C612793D.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSlay a &7&lForgotten Guardian&r&f&l found within the Catacombs"
	quest.63EF3547C612793D.title: "&7&lQuest: Slaying the Sentinel"
	quest.640C2840FADBA46B.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fIn the misty swamps, a rare and radiant being can sometimes be found: the &c&lGolden Allay&r&f itself, a legendary spirit that holds the potential to become a &d&lSoul Mage Companion&r&f."
		""
		"&fApproach it carefully and remember, you'll need the &d&lWizard's Clothes&r&f and a &b&lMagic Staff&r&f to gain its trust. &d&lLocate the Golden Allay&r&f and prepare to awaken its hidden magic."
	]
	quest.640C2840FADBA46B.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate a &c&lGolden Allay&r&f&l in a swamp biome"
	quest.640C2840FADBA46B.title: "&6&lQuest: Locate the Golden Allay"
	quest.6421434C0FC43DED.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lZinc Ingot&r is a key metal in &b&lCreate&r, used to produce advanced materials like &e&lBrass&r and various machine components."
		""
		"You can obtain it by &e&lSmelting&r or &e&lBlasting&r &b&lZinc Ore&r or crushed zinc ore. Alternatively, craft it using &b&lZinc Nuggets&r or compress &b&lZinc Ingots&r into a &b&lBlock of Zinc&r for storage."
		""
		"Zinc plays a vital role in crafting and &e&lMixing&r, especially when combined with &e&lCopper Ingots&r to form &e&lBrass Ingots&r, one of the most important alloys in Create’s mechanical progress."
		""
		"Collect it, refine it, and use it to unlock the next level of automation."
	]
	quest.6421434C0FC43DED.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain a &b&lZinc Ingot&r"
	quest.6421434C0FC43DED.title: "&9&lQuest: Zinc Ingot"
	quest.6455A51F95BD6561.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fBurning Ashes are the key summoning material needed to challenge Ignis, the final boss of the Burning Arena dungeon&r. &fYou must gather these remnants to unlock the climactic battle&r."
		""
		"&fThere are two main ways to obtain the Ashes&r:"
		""
		"&fDirect drop&r: &fDefeat the &c&lIgnited Revenants&r &fon the second floor of the Burning Arena; each one guarantees a Burning Ash&r."
		""
		"&fCrafting&r: &fAfter Ignis is defeated for the first time, Ignited Berserkers will start spawning in Nether Fortresses&r. &fThey drop &c&lDying Embers&r, &fand four Embers can be crafted into one &c&lBurning Ash&r."
		""
		"&fOnce you have them, right-click the Burning Ashes on the Altar of Fire at the Arena’s peak to summon &c&lIgnis&r."
	]
	quest.6455A51F95BD6561.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain &c&lBurning Ashes &fby slaying Ignited Revenants or crafting them from &c&lDying Embers&r"
	quest.6455A51F95BD6561.title: "&4&lQuest: Gathering the Burning Ashes"
	quest.6547D93DE56A7695.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to &d&lWizards&r&f, which brings arcane, fire, and frost magic into your adventure and lets you choose a wizard archetype. Your journey begins by getting a &d&lWand&r&f or &d&lStaff&r&f, each coming with a basic spell already loaded. Remember that &d&lRunes&r&f act as ammunition for stronger spells."
		""
		"To really unlock your power, find a &d&lSpell Binding Table&r&f in a village gazebo or build one yourself with surrounding &f&lbookshelves&r&f. Use it to create one of three main spellbooks:"
		""
		"-> The &d&lTome of Arcane&r&f for focused attacks on close targets"
		"-> The &c&lTome of Fire&r&f for heavy damage across wide areas"
		"-> The &b&lTome of Frost&r&f for slowing enemies, blocking their movement, and shielding yourself"
		""
		"From there, you can craft wizard robes, staves, and wands, and hunt for enchantments like &d&lSpell Infinity&r&f and &d&lSpell Haste&r&f to boost your casting. Step into the circle and start mastering the elements."
	]
	quest.6547D93DE56A7695.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &d&lWizards&r&f&l mod and obtain your first magical focus"
	quest.6547D93DE56A7695.title: "&a&lInitiation into the Arcane Arts"
	quest.657A50257B026ACF.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fForged from the strongest metal known to man, the &c&lNetherite Golem&r&f stands as an unbreakable guardian. With &c&l18 attack damage&r&f and a massive &c&l360 HP&r&f, it's nearly unstoppable."
		""
		"&fRepair it using &e&lNetherite Scraps&r&f, and when defeated, it may drop &e&lNetherite Scraps&r&f."
		""
		"&fRight-click with a &6&lGold Ingot&r&f to apply a shimmering gold trim. Mobs will stay neutral and your might protected."
		""
		"&fYou can remove the trim anytime with &f&lShears&r&f. Finally, right-click your Netherite Golem with &d&lSoul Lantern&r&f to unlock the legendary &d&lGoal Golem Summon Ability&r&f!"
	]
	quest.657A50257B026ACF.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSummon a &c&lNetherite Golem&r&f&l and learn its powerful abilities&r"
	quest.657A50257B026ACF.title: "&6&lQuest: The Netherite Golem Rises"
	quest.65A776FDB1999508.quest_desc: [
		"&rHallowed Gold is a sacred metal essential for unlocking a vast array of the mod's utility and cosmetic gear, including trinkets, spirit flasks, and rings."
		""
		""
		"To forge this metal, you must perform a Spirit Infusion ritual at your Altar. The ritual requires a Gold Ingot, four pieces of Quartz, two Sacred Spirits, and one Arcane Spirit. Acquire this gold to begin crafting powerful rings and collars that will boost your abilities!"
	]
	quest.65A776FDB1999508.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft a Hallowed Gold Ingot&r and use it to craft a trinket or ring."
	quest.65A776FDB1999508.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Forging the Hallowed Gold 👑✨"
	quest.65EF93E853378122.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lME Pattern Provider&r&f is the core of your autocrafting system. It connects your &b&lME Network&r&f to the world by pushing crafted ingredients into adjacent machines or inventories."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lHow It Works"
		""
		"The &b&lPattern Provider&r&f pulls ingredients directly from the &a&lCrafting Storage&r&f in a &a&lCrafting CPU&r&f. It doesn't hold items itself, so you can't pipe items out of it. Instead, push everything into another inventory like a chest or barrel, then pipe from that."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lBatch Behavior"
		""
		"&b&lPattern Providers&r&f always push &a&lentire recipe batches&r&f at once. They never send partial crafts, which keeps everything running smoothly and prevents incomplete machine operations. This makes them perfect for setting up precise automation."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lSubnet Interaction:"
		""
		"When facing an &b&lME Interface&r&f on a subnet with nothing in its request slots, the provider will &a&lskip the interface&r&f and push items directly to the subnet's storage. This keeps everything flowing smoothly and prevents interfaces from getting stuck with pending items."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lParallel Operations:"
		""
		"Multiple &b&lPattern Providers&r&f with identical patterns will work in &a&lparallel&r&f, greatly boosting production speed. They also use &a&lround-robin&r&f logic to distribute batches evenly among their connected machines."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lOptimization Tip:"
		""
		"Use &a&lSubnets&r&f to loop machine outputs back into the same &b&lPattern Provider&r&f instead of pulling results with an &a&lImport Bus&r&f. This keeps your network compact and efficient."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
	]
	quest.65EF93E853378122.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft an &b&lME Pattern Provider&r&f&l"
	quest.65EF93E853378122.title: "&9&lQuest: ME Pattern Provider"
	quest.66D11F2D81D0CEED.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your little patch of &6&lGloomgourds&r&f is a good start, but to really thrive in the Undergarden you need a serious harvest. Gather enough fully grown gourds to fill an entire stack."
		""
		"With that much stored away, you will have light and food to keep your expeditions going for many days. A true &6&lGourd Lord&r&f never runs out of pumpkins."
	]
	quest.66D11F2D81D0CEED.quest_subtitle: "&f&lAcquire a &6&lstack of Gloomgourds&r&f&l"
	quest.66D11F2D81D0CEED.title: "&7&lQuest: Gourd Lord"
	quest.67340A7139AFAF06.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lAncient Seas&r&f and other icy waters of the Undergarden are home to the &b&lGwigling&r&f, a small, bright fish that darts through the dark depths. Catching these quick swimmers sounds simple, but actually landing one demands precision and a steady hand."
		""
		"Take an empty bucket, slip into the water near a &b&lGwigling&r&f, and scoop it up in one smooth motion. Once secured, you will have a portable, squishy trophy of the Undergarden’s marine life."
	]
	quest.67340A7139AFAF06.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCapture a &b&lGwigling&r&f&l in a bucket"
	quest.67340A7139AFAF06.title: "&7&lQuest: Gwibling Catch and Release"
	quest.674E9D1E5E6A7084.quest_desc: [
		"While exploring the overgrown &aAbandoned Village&f, use your &6Brush&f on the &8Suspicious Gravel&f scattered among the ruins."
		"If you’re lucky, you may uncover a rare &eGlider Egg&f — the remnant of a graceful prehistoric bird once believed to be extinct."
		""
		"Handle it carefully, and with time, it will hatch into a gentle &bGlider&f that soars peacefully above the treetops."
	]
	quest.674E9D1E5E6A7084.quest_subtitle: "&7&oFind a Glider Egg in Suspicious Gravel."
	quest.674E9D1E5E6A7084.title: "&2&lQuest: The Glider Egg"
	quest.67AB41DBCB8E01D1.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lValkyries&r&f are fierce warriors, each guarding treasures of divine craftsmanship. Defeat them in honorable combat to claim a piece of their sacred armor or weaponry. Wearing their gear is both a mark of triumph and a &e&lpromise of greater battles ahead&r&f."
	]
	quest.67AB41DBCB8E01D1.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain a piece of &b&lValkyrie Equipment&r&f&l from the &7&lSilver Dungeon&r&f&l"
	quest.67AB41DBCB8E01D1.title: "&7&lQuest: Valkyrie’s Legacy"
	quest.67C34B3DA5039F7B.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &a&lCompanions! Mod&r&f introduces a world full of loyal allies, unique creatures, and mysterious machinery. &a&lFrom mechanical dynamos and puppets&r&f to magical mages, croissant dragons, and ancient rituals, every companion brings its own abilities and lore."
		""
		"&fExplore, craft, and befriend your new allies or summon powerful entities using enchanted altars. &b&lYour journey begins here&r&f: build your team, master your creations, and uncover the secrets of companionship."
	]
	quest.67C34B3DA5039F7B.quest_subtitle: "&f&lBegin your adventure and discover the many companions and mechanics added by this mod"
	quest.67C34B3DA5039F7B.title: "&a&lWelcome to Companions!"
	quest.67D43191FE7C5F0D.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &6&lWedding Ring&r&f symbolizes love and commitment, the key to starting your new family in &6&lMinecraft Comes Alive: Reborn&r&f. Once your relationship with a villager reaches &c&l100 Hearts&r&f or more, you can gift this ring to them to get married."
		""
		"&fTo craft it, use the same pattern as the &6&lMatchmaker's Ring&r&f: Place &6&l8 Gold Ingots&r&f around the edges of the crafting grid, leaving the center empty."
		""
		"&fNote: This item only works when gifted to a villager with whom you share a strong relationship."
		""
		"&fOnce married, new interactions and family options will become available."
		""
		"&fForge your bond, share your life, and let your story begin together."
	]
	quest.67D43191FE7C5F0D.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &6&lWedding Ring&r&f and prepare to marry your true love&r"
	quest.67D43191FE7C5F0D.title: "&6&lQuest: Craft the Wedding Ring"
	quest.680D390E42F0AF96.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fOnce your &d&lWalker Egg&r&f has hatched, a small &a&lWalker&r&f will begin its life in your world, a creature from Minecraft's ancient past, reborn through archaeology."
		""
		"&fWatch as it grows over time into a massive, gentle giant with long legs and a calm nature. To help it mature and even reproduce, feed it plenty of &a&lSpore Flowers&r&f."
		""
		"&fWhen two adult Walkers are well-fed, they will begin to breed, giving birth to a new generation of these majestic beings. Their growth is slow, but their bond to their caretaker lasts a lifetime."
	]
	quest.680D390E42F0AF96.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObserve a &d&lWalker&r&f&l as it grows and breed it with &a&lSpore Flowers&r"
	quest.680D390E42F0AF96.title: "&6&lQuest: The Growth of the Walker"
	quest.6948785200CAD5D8.quest_desc: [
		"The &bGlider&f is a peaceful prehistoric bird that soars gracefully above the jungle canopy."
		"You can &atame&f it with &dPufferfish&f, and once bonded, it may even dance to your music when near a &dMusic Disc Player&f."
		""
		"To &ebreed&f two Gliders, feed them &dSalmon&f — with care and patience, they will bring new life to the skies."
		"Watch as they flutter joyfully among the trees, carrying the spirit of the ancient world on their wings."
	]
	quest.6948785200CAD5D8.quest_subtitle: "&7&oObserve or breed a Glider."
	quest.6948785200CAD5D8.title: "&b&lQuest: The Glider"
	quest.694D32FAA5A71DA3.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your first step toward tracking down the dangerous &5&lNight Lich&r&f is to acquire a &e&lSoul Star&r&f.&r This strange item works like a compass, pointing you toward the Lich’s rare tower structures so you know where to start the hunt.&r"
		""
		"Fortunately, the &e&lSoul Star&r&f can be found early in your adventure.&r It drops from common &c&lUndead mobs&r&f such as zombies and skeletons, so you do not need to dive into any end‑game areas yet.&r Start cutting down these shambling foes to secure the key to finding your very first boss.&r"
	]
	quest.694D32FAA5A71DA3.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain a &e&lSoul Star&r&f&l by slaying an &c&lUndead&r&f&l mob"
	quest.694D32FAA5A71DA3.title: "&4&lQuest: Seeking the Soul Star"
	quest.69D87B20449FAC47.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &e&lSol Visage&r is the signature mask dropped by Umvuthi, the Sunbird, after you defeat this heliomancer boss.&r Wearing it marks you as the champion who brought down the radiant ruler of the skies&r.&r"
		""
		"When you equip the Sol Visage, Umvuthi and all Abayuthana (formerly Barakoa/Barakoana) will stop attacking you on sight.&r The mask also grants command over them: right‑clicking while holding another Abayuthana mask spawns that mask’s wearer as a friendly follower, and you can maintain up to ten followers at once&r.&r"
		""
		"With a full retinue of summoned warriors at your back, you are literally turning Umvuthi’s own children into your loyal honor guard.&r This makes the Sol Visage both a powerful reward and a potent symbol of leadership in the Sunbird’s domain&r.&r"
	]
	quest.69D87B20449FAC47.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain the &e&lSol Visage&r&l&f mask upon defeating Umvuthi, the Sunbird&r"
	quest.69D87B20449FAC47.title: "&4&lQuest: Claiming the Sol Visage"
	quest.69E3892FE8A63486.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lDisk Drive&r&f is the &a&lcore storage&r&f block of your Refined Storage system. It holds all your &b&lStorage Disks&r&f and connects them to your &b&lController&r&f, allowing you to store and access thousands of items digitally."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lHow It Works"
		""
		"Each &b&lDisk Drive&r&f can hold up to &a&l8 Storage Disks&r&f at once. Simply insert your crafted disks into the drive to start storing items immediately. When connected to a &b&lpowered Controller&r&f, it will &a&lsynchronize&r&f with your network and make all items accessible through any &b&lGrid&r&f."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lVisual Indicators"
		""
		"Each slot on the &b&lDisk Drive&r&f has a small light that shows its status:"
		""
		"- &a&lGreen:&r&f The disk has free space."
		""
		"- &e&lYellow:&r&f The disk is nearly full."
		""
		"- &c&lRed:&r&f The disk is completely full."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lPro Tip:"
		""
		"Place &a&lmultiple Disk Drives&r&f side by side for &a&lmassive storage capacity&r&f. Your Refined Storage network can handle as many as you need!"
	]
	quest.69E3892FE8A63486.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lDisk Drive&r&f &f&lfor your &b&lRefined Storage&r&f &f&lnetwork"
	quest.69E3892FE8A63486.title: "&9&lQuest: Crafting the Disk Drive"
	quest.6A9DA164F1A2F961.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Hidden deep within the &6&lBronze Dungeon&r&f rests a relic of divine craftsmanship: the &b&lValkyrie Lance&r&f. This elegant yet deadly weapon is proof that you are ready for far greater trials ahead. With it in hand, steel yourself… it is time to challenge the &7&lSilver Dungeon&r&f."
	]
	quest.6A9DA164F1A2F961.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain the &b&lValkyrie Lance&r&f&l from the &6&lBronze Dungeon&r&f&l"
	quest.6A9DA164F1A2F961.title: "&7&lQuest: The Valkyrie’s Challenge"
	quest.6ADBD04057E38909.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fPlace your &c&lBig Bread&r&f in the &d&lSoul Furnace&r&f, a forge that cooks items into their soul-like state. &a&lAs the flames of essence burn&r&f, the bread transforms into a &c&lCroissant Egg&r&f."
		""
		"&fStrange, warm, and faintly breathing, it's the beginning of a new life. &d&lRemove the Croissant Egg from the Furnace&r&f and feel the pulse of creation."
	]
	quest.6ADBD04057E38909.quest_subtitle: "&f&lUse the &d&lSoul Furnace&r&f&l to cook the &c&lBig Bread&r&f&l into a &c&lCroissant Egg"
	quest.6ADBD04057E38909.title: "&6&lQuest: Cook the Big Bread into a Croissant Egg"
	quest.6AE94FA148481250.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &e&lEaster&r&f, guardian of the Badlands, can grow stronger and larger over time. To help it mature, feed it &c&lany type of meat&r&f, the more you offer, the faster it will grow into its powerful adult form."
		""
		"&fA fully grown Eater becomes a fearsome protector, capable of roaring to scare away nearby mobs and crushing its enemies with powerful bites."
	]
	quest.6AE94FA148481250.quest_subtitle: "&f&lMake an &e&lEater Egg&r"
	quest.6AE94FA148481250.title: "&6&lQuest: Growing the Eater"
	quest.6AE9C2F91C55B854.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Raw &b&lArcane Crystal Ore&r holds energy that is too unstable to use directly, so it must be processed first.&r Place the ore into a furnace to safely refine this valuable material&r.&r"
		""
		"Smelting it will extract &b&lArcane Crystal Dust&r, a purified form of the crystal’s power.&r This fine dust becomes a stable, core ingredient for most high‑level arcane crafting and spellwork&r.&r"
	]
	quest.6AE9C2F91C55B854.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSmelt &b&lArcane Crystal Ore&r&l&f to obtain Arcane Crystal Dust&r"
	quest.6AE9C2F91C55B854.title: "&5&lQuest: Refining the Arcane Dust"
	quest.6B0632EE540B9F90.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fDeep beneath the &b&lIce Spike Castle&r&f lies the frozen remains of ancient life. By carefully brushing through the &d&lSuspicious Ice&r&f using your &6&lPaintbrush&r&f or &b&lChisel&r&f, you may uncover one of the rarest relics, the &d&lWalker Egg&r&f."
		""
		"&fThis ancient egg holds the power to bring back a long-lost species from Minecraft's prehistoric age. Treat it gently, and give it time to awaken. Once it hatches, a mighty &a&lWalker&r&f will roam your world again."
	]
	quest.6B0632EE540B9F90.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind a &d&lWalker Egg&r&f&l hidden within Suspicious Ice&r"
	quest.6B0632EE540B9F90.title: "&6&lQuest: The Walker Egg"
	quest.6B4AB14E442D8A5E.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &c&lGolden Allay&r&f holds the spark of true magic, waiting to be awakened. &a&lApproach it gently&r&f and offer the &d&lMage's Clothes&r&f (coat and hat) along with a &d&lMagic Staff&r&f."
		""
		"&fOnce given, the Allay will transform into a &d&lSoul Mage&r&f, a powerful yet fragile companion capable of casting spells from Magic Books. &d&lBond it with a Living Candle&r&f to grant it a second chance at life. When death comes, the candle burns in its place."
	]
	quest.6B4AB14E442D8A5E.quest_subtitle: "&f&lGive the &c&lGolden Allay&r&f&l the Mage's Clothes and a &d&lMagic Staff"
	quest.6B4AB14E442D8A5E.title: "&6&lQuest: Transform the Golden Allay into a Soul Mage"
	quest.6BAFD3A80275DA4F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &9&lAncient City&r&f is the heart of the deep dark, a sprawling ruin loaded with danger, gloom, and rare treasures. Its location is given away only by thick carpets of &9&lSculk&r&f that smother the surrounding caverns."
		""
		"Descend lower than ever, move in silence, and follow those eerie blue patches until the city finally appears out of the dark. Reaching this structure marks your first step into the gravest threats that Deeper and Darker can offer, where even the silence can kill."
	]
	quest.6BAFD3A80275DA4F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate a &9&lSculk infested biome&r&f&l and find an &9&lAncient City&r&f&l structure"
	quest.6BAFD3A80275DA4F.title: "&7&lQuest: Descent into the Ancient City"
	quest.6BCEA89E92A185B6.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to the &e&lBumblezone&r&f, a living hive filled with golden honey, buzzing bees, and hidden treasures. Explore enormous honeycomb caverns, shimmering crystal canyons, and towering hive walls that stretch for miles. Earn the bees’ trust by feeding them… or risk their fury if you dare steal their precious nectar."
		""
		"Within this waxy wonderland, you might uncover ancient secrets, stand before the &e&lBee Queen&r&f’s throne, and even craft your own &e&lBee Armor&r&f. The hive awaits, adventurer, step lightly and tread sweetly."
	]
	quest.6BCEA89E92A185B6.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &e&lBumblezone&r&f&l mod"
	quest.6BCEA89E92A185B6.title: "&7&lWelcome to The Bumblezone!"
	quest.6BD256288A84824A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &2&lTwilight Forest&r&f is an endless, enchanted realm with a strong fairy-tale and mythological vibe. The entire dimension sits under a thick forest canopy, with a deep blue, star-filled sky hanging above it all."
		""
		"To reach this world, you first need to build the portal in the Overworld:"
		""
		"Dig a two-by-two hole"
		"Fill the hole with &9&lwater&r&f"
		"Ring the water with any kind of &a&lflower&r&f"
		"Throw a &b&lDiamond&r&f into the pool"
		""
		"Step through the gateway and you will find flatter terrain, huge trees, strange &d&ldungeons&r&f, and plenty of unique &c&lbosses&r&f waiting for you."
	]
	quest.6BD256288A84824A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lEnter the &2&lTwilight Forest&r&f&l Dimension and witness its magical nature"
	quest.6BD256288A84824A.title: "&7&lQuest: Passage to the Twilight Forest"
	quest.6C166B7714861AD8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fWhile exploring the &6&lBadlands Temple&r&f, brush through the &d&lSuspicious Red Sand&r&f to uncover hidden treasures. Among the ancient relics, you might find a rare &e&lEaster Egg&r&f, a remnant of a long-forgotten desert guardian."
	]
	quest.6C166B7714861AD8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind an &e&lEaster Egg&r&f&l in Suspicious Red Sand&r"
	quest.6C166B7714861AD8.title: "&6&lQuest: The Eater Egg"
	quest.6C1D996C35C4223F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fNow that your colony is thriving, it's time to decide how it will grow next."
		""
		"&fOnce you reach &a&l7 citizens&r&f, you may start facing new challenges such as &c&lraider attacks&r&f or &c&lsick citizens&r&f. You might want to build a &c&lGuard Tower&r&f for protection, a &a&lHospital&r&f to care for your people, or a &6&lSawmill&r&f for your workers."
		""
		"&fEvery colony develops differently. You can focus on defense, production, or aesthetics, the choice is yours. Your leadership will shape the future of your settlement!"
	]
	quest.6C1D996C35C4223F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lExpand your colony as you choose&r"
	quest.6C1D996C35C4223F.title: "&6&lStep 9: Rest of the Colony"
	quest.6C3B7A742B3C89F3.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The whispers of the wild hide many secrets.&r The &2&lDruidic Tome&r is an ancient spellbook focused on the elemental and healing powers of the natural world&r.&r"
		""
		"This rare book is usually found in chests within swamp or forest structures, or traded from a Nature‑aligned mage.&r Equipping it grants a strong bonus to Nature spell power and a big boost to your maximum mana, making it a must‑have for any earth‑loving caster&r.&r"
	]
	quest.6C3B7A742B3C89F3.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain a &2&lDruidic Tome&r&l&f, the book of Nature Magic&r"
	quest.6C3B7A742B3C89F3.title: "&5&lQuest: The Druidic Lore"
	quest.6C99D24D9E41A14C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your second major trial waits inside the eerie &6&lLich Tower&r&f, the generated structure that serves as the home of the &6&lTwilight Lich&r&f boss."
		""
		"These towers come in different sizes and shapes and can spawn in several &a&lbiomes&r&f across the dimension. Explore the surrounding lands until you spot this tall dungeon, then fight your way up through its halls to the top floor, where the Lich is waiting—be ready for strange mobs and tricky challenges along the way."
	]
	quest.6C99D24D9E41A14C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind the &6&lLich Tower&r&f&l structure in the &2&lTwilight Forest&r&f&l"
	quest.6C99D24D9E41A14C.title: "&7&lQuest: Locating the Lich Tower"
	quest.6CADB0D2DB2823F2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fSmall but determined, the &f&lCandle Golem&r&f burns brightly against the darkness. With &c&l15 HP&r&f and a modest &c&l6 attack&r&f, it can still stand its ground when handled wisely."
		""
		"&fRight-click a Candle Golem Block to spawn one, and use &6&lFlint and Steel&r&f to light its candle, awakening its fiery combat mode. Once lit, it hurls &c&lfire projectiles&r&f at nearby mobs, but beware, overuse will drain its life until its flame fades."
		""
		"&fRight-click the golem to command it to sit or stand. While sitting, it gains &a&l90% projectile resistance&r&f and ignores knockback entirely."
		""
		"&fKeep it repaired with &f&lHoneycombs&r&f, and this glowing guardian will light the way through your darkest battles."
	]
	quest.6CADB0D2DB2823F2.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSpawn and light a &f&lCandle Golem&r&f&l to discover its fiery abilities and defensive stance&r"
	quest.6CADB0D2DB2823F2.title: "&6&lQuest: The Flickering Sentinel - Candle Golem"
	quest.6CC2690B6A3DD521.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lMechanical Press&r is one of the most important early game machines in &b&lCreate&r. It applies &e&lPressing&r, &e&lPacking&r, and &e&lCompacting&r recipes to items placed beneath it, turning simple materials into advanced crafting components."
		""
		"It is driven by an internal &b&lShaft&r that can connect from either side, transferring &e&lrotational energy&r just like a normal shaft or &e&lCogwheel&r. The faster it spins, the faster the press works."
		""
		"Use it to press ingots into &e&lSheets&r, which are crucial for higher tier machinery and many complex mechanisms. If you are not sure about a recipe, &a&lJEI&r can show you exactly how to craft it."
		""
		"This powerful machine is your first real step toward full automation through pure mechanical compression."
	]
	quest.6CC2690B6A3DD521.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lMechanical Press&r"
	quest.6CC2690B6A3DD521.title: "&9&lQuest: Mechanical Press"
	quest.6D23D0CA53476317.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &8&lAncient Knight&r is a heavily armored enemy that appears in the Ancient Battlegrounds, ruined arenas that can generate on the surface or, more rarely, in the Nether.&r These melee fighters rise from Armor Piles inside the structure, clad in durable gear and ready to charge&r.&r"
		""
		"Expect an aggressive fight: they are resistant to fire and fall damage, so straightforward brute force is risky.&r Ranged attacks or magic are recommended, especially arcane, lightning, or holy spells that can pierce their defenses from a distance&r.&r"
		""
		"Defeating an Ancient Knight can reward you with valuable late‑game loot, including the &8&lDecrepit Flamberge&r and pieces of enchanted armor.&r Taking them down is a solid step forward in your end‑game progression&r.&r"
	]
	quest.6D23D0CA53476317.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSlay an &8&lAncient Knight&r&l&f found within the Ancient Battlegrounds&r"
	quest.6D23D0CA53476317.title: "&5&lQuest: Defeating the Ancient Knight"
	quest.6D3DBB087EA963DF.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lSteam Engine&r is a high tier &b&lCreate&r power source that converts heated &9&lWater&r into &e&lRotational Force&r. It delivers the &e&lhighest Stress Unit capacity&r of all survival friendly generators, making it perfect for &e&llarge scale automation&r and mass production systems."
		""
		"By connecting it to a &b&lFluid Tank&r filled with &9&lWater&r and applying &e&lheat underneath&r, the engine builds pressure that is turned into massive rotational power. Use it to run &b&lmultiple machines&r and complex contraptions at once without sacrificing efficiency."
		""
		"Check &a&lJEI&r for the exact crafting recipe and components needed to assemble this powerhouse of an engine."
	]
	quest.6D3DBB087EA963DF.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lSteam Engine&r"
	quest.6D3DBB087EA963DF.title: "&9&lQuest: Steam Engine"
	quest.6D8F74179A398FEF.quest_desc: [
		"&rThe Runic Workbench is an essential structure for any mage, as it is the key to creating all sixteen powerful Runes that grant magical combat and utility enhancements."
		""
		"This crafting station is made by combining a unique recipe, typically involving an Item Pedestal and other specialized blocks. Once built, you can use the Runic Workbench to forge runes for increased mining speed (&dRun of Therbor&r), attack speed (&dRun of Haste&r), passive resistance (&dRun of the Hells&r), and many other powers."
	]
	quest.6D8F74179A398FEF.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft the Runic Workbench&r to begin forging magical Runes."
	quest.6D8F74179A398FEF.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Building the Runic Workbench 📜🛠️"
	quest.6DCDCC4823EAC22A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have discovered a path beyond the stars that leads into the &e&lEternal Starlight&r&f dimension. Here, strange &a&lflora&r&f, unusual &a&lfauna&r&f, and new challenges twist the usual rules of the Overworld."
		""
		"Take your first steps into this bright new world and start exploring. Follow the &b&lstarlight&r&f as you begin your adventure in this beautiful, stellar realm."
	]
	quest.6DCDCC4823EAC22A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lEnter the &e&lEternal Starlight Dimension&r&f&l and see its magic up close"
	quest.6DCDCC4823EAC22A.title: "&7&lWelcome to Eternal Starlight"
	quest.6DFB6437F7E287A7.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lApprentice’s Spell Book&r marks your progress from novice to true student of magic.&r It appears as rare loot in magical structures or as a drop from spellcasting enemies&r.&r"
		""
		"When equipped, it provides cast‑time reduction and a small boost to maximum mana, making your spells faster and your mana pool a bit deeper.&r It is an ideal companion for any mage taking their first serious steps into the arcane arts&r.&r"
	]
	quest.6DFB6437F7E287A7.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain the &b&lApprentice’s Spell Book&r&l&f&r"
	quest.6DFB6437F7E287A7.title: "&5&lQuest: Apprentice of the Arcane"
	quest.6E8B159CBA84AEFD.quest_desc: [
		""
		"A chaotic infection is spreading through the Undergarden, taking shape as a twisted hierarchy of &4&lRotspawn&r&f. To truly stand against the Rot, you must prove you can bring down every form it takes."
		""
		"Track and destroy the skittish &4&lRotling&r&f, the lumbering &4&lRotwalker&r&f, and finally the massive &4&lRotbeast&r&f. Only by felling all three will you mark yourself as a real threat to the Rotspawn plague."
	]
	quest.6E8B159CBA84AEFD.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSlay all three kinds of &4&lRotspawn&r&f&l: a &4&lRotling&r&f&l, a &4&lRotwalker&r&f&l, and a &4&lRotbeast&r&f&l"
	quest.6E8B159CBA84AEFD.title: "&7&lQuest: Cleansing the Rot-Plague"
	quest.6EAA690C3F3D09E8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Tiny bouncing &e&lGronglets&r&f are odd but mostly harmless little creatures. Unfortunately for them, they are also perfectly shaped to fit in your &6&lSlingshot&r&f."
		""
		"Load one of these poor frogs and fire it at a target to see just how effective this questionable ammo can be. It works very well, even if your conscience complains a bit."
	]
	quest.6EAA690C3F3D09E8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lShoot a &e&lGronglet&r&f&l. Is this okay…?"
	quest.6EAA690C3F3D09E8.title: "&7&lQuest: Ethically Questionable"
	quest.6F30082FB7DAC0AB.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Now that you have basic &b&lME&r storage and access to it, it is time to take things a step further: automation!"
		""
		"A perfect starting point is your furnace setup:"
		""
		"- Place an &b&lME Export Bus&r on top of the furnace to send ores from your &b&lME Network&r."
		""
		"- Place an &b&lME Import Bus&r on the bottom to pull out the finished ingots automatically."
		""
		"The &b&lME Export Bus&r sends items from your &b&lME system&r into connected inventories, while the &b&lME Import Bus&r does the opposite — it brings items into your system."
		""
		"With this setup, your network can automatically smelt ores without you lifting a finger! This is your first step toward a fully automated factory powered by &e&lApplied Energistics 2&r."
	]
	quest.6F30082FB7DAC0AB.quest_subtitle: "&f&lAutomate your first process using &b&lME Import&r &f&land &b&lExport Buses&r"
	quest.6F30082FB7DAC0AB.title: "&9&lQuest: Expanding Your Network"
	quest.704A86782E714D64.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fMoa Eggs can be found throughout the &b&lAether&r&f, often guarded by their majestic parents."
		""
		"&fThese colorful eggs hold the key to taming your own flying companion, an essential ally for exploring the skylands."
		""
		"&fAdult &b&lMoas&r&f lay an egg of their respective color every five to ten minutes, so keep an eye on them if you want to collect your own."
	]
	quest.704A86782E714D64.quest_subtitle: "&f&lHave a &b&lMoa Egg&r&f in your inventory"
	quest.704A86782E714D64.title: "&7&lQuest: Egg of the Skies"
	quest.70AC02D4BA9E70EC.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &3&lSunken City&r&f is a rare, mysterious underwater temple that generates exclusively in &3&lDeep Ocean&r&f biomes.&r This colossal structure is the domain of the &3&lDeeplings&r&f and the home of the terrifying &3&lLeviathan&r&f boss.&r"
		""
		"You must use the &9&lEye of Abyss&r&f to track down this temple.&r Once you arrive, you will need to navigate multiple chambers, including a library and a prison, while fighting hostile creatures such as &3&lDeeplings&r&f armed with &b&lCoral Spears&r&f and the massive &3&lCoralsus&r&f.&r Reaching this temple is the final step before facing the &3&lLeviathan&r&f itself.&r"
	]
	quest.70AC02D4BA9E70EC.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind the &3&lSunken City&r&f&l structure in a &3&lDeep Ocean&r&f&l biome&r"
	quest.70AC02D4BA9E70EC.title: "&4&lQuest: Locating the Sunken City"
	quest.70F958F06959BB5B.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&b&lImmersive Engineering&r gives you the tools to generate and store &e&lImmersive Flux (IF)&r, but what is the point of a fully powered network if it does not do anything? Now it is time to put it to use."
		""
		"The &b&lExternal Heater&r is a perfect example. Unlike most mods RF powered furnaces, it directly powers the vanilla furnace using &e&lIF&r. Place it adjacent to a furnace and supply energy through your &b&lWire Connectors&r and &b&lCoils&r, then your furnace will operate automatically using the energy from your network."
		""
		"This is just the beginning. Once you start using energy efficiently, the full potential of &b&lImmersive Engineering&r opens up."
		""
		"{image:kubejs:textures/imagenesaaaa/furnaceimmersive.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.70F958F06959BB5B.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft an &b&lExternal Heater&r"
	quest.70F958F06959BB5B.title: "&9&lQuest: Using Energy"
	quest.717909D9A418C268.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Arcane Essence is the basic building block of magic in &b&lIron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks&r, used in a huge number of recipes.&r You might find some in vanilla structures, but the most reliable sources are the mod’s own content&r.&r"
		""
		"Magic Structures: raid towers and forts added by the mod to loot &b&lArcane Essence&r.&r"
		"Magic Mobs: defeat spellcasting foes like Cryomancers, Pyromancers, and Necromancers to claim their essence&r.&r"
		""
		"Stock up on this glowing resource to start crafting key gear such as the Wandering Magician armor and to keep pushing deeper into spellcasting&r.&r"
	]
	quest.717909D9A418C268.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain &b&lArcane Essence&r&l&f, the common material for magic recipes&r"
	quest.717909D9A418C268.title: "&5&lQuest: Gathering Arcane Essence"
	quest.71C6808AC870A69C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lEngineer's Hammer&r is one of the most essential tools in &b&lImmersive Engineering&r. It is primarily used for &e&lforming multiblock structures&r and configuring technical blocks throughout your factory."
		""
		"With this hammer in hand, you can &e&lassemble powerful machines&r like the &b&lCoke Oven&r, &b&lBlast Furnace&r, and &b&lRefinery&r. Simply position the &e&linput and output sides&r of devices with the &b&lWrench&r, then use the hammer to lock them into place."
		""
		"Without it, your industrial progress simply cannot begin. It is the cornerstone of every engineer's toolkit, sturdy, reliable, and vital for building your first true industrial machines. Use &a&lJEI&r to view the crafting recipe and gather the necessary materials to forge it."
	]
	quest.71C6808AC870A69C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft an &b&lEngineer's Hammer&r"
	quest.71C6808AC870A69C.title: "&9&lQuest: Engineer’s Hammer"
	quest.71FB53FF1E4157C4.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&b&lCoal Coke&r is a refined version of regular &9&lCoal&r, created through the &b&lCoke Oven&r process. Not only is it an important crafting material in &b&lImmersive Engineering&r, it is also a superior fuel source. It can smelt &e&l16 items&r instead of coal's 8."
		""
		"To create it, simply place &9&lCoal&r inside a &b&lCoke Oven&r and wait for it to process. You will also get a bonus byproduct of &e&lCreosote Oil&r, used in crafting &e&lTreated Wood&r and other recipes."
		""
		"Efficient and essential, &b&lCoal Coke&r fuels your first steps toward advanced engineering."
	]
	quest.71FB53FF1E4157C4.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain &b&lCoal Coke&f from a &b&lCoke Oven&r"
	quest.71FB53FF1E4157C4.title: "&9&lQuest: Coal Coke"
	quest.72064FD61FEA9374.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &d&lHomunculus&r&f is an alchemical creation, a fragment of life made through forbidden arts. &a&lUsing your Filled Grail&r&f and other rare ingredients, you can craft this vital material."
		""
		"&fThe &d&lHomunculus&r&f will be key in creating something... deliciously alive. &d&lSeize it, and prepare for what's next."
	]
	quest.72064FD61FEA9374.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &d&lHomunculus"
	quest.72064FD61FEA9374.title: "&6&lQuest: Craft a Homunculus"
	quest.721819365202931A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Only the most precise and fearless champions can boast of this achievement. Stand against the &6&lSlider&r&f, the &b&lValkyrie Queen&r&f, and the &6&lSun Spirit&r&f, and walk away untouched. No damage, no doubt, just pure mastery over the Aether’s mightiest foes."
	]
	quest.721819365202931A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat &b&lAll Aether Bosses&r&f&l without taking a single hit"
	quest.721819365202931A.title: "&7&lQuest: Untouchable in the Skies"
	quest.72D873C4BDFE3BF2.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Legends tell of the &6&lHammer of Kingbdogz&r&f, a powerful relic once wielded by the ancient ruler of the &b&lAether&r&f. This mighty weapon can only be earned as a reward in the &6&lBronze Dungeon&r&f after defeating the &6&lSlider&r&f, so be ready for a real fight. Claim it as your own and wield the power of the Aether’s first champion."
	]
	quest.72D873C4BDFE3BF2.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain the &6&lHammer of Kingbdogz&r&f&l from the &6&lBronze Dungeon&r&f&l"
	quest.72D873C4BDFE3BF2.title: "&7&lQuest: Relic of the Sky King"
	quest.72E78602031AE40C.quest_desc: [
		"&rThese two infused stones are foundational materials for creating advanced ritual structures, powerful armors, and the Spirit Crucible. You must use a Spirit Infusion ritual on common stone to create them:"
		""
		"Twisted Rock is created by infusing Cobblestone with Wicked Spirit and Arcane Spirit"
		"Tainted Rock is created by infusing Cobblestone with Sacred Spirit and Arcane Spirit"
	]
	quest.72E78602031AE40C.quest_subtitle: "&7&6Craft both Twisted Rock and Tainted Rock&r using the Spirit Altar."
	quest.72E78602031AE40C.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4Forging the Corrupted Stones 🌑🧱"
	quest.72F827B4171AA6B4.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&b&lThe Inscriber&r is one of the most important machines in &b&lAE2&r. It is a sided machine, similar to the vanilla furnace, and is used to create essential processor components for your &b&lME Network&r."
		""
		"Inserting items from the &b&ltop or bottom&r places them in the upper or lower slots, while inserting from the &e&lside or back&r inserts into the middle slot. The crafted results can be extracted from the &e&lside or back&r automatically."
		""
		"You will need it to press circuits and craft processors, so it is a key step in your &b&lAE2&r progression."
	]
	quest.72F827B4171AA6B4.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft &b&lThe Inscriber&r"
	quest.72F827B4171AA6B4.title: "&9&lQuest: Craft The Inscriber"
	quest.72FEE966FCE3B384.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fBeneath the burning sands of the desert, the &c&lWild Antlion&r&f prowls waiting for its next meal. If it spots you, it will quickly &c&lburrow underground&r&f and attack with &c&lsand projectiles&r&f."
		""
		"&fTo tame it, you must &a&lapproach silently&r&f from behind, unseen, and use &b&lCrystallized Blood&r&f to calm it down. &d&lLocate a Wild Antlion&r&f and prepare for a careful and dangerous encounter."
	]
	quest.72FEE966FCE3B384.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate a &c&lWild Antlion&r&f&l in the desert"
	quest.72FEE966FCE3B384.title: "&6&lQuest: Locate a Wild Antlion"
	quest.73426C024D64FD51.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Once feared for knocking you out of the sky, the &b&lZephyrs&r&f now face their reckoning. Take up the &6&lHammer of Kingbdogz&r&f and send them crashing down from the clouds they love so much. Let justice, and gravity, do the rest."
	]
	quest.73426C024D64FD51.quest_subtitle: "&f&lKill a &b&lZephyr&r&f&l using the &6&lHammer of Kingbdogz&r&f&l"
	quest.73426C024D64FD51.title: "&7&lQuest: Sweet Revenge!"
	quest.73474253C669A1B8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fDeep within the &a&lBirch Forests&r&f lives the &6&lHoney Golem&r&f, a sticky sentinel with &c&l5 HP&r&f and a &c&l4 attack&r&f. Poison can be repaired with &6&lHoney Bottles&r&f and drops up to 3 &6&lHoneycombs&r&f upon defeat."
		""
		"&fThis golem isn't just tough, it's alive with bees buzzing inside! These tiny allies defend their host, attacking nearby threats and even &a&lhealing the Honey Golem&r&f during battles."
		""
		"&fWhen its body is full of honey, you can shear it to collect &6&lHoney Blobs&r&f, throwable projectiles that slow enemies just like the golem's own attacks."
		""
		"&fTip: Keep a bottle of honey handy to repair and befriend this sweet powerhouse of nature!"
	]
	quest.73474253C669A1B8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate a &6&lHoney Golem&r&f&l in a &a&lBirch Forest&r&f&l and witness its sweet yet deadly abilities&r"
	quest.73474253C669A1B8.title: "&6&lQuest: The Sweet Guardian - Honey Golem"
	quest.73B6C6CCF5EF5E29.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lMechanical Mixer&r is a &b&lCreate&r component used to &e&lcombine ingredients&r through &e&lMixing&r and shapeless crafting recipes placed in a &b&lBasin&r below it. When supplied with &e&lrotational energy&r, the mixer automatically stirs and processes the items inside, creating new materials and advanced components."
		""
		"It is essential for producing &e&lAlloys&r, &e&lDough&r, and many complex crafting recipes used in automation and resource processing. The mixer’s speed directly affects processing time, so &e&lhigher RPMs&r mean faster crafting."
		""
		"Combine it with a &b&lMechanical Press&r or &e&lHeated Basin&r to unlock even more powerful recipes and long &b&lproduction chains&r. Use &a&lJEI&r to check the crafting recipe and gather all the parts needed to assemble it."
	]
	quest.73B6C6CCF5EF5E29.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lMechanical Mixer&r"
	quest.73B6C6CCF5EF5E29.title: "&9&lQuest: Mechanical Mixer"
	quest.73D0AD10856D2AC8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Mastery of magic reaches into the deepest waters too.&r The &b&lSea Prism&r is an elemental artifact that, when applied to an armor piece (usually the helmet), grants the powerful &b&lAquatic Modifier&r.&r"
		""
		"This modifier is vital for underwater travel: it removes normal slowdown, speeds up mining, and gives you minor regeneration while submerged.&r Craft the &b&lSea Prism&r with a ritual in your &5&lHephaestus Forge&r and take control of the hidden depths&r.&r"
	]
	quest.73D0AD10856D2AC8.quest_subtitle: "&l&fAcquire a &b&lSea Prism&r&l&f to apply the Aquatic Modifier to armor&r"
	quest.73D0AD10856D2AC8.title: "&5&lQuest: The Aquatic Prism"
	quest.741727FD52B05E5C.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fSaddles are now &a&lcraftable in the &6&lVanilla Backport&r&f mod. This simple but useful change makes exploration easier and more accessible."
		""
		"&fUnlock the recipe by picking up Leather for the first time. &d&lCraft your own Saddle&r&f and get ready to ride."
	]
	quest.741727FD52B05E5C.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &a&lSaddle&r&f&l using 3 &6&lLeather&r&f&l and 1 &7&lIron Ingot"
	quest.741727FD52B05E5C.title: "&6&lQuest: Craft a Saddle"
	quest.7441E0EE6F2B7F3A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&l&2Poison&r&f is not just a hazard in the Aether, it is also a mysterious tool for transformation."
		""
		"&fBy tossing certain items into poison, they will slowly mutate into new, enchanted forms."
		""
		"&fExperiment with what you throw in and you may uncover the Aether’s alchemical secrets."
		""
		"&f&lExamples of Transformations"
		"- &6&lGolden Dart&r&f ➜ &d&lEnchanted Dart&r&f"
		"- &a&lSkyroot Poison Bucket&r&f ➜ &a&lSkyroot Remedy Bucket&r&f"
		"- &7&lHolystone&r&f ➜ &a&lHealing Stone&r&f"
		"- &7&lQuicksoil&r&f ➜ &7&lQuicksoil Glass&r&f"
		"- &9&lBlue Berry&r&f ➜ &d&lEnchanted Berry&r&f"
		"- &d&lGravitite Ore&r&f ➜ &d&lEnchanted Gravitite&r&f"
		"- &5&lPurple&r&f or &a&lGreen Squash&r&f ➜ &9&lBlue Squash&r&f"
		""
		"&f&lTip"
		""
		"&fTry tossing enchantable or Aether-infused items, you might discover something magical."
	]
	quest.7441E0EE6F2B7F3A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lTransform an item by throwing it into &2&lPoison&r&f"
	quest.7441E0EE6F2B7F3A.title: "&7&lQuest: Alchemical Corruption"
	quest.74BAB010812BE402.quest_desc: [
		""
		"A lucky discovery can keep you going in this desolate realm. The &2&lUnderbean Bush&r&f is a rare but renewable source of food and seeds."
		""
		"Track down a bush, harvest its nutritious Underbeans, and secure a steady supply of energy for your long expeditions through the Undergarden."
	]
	quest.74BAB010812BE402.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind and pick an &2&lUnderbean Bush&r&f&l"
	quest.74BAB010812BE402.title: "&7&lQuest: Glorious Beans!"
	quest.74BB4FE7DF2ADB1F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have explored the ruins, faced the guardians, and mapped the farthest reaches of this magical realm. Now your final task is simple to say but hard to do: leave no star-swept stone unturned."
		""
		"Make sure you have crafted every important item, defeated every unique foe, and uncovered every secret the &e&lEternal Starlight&r&f mod hides. By finishing all the dimension’s &a&ladvancements&r&f, you prove your mastery of its magic, your courage against its dangers, and your dedication to the whole cosmic adventure—then you can finally enjoy that well-earned rest, Explorer."
	]
	quest.74BB4FE7DF2ADB1F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lComplete all &a&ladvancements&r&f&l, check all content, and fully conquer the &e&lStarlight Dimension&r&f&l"
	quest.74BB4FE7DF2ADB1F.title: "&7&lQuest: Master of the Cosmos"
	quest.74F6F3931500416B.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &a&lStaff of Life&r&f is a divine tool that channels pure energy from the &d&lNether Star&r&f, infused through the &b&lEnd Rod&r&f, and purified by the &c&lGrim Reaper's&r&f scythe."
		""
		"&fWith it, you can bring back villagers who have died, but at a cost."
		""
		"&fTo use the staff, simply &6&lright-click the tombstone&r&f of a fallen villager while holding it in your hand. Each use consumes part of its power, and it can only be used &c&l10 times&r&f before breaking."
		""
		"&fA tool of redemption and hope, the Staff of Life is the light that counters darkness."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&f&lCrafting Recipe:"
		""
		"Combine the following items in a crafting table:"
		""
		"&f&l■ &d&l1 Nether Star&r"
		""
		"&f&l■ &b&l1 End Rod&r"
		""
		"&f&l■ &c&l1 Grim Reaper's Scythe&r"
		""
		"Once forged, the &a&lStaff of Life&r&f becomes the ultimate symbol of mercy, a weapon once used for death, now reborn to grant life."
	]
	quest.74F6F3931500416B.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft the &a&lStaff of Life&r&f - a sacred artifact capable of reviving fallen villagers and restoring balance to your village&r"
	quest.74F6F3931500416B.title: "&6&lQuest: Forge the Staff of Life"
	quest.74F89318B763EDB7.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &c&lAncient Factory&r is a rare underground dungeon found in the Overworld, accessible only by crafting and using the &6&lEye of Mech&r. This factory is the remnants of an ancient laboratory that attempted to replicate and control the &8&lWither's&r power."
		""
		"Once inside, you will face small &c&lWatchers&r that shoot laser beams and the more dangerous &c&lProwler&r mini-boss. Your goal is to reach the factory's heart, where the dormant mechanical boss, the &c&lHarbinger&r, lies. Finding this factory is the final prerequisite for facing the &c&lHarbinger&r."
	]
	quest.74F89318B763EDB7.quest_subtitle: "&l&fFind the &c&lAncient Factory&r&l&f structure deep underground in the &a&lOverworld&r&l&f"
	quest.74F89318B763EDB7.title: "&4&lQuest: Locating the Ancient Factory"
	quest.751A5433BA913266.quest_desc: [
		""
		"After defeating the &6&lAncient Remnant&r&f, you are rewarded with its &6&lSkull&r&f.&r This relic lets you summon the &6&lModern Remnant&r&f, a unique, immortal pet that fights at your side and offers solid combat support.&r"
		""
		"To activate this skeletal dinosaur companion:&r"
		"Place the &6&lRemnant Skull&r&f in the world to call the pet.&r"
		"Feed it a &a&lSniffer Egg&r&f to turn it into a loyal companion and follower.&r"
		""
		"The &6&lModern Remnant&r&f is truly immortal; if it “dies”, it simply drops its &6&lSkull&r&f so you can tame it again.&r You can even carry it around in a &d&lBucket of Void&r&f for easy storage between battles.&r Secure this powerful friend and bring your own undead dinosaur to every fight.&r"
	]
	quest.751A5433BA913266.quest_subtitle: "&f&lSummon and domesticate the &6&lModern Remnant&r&f&l using the &6&lRemnant Skull&r&f&l and a &a&lSniffer Egg&r&f&l"
	quest.751A5433BA913266.title: "&4&lQuest: Domesticating the Modern Remnant"
	quest.752741F86E1EDAD0.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&l&2Nagas&r are large, poisonous winged serpents that patrol coastal cliffs and the Stony Shores biome, often moving in packs.&r They are dangerous foes noted for their agility and for using corrosive acid venom&r.&r"
		""
		"A Naga attacks by spitting acid balls that deal heavy damage and inflict poison, and it can swoop in with spinning melee strikes that also hit hard.&r Although they can dodge many projectiles, a precise arrow can knock a Naga out of the air and slam it to the ground, giving you a brief chance to rush in and punish it&r.&r"
		""
		"Killing a Naga rewards you with its Naga Fang, a valuable drop that can be brewed into potent antivenom.&r Hunting these serpents is risky, but the antidotes you gain are essential for surviving other venomous threats&r.&r"
	]
	quest.752741F86E1EDAD0.quest_subtitle: "&l&fSlay a &2&lNaga&r&l&f, the venomous winged serpent of the cliffs&r"
	quest.752741F86E1EDAD0.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Naga Serpent"
	quest.757A2A513EC5C1A8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &4&lCrystallized Blood&r&f is a powerful alchemical substance born from corruption and flame. &a&lPlace Rotten Flesh into the Soul Furnace&r&f to purify it through essence and fire."
		""
		"&fThis crystallized substance charges altars and ignites stars and to tame the Wild Antiloch, but handle it with care. The creature attacks if it sees you. &d&lPurge life from decay&r&f, and let blood become your key to taming the sands."
	]
	quest.757A2A513EC5C1A8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lUse the &d&lSoul Furnace&r&f&l to cook &4&lRotten Flesh&r&f&l into &4&lCrystallized Blood"
	quest.757A2A513EC5C1A8.title: "&6&lQuest: Create Crystallized Blood"
	quest.759323EFF36C917E.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &d&lEyeblossom&r&f is a flower that sees the world differently. &a&lIt opens its eye at night&r&f and closes during the day, whispering to its neighbors as it changes."
		""
		"&fUse &b&lBone Meal&r&f on grass in the Pale Garden to grow them, or trade with &b&lWandering Traders&r&f. &d&lCollect both variants&r&f and watch them blink open and closed beneath the moonlight."
	]
	quest.759323EFF36C917E.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate and collect both &d&lClosed&r&f&l and &d&lOpen Eyeblossoms"
	quest.759323EFF36C917E.title: "&6&lQuest: Locate and Collect Eyeblossoms"
	quest.75CA359F9BABEC4A.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lShaft&r is one of the most fundamental components in &b&lCreate&r, acting as the backbone of all rotational power systems."
		""
		"Crafted from &b&lAndesite Alloy&r, the shaft links two &b&lmechanical components&r, letting &e&lrotational energy&r pass smoothly between them. Whether you are transmitting motion between gears or setting up &b&lMechanical Belts&r for automation, the shaft keeps your machines in perfect sync."
		""
		"It is also used in crafting many advanced mechanisms, including &b&lBearings&r, &e&lCranks&r, &e&lPulleys&r, and &b&lEncased Fans&r."
		""
		"Even the most complex contraptions begin with a simple, spinning &b&lShaft&r."
	]
	quest.75CA359F9BABEC4A.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &b&lShaft&f&l using &b&lAndesite Alloy&r"
	quest.75CA359F9BABEC4A.title: "&9&lQuest: Shaft"
	quest.766BCB4D5F455C88.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The most basic source of magical power in this dimension is the &b&lRunic Stone&r, a rare material buried deep underground.&r To locate it, head to the very lowest layers of the world, from bedrock up to about Y‑level 2.&r"
		""
		"When mined without Silk Touch, these stones drop a valuable &9&lRune&r, used in almost all arcane crafting.&r Begin your deep‑level exploration and secure this &a&lkey base material&r for your magic.&r"
	]
	quest.766BCB4D5F455C88.quest_subtitle: "&l&fFind a &b&lRunic Stone&r&l&f between the bottom of the world and Y‑level 2&r"
	quest.766BCB4D5F455C88.title: "&5&lQuest: The Deep-Seated Runes"
	quest.76872CA4361744B8.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fFrom the depths of the sea rises the &b&lKelp Golem&r&f, a calm yet powerful guardian of the oceans. With &c&l30 HP&r&f and &c&l9 attack&r&f in its normal state, this golem becomes truly formidable when near a &b&lConduit&r&f."
		""
		"&fWhen within a conduit's range, it enters a &b&lCharged State&r&f, gaining &a&l+100% Damage&r&f, &a&lRegeneration&r&f and &a&l+100% Resistance&r&f, increasing its HP to &c&l50&r&f and attack to &c&l16&r&f. It can be repaired using &a&lKelp&r&f, and drops &a&l1-3 Kelp&r&f and &b&l1-3 Prismarine Crystals&r&f when defeated."
		""
		"&fA living conduit's energy flows through it, making the &b&lKelp Golem&r&f one of the most powerful allies beneath the waves."
	]
	quest.76872CA4361744B8.quest_subtitle: "&f&lLocate or build a &b&lKelp Golem&r&f&l and witness its transformation under a &b&lConduit&r"
	quest.76872CA4361744B8.title: "&6&lQuest: The Ocean's Sentinel - Kelp Golem"
	quest.76BF0C8F23EBFE24.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &6&lTwilight Knight Stronghold&r&f (also called the &8&lDark Forest Tower&r&f) is a huge fortified dungeon hidden deep inside the &8&lDark Forest&r&f. It is tricky to spot, often buried under the thick canopy and shadows."
		""
		"To enter this difficult structure, you must first have defeated the &6&lTwilight Lich&r&f. Once you find the tower, you can unlock the sealed entrance by placing a boss &6&lTrophy&r&f on the nearby pedestal, or you can mine through the outer walls to make your own doorway. Be ready for strange mobs like &7&lHelmet Crabs&r&f and &7&lGoblin Knights&r&f that defend this fortress."
	]
	quest.76BF0C8F23EBFE24.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind the &6&lTwilight Knight Stronghold&r&f&l structure in the &8&lDark Forest&r&f&l"
	quest.76BF0C8F23EBFE24.title: "&7&lQuest: Infiltrating the Twilight Knight Stronghold"
	quest.76CC88E734548330.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Whispers in the tunnels speak of a hidden record, a disc called &a&lGloomper Anthem&r&f. The only way to claim it is by using this disc on a &a&lGloomper&r&f, a strange subterranean cow that lumbers through the depths."
		""
		"Track down the disc, track down the Gloomper, and bring them together. Do it right, and you will unlock the true soundtrack of the deep."
	]
	quest.76CC88E734548330.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain the &a&lsecret music disc&r&f&l"
	quest.76CC88E734548330.title: "&7&lQuest: Death Gloomps"
	quest.77575C8DF6CCC44D.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&e&lUmvuthi, the Sunbird&r (formerly Barako, the Sun Chief) is a major boss and the creator of the Abayuthana.&r He sits on his throne in the Umvuthana Grove, attacking any nearby hostile mobs or players who are not wearing an Umvuthana mask&r.&r"
		""
		"Umvuthi channels solar power, striking with Sunstrikes, Solar Flares, and a devastating Solar Beam, with his Supernova attack pulling players inward before detonating in a huge blast.&r When his health falls to 75% or less he summons Umvuthana Cranes that grant him an unbreakable shield until they are slain&r.&r"
		""
		"Defeating Umvuthi causes him to drop the Sol Visage mask, and all nearby Abayuthana followers die alongside their creator.&r Bring strong defenses and mobility to survive his explosive solar magic and claim the mask as proof of victory&r.&r"
	]
	quest.77575C8DF6CCC44D.quest_subtitle: "&l&fDefeat &e&lUmvuthi, the Sunbird&r&l&f, the powerful heliomancer boss&r"
	quest.77575C8DF6CCC44D.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying Umvuthi, the Sunbird"
	quest.77961CEE4084D673.quest_desc: [
		"Lost beneath the scorching sands lies the &6Desert Ruins&f — an ancient site built by forgotten civilizations."
		"At its center rests a mysterious chest, but beware: opening it may trigger an &cexplosion&f that could seal your fate."
		""
		"Around the ruins, you’ll find clusters of &dSuspicious Sand&f hiding precious relics and the legendary &eCrusher Egg&f."
		"Use your &6Brush&f carefully to uncover these secrets and reveal what was buried by time."
	]
	quest.77961CEE4084D673.quest_subtitle: "&7&oFind Structure — Desert Ruins."
	quest.77961CEE4084D673.title: "&6&lQuest: The Desert Ruins"
	quest.779F3AC37765002F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fYour ultimate fire challenge waits in the &c&lBurning Arena&r, a massive colosseum that generates in the &c&lNether Wastes&r. &fYou must use the &c&lEye of Fire&r to locate this formidable structure&r."
		""
		"&fThe Arena has multiple rising floors, and you will have to fight your way up against &c&lIgnited Revenants&r along the path&r. &fThis structure is the key to summoning &c&lIgnis&r, the fearsome fire knight boss, by using &c&lBurning Ashes&r on the &c&lAltar of Fire &fat the Arena’s peak&r. &fPrepare for one of the mod’s most demanding boss encounters&r."
	]
	quest.779F3AC37765002F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind the &c&lBurning Arena &fstructure in the Nether Wastes biome&r"
	quest.779F3AC37765002F.title: "&4&lQuest: Locating the Burning Arena"
	quest.7815E7F237FE246F.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lEngineer’s Manual&r is one of the most valuable tools in &b&lImmersive Engineering&r. It acts as your &e&lin game guidebook&r, packed with detailed information about every block, machine, and item the mod adds."
		""
		"From &e&lpower generation&r and resource processing to &e&lmultiblock construction&r and &e&lredstone integration&r, this manual walks you through it all, making it an essential companion for any aspiring engineer. With clear explanations and crafting details, it is almost as handy as a real player guide."
		""
		"Keep it in your inventory to quickly check &e&lrecipes&r, diagrams, and technical notes as you progress through your industrial journey. Use &a&lJEI&r to see how to craft this indispensable book."
	]
	quest.7815E7F237FE246F.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft the &b&lEngineer’s Manual&r"
	quest.7815E7F237FE246F.title: "&9&lQuest: Engineer’s Manual"
	quest.781B4F339D4F4FCB.quest_desc: [
		"&rBefore you can delve into rituals, you need the two basic materials of Malum: Soul Stone and Runewood Logs."
		""
		"Soul Stone is a relatively common ore found in caves. Smelting it yields a Processed Soulstone."
		""
		"Runewood is obtained from specific trees found in plains and other temperate biomes. The logs can be peeled, and when smelted, create Arcin Charcoal, which smelts 16 items."
	]
	quest.781B4F339D4F4FCB.quest_subtitle: "&7Collect Soul Stone and Runewood Logs."
	quest.781B4F339D4F4FCB.title: "&6&lQuest: &r&4The Basic Components 🌳🪨"
	quest.7831E4B34191DA40.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lCrafting CPU&r is the core of autocraft in &b&lApplied Energistics 2&r. It manages crafting requests, stores intermediate ingredients, and determines how complex and large your crafting jobs can be."
		""
		"These CPUs are multiblocks, they must form a rectangular prism containing at least one &b&lCrafting Storage Block&r."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"&b&lCrafting CPUs&r are made from the following components:"
		""
		"(Required):"
		""
		"- &e&lCrafting Storages&r — come in all standard cell sizes: 1k, 4k, 16k, 64k, and 256k. They hold the items and intermediate materials during crafting. Larger or multiple storages let your CPU handle bigger or more complex jobs."
		""
		"(Optional):"
		""
		"- &b&lCrafting Co-Processing Units&r — make the system send out more ingredient batches at once. This allows multiple &b&lMolecular Assemblers&r to work simultaneously, improving crafting speed."
		""
		"- &b&lCrafting Monitors&r — display the current crafting job in progress. They can even be colored using a &b&lColor Applicator&r."
		""
		"- &b&lCrafting Units&r — filler blocks that help shape your CPU into a proper rectangular prism."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Each &b&lCrafting CPU&r multiblock handles one crafting job at a time. So, if you want to craft &b&lCalculation Processors&r and &b&lSmooth Stone&r simultaneously, you will need &e&l2 separate CPUs&r."
		""
		"You can configure them to handle crafting requests from:"
		""
		"- &e&lPlayers&r (via terminals)"
		""
		"- &e&lAutomation systems&r (via Export Buses or Interfaces)"
		""
		"- &e&lOr both!&r"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Building multiple CPUs with different &b&lCrafting Storage&r and &b&lCo-Processor&r combinations gives you flexible control over how your system handles parallel jobs. Experiment with different layouts to find what works best for your base!"
	]
	quest.7831E4B34191DA40.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft and assemble a &b&lCrafting CPU&r &f&lmultiblock for your autocraft system&r"
	quest.7831E4B34191DA40.title: "&9&lThe Crafting CPU"
	quest.788BF9D502581B3E.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fHidden among the red plateaus of the &6&lBadlands&r&f lies an ancient and mysterious site, the &6&lBadlands Temple&r&f. Its walls are filled with secrets of a lost civilization and layers of &d&lSuspicious Red Sand&r&f waiting to be unearthed."
		""
		"&fSearch the temple carefully. Within its chambers and beneath the surface lies an &6&lunderground floor&r&f full of hidden treasures. Use your &a&lPaintbrush&r&f to reveal ancient relics such as the &a&lJaw Pottery Fragment&r&f or the &e&lEater Egg&r&f."
		""
		"&fEvery brush stroke brings you closer to awakening the ancient guardian of the desert."
	]
	quest.788BF9D502581B3E.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind structure - &6&lBadlands Temple&r"
	quest.788BF9D502581B3E.title: "&6&lQuest: The Badlands Temple"
	quest.78F15F83956C3297.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fLove is in the air! With the &6&lMatchmaker's Ring&r&f, you can help two lonely villagers find their perfect match. This special item allows you to &a&lmarry two unmarried villagers&r&f when used correctly."
		""
		"&fTo craft it, place &c&l8 Iron Ingots&r&f around the edges of the crafting grid, leaving the center empty. Once crafted, make sure you have &a&l2 Matchmaker's Rings&r&f in your inventory, one for each villager."
		""
		"&fStand near two unmarried villagers, open one's interaction menu, choose &a&lInteract → Gift&r&f, and give them the ring. Both rings will disappear, and the two villagers will instantly marry each other!"
		""
		"&fNote: The ring only works in survival mode. In creative mode, villagers will not accept it unless you temporarily switch to survival."
		""
		"&fBring happiness to your village, one marriage at a time!"
	]
	quest.78F15F83956C3297.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft a &6&lMatchmaker's Ring&r&f to arrange a marriage between two unmarried villagers&r"
	quest.78F15F83956C3297.title: "&6&lQuest: Craft the Matchmaker's Ring"
	quest.79DE077C27054567.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &7&lAptrgangr&r&f is a formidable, axe‑wielding mini‑boss that stalks the &b&lFrosted Prison&r&f.&r This juggernaut has &c&l160 Health&r&f and &7&l16 Armor&r&f, turning every encounter with it into a serious test of your gear and timing.&r"
		""
		"The &7&lAptrgangr&r&f uses a mix of brutal attacks, including a heavy melee strike with &e&lknockback&r&f, a ground slam that calls in &d&ldodgeable projectiles&r&f, and a deadly &c&lcharge attack&r&f where it grabs you and smashes you into a wall.&r You must defeat this monster to obtain the crucial &d&lStrange Key&r&f, the only item that can open the &8&lDoor of Seal&r&f leading to the &3&lMaledictus&r&f boss room.&r On victory, it also drops &8&lBlack Steel&r&f nuggets and ingots, which are essential for advanced crafting.&r"
	]
	quest.79DE077C27054567.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat an &7&lAptrgangr&r&f&l mini‑boss and claim the &d&lStrange Key&r&f&l&r"
	quest.79DE077C27054567.title: "&4&lQuest: Slaying the Aptrgangr"
	quest.7A63D2F74022D0DD.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &8&lDark Forest&r&f is one of the most dangerous biomes in the &2&lTwilight Forest&r&f. A canopy of &8&lDarkwood&r&f trees completely blocks the sky, leaving the ground in constant darkness and causing very high rates of hostile mob spawns."
		""
		"To reach this tough area, search for an unusually dense patch of forest. This is also the only place where the challenging &8&lDark Towers&r&f can appear, and you will run into special mobs like &7&lMist Wolves&r&f and &7&lKing Spiders&r&f that are unique to this biome. Bring more light than you think you need—the shadows here really do bite."
	]
	quest.7A63D2F74022D0DD.quest_subtitle: "&f&lVisit the &8&lDark Forest&r&f&l biome and survive its endless night"
	quest.7A63D2F74022D0DD.title: "&7&lQuest: Venturing into the Dark Forest"
	quest.7A91A1E29C2F4454.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &c&lCreaking&r&f is a haunting creature bound to the Creaking Heart. It awakens when you look at it at night within the Pale Garden."
		""
		"&fIt freezes when observed, but attack it and its heart will respond with resin and rage. Face the Creaking but don't look away."
	]
	quest.7A91A1E29C2F4454.quest_subtitle: "&f&lFind or spawn a &c&lCreaking&r&f&l mob at night"
	quest.7A91A1E29C2F4454.title: "&6&lQuest: Encounter the Creaking"
	quest.7B20B97FE4F47C12.quest_desc: [
		""
		"To command the destructive side of fire magic, you need guidance from the Nether’s own elementals.&r The &c&lBlaze Instruction Manual&r is a powerful spellbook that only drops as a rare reward from Blazes in the Nether&r.&r"
		""
		"Equip this tome to gain a strong boost to Fire spell power and a big increase to your maximum mana.&r Brave the scorching dimension, hunt down Blazes, and secure this manual to become a true Pyromancer&r.&r"
	]
	quest.7B20B97FE4F47C12.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain a &c&lBlaze Instruction Manual&r&l&f as a rare drop from a Blaze&r"
	quest.7B20B97FE4F47C12.title: "&5&lQuest: The Blaze Instruction Manual"
	quest.7BCC5D856EC74DB6.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fAre you ready to meet the incredible creatures that once roamed the Overworld? Inspired by the &e&lSniffer&r&f, this mod brings a variety of &6&lmagical and magnificent ancient beasts&r&f back to life!"
		""
		"&fYour journey begins by locating the remnants of a &e&llost age&r&f. Each creature from this prehistory brings with it &a&lamazing new features and possibilities&r&f for exploration and crafting. Begin your &e&lfossil hunt&r&f and awaken the power of the ancient world!"
	]
	quest.7BCC5D856EC74DB6.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &6&lWan's Ancient Beasts&r&f&l mod and meet the creatures of prehistory&r"
	quest.7BCC5D856EC74DB6.title: "&a&lWelcome to Wan’s Ancient Beasts"
	quest.7C4E80C72DBAEE61.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &0&lBlack Moa&f&r is one of the rarest and most majestic mounts in the &b&lAether&f&r. Thanks to its &a&ltriple jump&f&r, skilled riders can soar much higher and farther than with most other mounts. "
		""
		"Tame it, put on a &6&lsaddle&f&r, and take to the skies on this legendary creature to truly master the floating islands."
	]
	quest.7C4E80C72DBAEE61.quest_subtitle: "&f&lMount and ride a &0&lBlack Moa&f"
	quest.7C4E80C72DBAEE61.title: "&7&lQuest: Ride a Black Moa"
	quest.7C8E760D95493B57.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Mobstein is a mod that breathes new life into some of Minecraft’s most overlooked mobs.&r Using a special resurrection system, you can revive enhanced versions of creatures such as Axolotls, Dolphins, Ocelots, Bats, and even Golems&r.&r"
		""
		"Each resurrected mob gains unique abilities and behaviors that expand how you play, turning familiar creatures into powerful companions or challenges.&r Your adventure starts by learning Mobstein’s magic and crafting the tools needed to pull these upgraded beasts back from the brink&r.&r"
	]
	quest.7C8E760D95493B57.quest_subtitle: "&l&fDiscover the &a&lMobstein Mod&r&l&f and begin the resurrection process&r"
	quest.7C8E760D95493B57.title: "&5&lWelcome to Mobstein Mobs"
	quest.7CAA5421CC739F5D.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lCrude Blast Furnace&r is your first major step toward &e&lSteel production&r in &b&lImmersive Engineering&r. This powerful 3x3x3 multiblock structure allows you to smelt &e&lIron&r with &b&lCoal Coke&r to create &b&lSteel&r, a vital resource for advanced machinery."
		""
		"To build it, you will need &e&l27 Blast Bricks&r arranged in a solid cube. Once placed, use your &b&lEngineer's Hammer&r on the front face to complete the multiblock structure."
		""
		"When active, the furnace slowly refines &e&lIron Ingots&r and &b&lCoal Coke&r into &b&lSteel Ingots&r and produces &e&lSlug&r as a byproduct. Patience is key, it is slow but it is the first real step into industrial grade engineering."
	]
	quest.7CAA5421CC739F5D.quest_subtitle: "&f&lConstruct a &b&lCrude Blast Furnace&f multiblock&r"
	quest.7CAA5421CC739F5D.title: "&9&lQuest: Crude Blast Furnace"
	quest.7CB1536AC8EFF674.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Your &6&lSlingshot&r&f hides a surprising amount of power. Find a way to push the damage of a single Depthrock Pebble as high as possible, maybe with smart positioning or the right enchantments."
		""
		"Land one perfect shot that deals &c&l20+ damage&r&f in a single hit. Pull it off and you can proudly call yourself the Undergarden’s master sniper."
	]
	quest.7CB1536AC8EFF674.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDeal &c&l20 or more damage&r&f&l to something with a single &7&lpebble&r&f&l"
	quest.7CB1536AC8EFF674.title: "&7&lQuest: Sniping's a Good Job"
	quest.7CFD68E1AD23ACB0.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to &6&lJewelry&r&f, where every gem you dig up can boost your combat power. The goal in this mod is to collect over 25 new pieces of &6&ljewelry&r&f, each giving a different combat-related bonus."
		""
		"To get started, head underground and search for new &b&lGem Veins&r&f near diamond level, which are rarer but can drop any of six precious gems. Combine these gems with &6&lGold&r&f or &8&lNetherite&r&f to forge powerful &6&lRings&r&f and &6&lNecklaces&r&f."
		""
		"Also watch for dungeon loot and exotic spots like &5&lEnd City&r&f chests, which may contain special unique pieces that cannot be crafted at all. So start mining, start crafting, and load your character up with shiny, practical power."
	]
	quest.7CFD68E1AD23ACB0.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &6&lJewelry&r&f&l mod and craft your first piece of ornate gear"
	quest.7CFD68E1AD23ACB0.title: "&a&lThe Jewelcrafter's Debut"
	quest.7D150E343E929272.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Welcome to &c&lBosses of Mass Destruction&r&f, a mod that adds new, challenging &c&lbosses&r&f across the Overworld, Nether, and End.&r Your adventure really begins when you start tracking down these powerful foes.&r"
		""
		"You will face enemies like the &5&lNight Lich&r&f, &8&lObsidilith&r&f, &4&lNether Gauntlet&r&f, and &d&lVoid Blossom&r&f.&r Some of them, such as the &5&lNight Lich&r&f, live in special structures like the &5&lLich Tower&r&f, which you can even turn into a pretty cool base once it is cleared.&r Defeating these threats rewards you with extremely powerful items, from blocks that grant &b&lcreative flight&r&f to spears that let you &a&lteleport through walls&r&f.&r Prepare for mass destruction.&r"
	]
	quest.7D150E343E929272.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDiscover the &c&lBosses of Mass Destruction&r&f&l mod and begin the hunt&r"
	quest.7D150E343E929272.title: "&4&lWelcome to Bosses of Mass Destruction"
	quest.7D4C90A80A6239A7.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lSnow Queen&r&f is the current final boss of the &2&lTwilight Forest&r&f, with 250 health. She waits at the top of one of the palace towers, which stand in the center of the frozen &b&lIce Biomes&r&f."
		""
		"The battle has two phases. In the first, she rides on an &b&lice cloud&r&f that shields her from attacks coming from below and summons &b&lIce Crystals&r&f that distract you and slowly heal her."
		""
		"In the second phase (when her health drops to 125), she fires snow from her hands and can launch herself into the air, dropping down quickly and risking a crushing hit with her cloud. To defeat her, stay patient and wait for her to descend so you can strike with a sword, or keep your distance and shoot her with a bow."
		""
		"When you finally win, she can drop the &b&lSnow Queen Trophy&r&f, the &d&lTri-bow&r&f, and the &d&lSeeker Bow&r&f as proof that you have mastered the frozen skies."
	]
	quest.7D4C90A80A6239A7.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the &b&lSnow Queen&r&f&l boss at the top of the &d&lAurora Palace&r&f&l"
	quest.7D4C90A80A6239A7.title: "&7&lQuest: Defeating the Snow Queen"
	quest.7DCA2C8880BE413D.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Before mastering the arcane arts, every mage starts with a humble &f&lFlimsy Journal&r.&r This simple spellbook is your first step into the world of &b&lIron Spells ’n Spellbooks&r, letting you store and use basic spells&r.&r"
		""
		"You can find it as dungeon loot, inside early structures, or craft it from common materials.&r It may be fragile, but it carries the spark for your very first spells—enough to one day grow into real magical power&r.&r"
	]
	quest.7DCA2C8880BE413D.quest_subtitle: "&l&fObtain the &f&lFlimsy Journal&r&l&f&r"
	quest.7DCA2C8880BE413D.title: "&5&lQuest: First Steps into Spellcraft"
	quest.7E01EFB688CB8237.quest_desc: [
		""
		"The &b&lAlpha Yeti&r&f is a tough boss that lives in the &b&lYeti Lair&r&f, found in the &f&lSnowy Forest&r&f biome. It is a huge yeti with six blue horns and 200 health, so it will not go down quietly."
		""
		"To start the fight, you must have already defeated the &6&lTwilight Lich&r&f (or the &c&lUr-Ghast&r&f in older versions). The Alpha Yeti has two main attack phases:"
		""
		"Ranged/Immune phase: It throws &b&lIce Bombs&r&f that freeze the ground and can toss you into the air if you get too close. During this phase, it is immune to damage from arrows."
		""
		"Melee/Vulnerable phase: It goes on a short rampage, flailing its arms for 5 damage and jumping hard enough to break nearby blocks. After that, it briefly sits down, becoming vulnerable to all attacks."
		""
		"When you finally bring it down, the Alpha Yeti drops six pieces of &b&lAlpha Yeti Fur&r&f and six &b&lIce Bombs&r&f, and its defeat also unlocks access to the &d&lAurora Palace&r&f."
	]
	quest.7E01EFB688CB8237.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the &b&lAlpha Yeti&r&f&l boss in the &b&lYeti Lair&r&f&l"
	quest.7E01EFB688CB8237.title: "&7&lQuest: Slaying the Alpha Yeti"
	quest.7EC289132658E536.quest_desc: [
		""
		"When you defeat the &c&lNaga&r&f boss, it drops all of its loot in the center of the courtyard. You can use these trophies to craft and then equip the full set of &2&lNaga Armor&r&f."
		""
		"This armor is a big step up in power and will make you much tougher for the bosses that come next. If you want to wear a complete set and stay well prepared, it is a good idea to slay two extra &c&lNagas&r&f beyond the one required for the main quest."
	]
	quest.7EC289132658E536.quest_subtitle: "&f&lCraft and equip a full set of &2&lNaga Armor&r&f&l"
	quest.7EC289132658E536.title: "&7&lQuest: Forging the Naga Armor"
	quest.7ED936DF47113FBC.quest_desc: [
		""
		"You have stepped into the Warden’s territory, but only the boldest act of defiance will earn the ultimate trophy. The &1&lWarden&r&f, terrifying guardian of the &9&lAncient City&r&f, carries the &9&lHeart of the Deep&r&f, a dark pulsing organ that drops when it finally falls."
		""
		"Move in silence, steady your nerves, and face this monster head on. Claim its heart and prove that you truly rule the deepest dark; this relic is the only proof the shadows will respect."
	]
	quest.7ED936DF47113FBC.quest_subtitle: "&f&lObtain a &9&lHeart of the Deep&r&f&l"
	quest.7ED936DF47113FBC.title: "&7&lQuest: Obtain the Heart of the Deep"
	quest.7EDB8663F95B69FE.quest_desc: [
		""
		"&fThe &b&lFreezer&r&f is a powerful utility block capable of infusing items with the chilling essence of the &b&lAether&r&f."
		""
		"&fBy combining it with &b&lIcestone&r&f, you can create frozen accessories like the &b&lIce Pendant&r&f or &b&lIce Ring&r&f, items that grant protection and power drawn from the cold skies themselves."
	]
	quest.7EDB8663F95B69FE.quest_subtitle: "&f&lUse a &b&lFreezer&r&f &land &b&lIcestone&r&f &lto freeze an accessory, obtain an &b&lIce Pendant&r&f &lor &b&lIce Ring&r&f"
	quest.7EDB8663F95B69FE.title: "&7&lQuest: Frozen Finesse"
	quest.7F326C3B8BFA04D8.quest_desc: [
		"While exploring the &6Desert Ruins&f, use your &6Brush&f to uncover the secrets buried within the &dSuspicious Sand&f."
		"Among the relics of the past, you may find a rare &eCrusher Egg&f — a remnant of an ancient, spiked creature that once roamed the deserts."
		""
		"Handle it with care… for when it hatches, a new age of power may awaken beneath the dunes."
	]
	quest.7F326C3B8BFA04D8.quest_subtitle: "&7&oFind a Crusher Egg in Suspicious Sand."
	quest.7F326C3B8BFA04D8.title: "&6&lQuest: The Crusher Egg"
	quest.7FFC0B9521C66016.quest_desc: [
		""
		"Deep within the &6&lBronze Dungeon&r&f lies the &6&lSlider&r&f, a massive ancient guardian forged entirely from stone. It has &c&l400 health&r&f and can only be damaged with a &7&lpickaxe&r&f, so come prepared. Defeat this powerful foe to claim your &6&lBronze Key&r&f, &a&l4 levels of experience&r&f, and &7&l8 Carved Stone&r&f as proof of your victory."
	]
	quest.7FFC0B9521C66016.quest_subtitle: "&f&lDefeat the &6&lSlider&f, the boss of the &6&lBronze Dungeon&f"
	quest.7FFC0B9521C66016.title: "&7&lQuest: The First Challenge, The Bronze Dungeon!"
